  <para style="h">Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yer</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />Aya ni amajambo ya Yeremiya mwene Hilukiya, umwe mu baherezi baba ahantu hitwa Anatoti mu ntara ya Benyamini. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri we mu mwaka ugira cumi na gatatu Yosiya mwene Amoni umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" />no ku ngoma ya Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda. Ryongeye gutumwa kuri we mu kwezi kwa gatanu kw’umwaka ugira icumi na rimwe Zedekiya mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, kandi ico gihe ni ho abantu b’i Yerusalemu batwarwa ari inyagano mu mahanga.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihamagarwa rya Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryanjeko, riti:<verse eid="JER 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“Ntarakubumbira mu nda nari ndakuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">n’imbere y’uko uvuka nari naramaze kukurobanura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">naguhisemwo ngo ube umuvugishwa wanje ku mahanga.”<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />Ndavuga nti: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, jewe sinzi kuvuga, kandi ndacari muto.”<verse eid="JER 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Reka kuvuga uti: ‘Ndacari muto.’ Uzoja ku wo nzogutumako umubwire ico nzogutuma cose. <verse eid="JER 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Ntuze ubatinye, kuko ndi kumwe nawe kandi nzogutabara,” ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mbivuze.<verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azana ukuboko kwiwe ankora ku munwa ambwira ati: “Ehe, nshize amajambo yanje mu kanwa kawe. <verse eid="JER 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Ehe, uwu musi ndagutumye ku mahanga no ku bwami kurandura no gusambura, gutikiza no gusangangura, kwubaka no guteragira.”<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Hanyuma Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kunzako riti: “Ubona iki, ga Yeremiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:11">Ndishura nti: “Mbona ishami ry’igiti ca alumonde.”<verse eid="JER 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Ivyo ubonye ni vyo, kuko nteramira ijambo ryanje kugira ngo mbone ko rishitse.”<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rinzako kandi riti: “Ubona iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Ndishura nti: “Mbona inkono iriko irabira, iri ku ruhande rwo mu buraruko.”<verse eid="JER 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ati: “Ivyago bizoza bivuye mu buraruko bije ku baba muri iki gihugu bose. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Ngira mpamagare amahanga yose y’abami bo mu buraruko,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">“Abami baho bazoza bashinge intebe zabo z’ubwami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">ku marembo y’i Yerusalemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">bazoza kugwanya inzitiro zihakikije zose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">n’ibisagara vy’i Buyuda vyose.<verse eid="JER 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Nzocira imanza abantu banje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">kubera ububi bwabo berekanye mu kumpeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">bagaturirira ibimota neza izindi mana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">kandi bagasenga ivyabajwe n’amaboko yabo.”<verse eid="JER 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />“None rero, wewe niwitegure! Va hasi ubabwire ivyo nzogutegeka vyose. Ntuze uterwe ubwoba na bo, kugira ngo sinze ndaguteze ubwoba imbere yabo. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Uyu musi ndaguhinduye igisagara kizitijwe inzitiro, inkingi y’icuma n’uruhome rw’umwakaka ngo uhagarare uhange iki gihugu cose; uhange abami b’i Buyuda, abaganwa baho, abaherezi baho n’abantu bo mu gihugu. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Bazokugwanya ariko ntibazogutsinda, kuko ndi kumwe nawe ngo ngutabare,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli baheba Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rinzako riti: <verse eid="JER 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" />“Genda umenyeshe ab’i Yerusalemu uti:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 2:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 2:2">Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">‘Ndibuka ubwizigirwa bwawe ukiri muto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">uburyo wankunda ukiri umugeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">ukankurikira mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">mu gihugu kitamera.<verse eid="JER 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />Isirayeli yari uwera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">yari ivyeze imbere y’ibindi mu vyimburwa vyiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">abamukorako bose baba bancumuyeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">kandi icago caca kibahwikira,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe abakomoka kuri Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:4">na mwebwe mwese nzu za Isirayeli.<verse eid="JER 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">“Ba sogokuruza banyu nabacumuyeko iki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">catumye baguma kure yanje?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Bakurikiye ibigirwamana bitagira ikimazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">na bo baba abatagira ikimazi.<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />Ntibabajije bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari hehe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">umwe yatudugana adukuye muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">akaturongora mu bugaragwa bwumye ata kintu na kimwe kihamera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">mu gihugu c’ubugaragwa n’ibihomoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">igihugu cumye c’umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">igihugu kitagendwa kandi kitabamwo abantu?’<verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Nakuzanye mu gihugu kimera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">ngo urye ivyamwa vyaco n’ivyimburwa vyaco.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Ariko waraje uhumanya igihugu canje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">uhindura ishamvu yanje aho kwankwa.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />Abaherezi ntibabajije bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari he?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Abari bashinzwe Ivyagezwe ntibigeze bamenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">abarongozi barangararije.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Abavugishwa na bo bavugishwa mw’izina rya Bayali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">bakurikira ibigirwamana bitagira ikimazi.<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />Ni co gituma nzokwongera kubaburanya,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">“Nzoburanya abana b’abana bawe.<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Jabuka uje i Kupuro urabe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">rungika intumwa i Kedari wihweze neza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">raba ko higeze kuba ikintu nk’iki:<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Mbega hari ihanga ryigeze rihindura imana zaryo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">naho atari imana mu vy’ukuri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Ariko abantu banje, jewe Imana y’Ubwiza bangujije</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">n’ibigirwamana bitagira ikimazi.<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />Kubera ivyo, nimuhinde agashitsi, yemwe mwa majuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">mugire ubwoba mutangare,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />“Abantu banje bakoze ivyaha bibiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">barampevye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">jewe soko y’amazi y’ubugingo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">maze biyimbira ibinogo vyo kubika amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">ibinogo vyatobaguritse bidashobora kuzigama amazi.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />Mbega Isirayeli ni umushumba, ni umugurano kuva akivuka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:14">None ni kuki yahindutse uwo gusahurwa?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Intambwe zarivuze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">zikamutontomera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Zahinduye igihugu ciwe umusaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">ibisagara vyiwe vyaraturiwe kandi nta bantu bakibibamwo.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Kandi, Abanyegiputa b’i Memfisi n’i Tafanihesi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:16">bakumenye umutwe.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Mbega vyose si wewe wavyikwegeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">mu guheba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">igihe yakurongorera mu nzira?<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />None ni kuki uja muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">kunywa amazi y’uruzi Nili?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Kandi ni kuki uja muri Ashuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">Kunywa amazi y’uruzi Efurate?<verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Ubugarariji bwawe ni bwo buzoguhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">gusubira inyuma kwawe ni kwo kuzogutsinda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Iyumvire rero umenye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">ingene ari bibi kandi bibishe kuri wewe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">guheba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">kuko ata kuntinya kuri muri wewe,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />“Hashize igihe kirekire waravunye ingogo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">waraciye iminyororo yawe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">Waravuze uti: ‘sinzogukorera!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Ni ukuri, ku musozi wose muremure</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">no musi y’igiti cose gitotahaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">ni ho wiryamira nka maraya.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />Nari naguteye uri umuzabibu w’indobanurwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">wavuye mu mbuto nziza zo kwizigirwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">None ni kuki wambereye nabi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">ugahinduka umuzabibu w’ikijakija wo mw’ishamba?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />Naho wokwiyogesha isabuni nziza cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">ugakoresha ivyo kwinyukura bikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">umwanda wo kugabitanya kwawe woguma imbere yanje,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />“Wovuga gute ngo: ‘Simpumanye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">sinahurumbiye za Bayali’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Raba uko wigenjeje mu kiyaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">raba ivyo wakoze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Uri ingamiya y’ingore inyaruka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">yiruka hirya no hino,<verse eid="JER 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />indogoba y’inyeshamba yamenyereye ubugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">yumviriza mu muyaga iyo impfizi iri mu gihe igomba kwima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">kandi imaze gushaka kwima nta coyitururuza ngo itekane?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Kandi impfizi zose ziyikurikira ntizirinda kuruha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">mu gihe co kuyimya zizoyironka vyoroshe.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />Ntiwiruke gushika aho ibirenge vyawe bigira amabavu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">n’umuhogo wawe ukuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Ariko waravuze uti: ‘Reka kwigora!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">Nkunda imana z’inyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">kandi nzoziruka inyuma.’<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />Nk’uko igisuma giteterwa iyo gifashwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">ni ko inzu ya Isirayeli iteterewe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">n’abami babo n’abaganwa babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">abaherezi babo n’abavugishwa babo.<verse eid="JER 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />Babwira ibiti bati: ‘Uri data,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">n’ibuye bati: ‘Ni we wamvyaye.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Banteye ibitugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">ntibampindukiriye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">ariko iyo batewe n’ivyago, baca bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">‘Nuze udukize!’<verse eid="JER 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />None za mana zanyu mwikoreye ziri hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">Nizibakize nimba zobishobora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">mu gihe c’ingorane zanyu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Kuko wewe Buyuda ufise imana nyinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">zingana n’ibisagara vyawe.<verse eid="JER 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />Ni igiki unyagiriza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">Mwese mwarangararije,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />“Igihano nahanye abantu bawe nta co camaze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">ntibemeye gukosorwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Inkota yawe yariye ba kamenyi bawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">nk’intambwe yaratse.<verse eid="JER 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />Yemwe abo muri uru runganwe, nimwumvirize ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Mbega nabereye Isirayeli ubugaragwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">canke igihugu c’umwijima mwinshi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Ni igiki gituma abantu banje bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">‘Tuzoja aho dushaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">ntituzosubira kugaruka iwawe’?<verse eid="JER 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Mbega inkumi yokwibagira kwambara ibituma iberwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">umugeni akibagira ivyo kwishariza ku musi w’ubukwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Ariko abantu banje baranyibagiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">kumara imisi itoharurwa.<verse eid="JER 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Ese ukugene uzi kwironderera abo wikundira!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:33">N’umugore w’igipfu yokwigirako ingene akwiye kwigenza.<verse eid="JER 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />Ku mpuzu zawe abantu basangako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">amaraso y’abatagira icaha kandi b’abakene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">naho ata co wabafatanye nk’ikosa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Kandi naho bimeze uko,<verse eid="JER 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />uravuga uti: ‘Nta co niyagiriza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntakinshavuriye.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Ariko nzogucira urubanza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">kuko uvuga uti: ‘Sinacumuye.’<verse eid="JER 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />Ni igiki gituma ugenda wangara hirya no hino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">uhindura inzira zawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Uzohemukirwa na Egiputa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">nk’uko wahemukiwe na Ashuri.<verse eid="JER 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Uzova muri ico kibanza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">wikoreye amaboko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahevye abo wizigiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">nta co bazokuvuna.<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />Umugabo yirukanye umugore wiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">maze akarongorwa n’uwundi mugabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">mbega yosubira kumugarukana bakabana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">Mbega igihugu nticoca kirushiriza guhumana rwose?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Ariko wewe wabaye maraya, ufise abo wikundira benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">mbega wongarukako?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza.<verse eid="JER 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />“Unamura amaso urabe impinga z’imisozi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">Mbega hoba hariho ahantu utahumanije?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Wicara ku nzira urindiriye abo wipfuza ukunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">wicara nk’umuntu yangara mu bugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Wahumanije igihugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">ugihumanishije ubusambanyi bwawe n’ibibi vyawe.<verse eid="JER 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Ni co catumye imvura ibura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">n’imvura y’impeshi ntiyagwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Ariko mu maso hawe biraboneka ko uri maraya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">mugabo ntunamaramara.<verse eid="JER 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />Mbega ntiwamye umpamagara ngo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:4">‘Data, mukunzi wanje wo kuva nkiri muto,<verse eid="JER 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />mbega uzokwama ushavuye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">Mbega uburake bwawe ni ubw’ibihe vyose?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Uko ni ko uvuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">ariko ugakora ibibi uko ushoboye kwose.”<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutaba umwizigirwa kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />Ku ngoma y’umwami Yosiya, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarambwiye ati: “Wabonye ivyo Isirayeli mutizigirwa yakoze? Yagiye ku musozi muremure wose no musi y’igiti cose gitotahaye maze asambanirayo. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />Nibajije ko ahejeje gukora ivyo vyose azongarukako ariko si ko vyagenze, maze murumunawe Yuda arabibona. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Nahaye ikete ryo kwahukana Isirayeli maze ndamwirukana kubera ubusambanyi bwiwe bwose. Ariko nabonye na murumunawe Yuda mutizigirwa atigeze atinya; na we nyene yagiye mu vyo gusambana. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />Kuko ubuhumbu bwa Isirayeli ata co bwamubwiye kinini, yahumanije igihugu asambana n’amabuye n’ibiti. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Naho vyabaye uko, murumunawe Yuda ntiyangarutseko n’umutima wiwe wose, atari mu majambo gusa,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Isirayeli mutizera ntakiri umugororotsi kurusha mutizigirwa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />Genda mumenyeshe iyi nkuru mutumbereye mu buraruko muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">‘Garuka Isirayeli Mutizera,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Sinzosubira kukurakira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">kuko ndi umunyembabazi,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Sinzokwama ndatse ibihe vyose.<verse eid="JER 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Pfa kwemera icaha cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">ko wagararije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">wasanzaje ubwiza bwawe ku mana z’inyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">musi y’igiti cose gitotahaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">kandi ntiwanyumviye,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />“Nimungarukeko, mwa bana batizigirwa,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “kuko ndi shobuja. Nzobatoranya, ndabakure iyo mwasabagiriye, umwe ndamukure mu gisagara kimwe na babiri mu muryango umwe, maze ndabazane i Siyoni. <verse eid="JER 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />Hanyuma nzobaha abungere bahuye n’uko umutima wanje ugomba, bazobarongora mu kumenya no mu gutahura. <verse eid="JER 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />Muri iyo misi, ibitigiri vyanyu nivyamara kwongerekana cane mu gihugu,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “abantu ntibazosubira kuvuga ivy’Isandugu y’Isezerano ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntizosubira na rimwe kwinjira mu bwenge bwabo; ntizokwibukwa, kandi ntizosubirizwa. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />Muri ico gihe bazokwita Yerusalemu Umugwa w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi amahanga yose azokoranira i Yerusalemu ngo bahe icubahiro izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntibazosubira gukurikira ugukomantara kw’imitima yabo mibi. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />Muri iyo misi ab’inzu ya Yuda bazokwifatanya n’ab’inzu ya Isirayeli maze bose baze bavuye mu buraruko baze mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza babo kw’ishamvu.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />Ni jewe ubwanje navuze nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">‘Ese ukuntu binezera kugufata nk’umwana wanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">no kuguha igihugu ciza co kwipfuzwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">itongo rirusha ayandi yose kuba ryiza mu bihugu vyose.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Niyumvira ko muzonyita Data</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">kandi mutazontera ibitugu ngo mureke kunkurikira.<verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Ariko nk’uko umugore ahemukira umugabo wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">ni ko mwampemukiye, yemwe ab’inzu ya Isirayeli,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Urwamo rwumvikana ku dutwe tw’imisozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">Abisirayeli barira kandi batakamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">kuko banduje inzira zabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">kandi bibagiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />“Nimuhindukire, yemwe mwa bana batizerwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">nzobakiza ndabakuremwo ugusubira inyuma.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 3:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">“Egome, tuzokugarukako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">kuko uri <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu.<verse eid="JER 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Ni ukuri ugusenga ibigirwamana vyo ku dusozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">no ku misozi ni uruhendo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">ni ukuri agakiza k’Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">kari k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu.<verse eid="JER 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Kuva mu buto bwacu imana ziteye isoni ni zo zatikije</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">ivyavuye mu butame bwa ba sogokuruza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:24">zariye imikuku n’amasho vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">abahungu n’abakobwa babo.<verse eid="JER 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Reka twubame hasi kubera ibiteterwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">kandi ibimaramare vyacu bidutwikire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">Twacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">twebwe na ba sogokuruza bacu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">kuva mu buto bwacu gushika uwu musi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">ntitwumviye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu.”<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />“Nimba wewe, Isirayeli, ugomba guhindukira,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">“nungarukeko.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">“Nimwakuraho ibigirwamana bisesema imbere yanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">ntimusubire gukevya muta inzira,<verse eid="JER 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />kandi mu kuri kwose, mu nzira itunganye kandi igororotse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">mukarahira muvuga muti: ‘Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">nuko amahanga azohabwa umugisha n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">kandi muri we ni ho hazoba ivyirato vyabo.”<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ku bantu b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">“Nimumene imishike</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:3">kandi ntimubibe mu mahwa.<verse eid="JER 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />Nimukebwe mugaruke k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">Nimukebwe mu mitima yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">yemwe bantu b’i Buyuda na mwebwe b’i Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">kugira ngo uburake bwanje ntibururumbe bugaturira nk’umuriro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">kubera ibibi mwakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">bukarurumba ata wo kubuzimya.<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyago bizova mu buraruko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />Menyesha i Buyuda kandi ubivuge i Yerusalemu uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Vuza inzamba mu gihugu cose!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Semerera cane uvuge uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">Egeranira hamwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">Reka duhunge tuje mu bisagara bizitijwe inzitiro!’<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Manika ibendera ry’ikimenyetso i Siyoni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">Hunga mudatevye kugira ngo ntimugire ico muba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Kuko nzanye icago kivuye mu buraruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">kandi ni uguhonya guhambaye.”<verse eid="JER 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Intare ivuye mu kibundo cayo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">umuranduzi w’amahanga arasohotse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Yavuye iwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">ngo asangangure igihugu canyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Ibisagara vyanyu bizoba imisaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">ata muntu n’umwe akibibamwo.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Nuko nimwambare amagunira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">mucure intimba muboroge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">kuko uburake bw’inkazi bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">butaratuvako.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: “Kuri uwo musi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">umwami n’abaganwa bazocika intege,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:9">abaherezi bazogira ubwoba bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">na ba kamenyi bazoranduka imitima.”<verse eid="JER 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Maze ndavuga nti: “Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, ese ukuntu wahenze aba bantu n’ababa i Yerusalemu mu kubabwira uti: ‘Muzoba amahoro,’ kandi ahubwo inkota iri ku mazosi yacu!”<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Muri ico gihe aba bantu n’ababa i Yerusalemu bazobwirwa ngo: “Umuyaga uturira uvuye ku dutwe tw’imisozi yo mu bugaragwa uzohuha ku bantu banje, ariko ntikuzoba ari ukugosora canke kweza; <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />uzoba ari umuyaga uhambaye uje utegetswe nanje. Nzobashitsako urubanza rwanje.”<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Raba! Agenda nk’ibicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">imikogote yiwe igenda nk’agashururu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">amafarasi yiwe agenda anyaruka kurusha inkona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">Turagowe! Turahonye!<verse eid="JER 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />Yewe Yerusalemu, wiyuhagire ububi bwose bwo mu mutima wawe kugira ngo ukizwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:14">Uzogeza ryari kwigenera ivyiyumviro bibi?<verse eid="JER 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Ijwi rivugiye i Dani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:15">rimenyesha icago kivuye mu misozi y’i Efurayimu.<verse eid="JER 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />“Bibwire amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">bimenyeshe ab’i Yerusalemu uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">‘Ingabo zije gutera zivuye mu gihugu ca kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">urwamo rw’intambara ruje ku bisagara vy’i Buyuda.<verse eid="JER 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />Bahakikuje nk’abantu barinda umurima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">kuko yangararije,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />“Inyifato yanyu n’ibikorwa vyanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">ni vyo bitumye ivyo bibazako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Ico ni igihano canyu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Ese ukuntu kirura!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Ese ukuntu kinyengetera gushika mu mutima!<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />Ewe mubabaro wanje, ewe mubabaro wanje!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Uburibwe ni bwinshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Ese ingene umutima wanje usambagirika!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Umutima wanje uradihagizwa muri jewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">kandi sinshobora guhora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Kuko numvise ijwi ry’inzamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">numvise akamo k’intambara.<verse eid="JER 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Icago gikurikira ikindi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">igihugu cose cahindutse imisaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Mu kanya gato amahema yanje arasambuwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">n’ubwugamo bwanje mu kanya gato.<verse eid="JER 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Mbega nzogeza ryari kubona ibendera y’intambara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:21">no kwumva ijwi ry’inzamba?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />Abantu banje ni ibijuju;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">ntibanzi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Ni abana batiyumvira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">ntibagira ugutahura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Ni abanyabwenge mu gukora ibibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">ntibazi ugukora iciza.”<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />Naravye isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">nsanga ntigira uko imeze kandi nta kirimwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">ndaba n’amajuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">nsanga umuco waho wagiye.<verse eid="JER 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Naravye ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">mbona iriko iratigita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">n’udusozi twose turahuzenze.<verse eid="JER 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />Nararavye, nsanga nta bantu bariho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:25">inyoni zose zo mu kirere zari zagurutse.<verse eid="JER 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />Ndavye, nsanga igihugu cimbuka ivyamwa vyinshi gisigaye ari ubugaragwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">ibisagara vyose vyaho ni imisaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imbere y’ubushangashirwe bwiwe bwinshi.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:27">“Igihugu cose kizoba amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:27">naho ntazogisambura rwose.<verse eid="JER 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Ni co gituma isi yose izogandara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">n’amajuru yo hejuru yirabure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">kuko ndabivuze kandi sinzokwigarura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">namaze gufata ingingo sinzokwisubirako.”<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Nihumvikana ijwi ry’abagendera ku mafarasi n’abanyamiheto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">igisagara cose kizohunga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Bamwe binjire mu vyatsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">abandi binjire mu bitandara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Mu bisagara vyose harera nta muntu arimwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">nta muntu n’umwe akibibamwo.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />Mbega uriko urakora iki, wa gisagara we usambuwe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Ni kuki wiyambika inyambarabami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">ukambara ubudede bwawe bw’inzahabu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Ko ushariza amaso yawe n’amarangi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Wishaririza ubusa gusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Abo ushaka gukunda barakwanka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">bagomba kukwica.<verse eid="JER 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Ndumva ijwi nk’iry’umugore afashwe n’inda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">ukuboroga nk’ukw’uwuvyara imfura yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">akamo k’umukobwa w’i Siyoni yipfuza akayaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">ataritse ukuboko avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">“Karabaye, ncitse intege;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">ubugingo bwanje buhawe abicanyi.<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nta n’umwe agororotse</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />Muduge kandi mumanuke mu mayira yose y’i Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">murabe irya n’ino kandi mwitegereze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">murondere mu mpande zose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Nimba mwoshobora kuronka umuntu n’umwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">acuruza mu kugororoka kandi arondera ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">nanje nzobabarira iki gisagara.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />N’aho bavuga bati: ‘Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:2">barahira ibinyoma.”<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mbega inyonga zawe ntizirondera ukuri?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">Warabakubise, ariko ntibababara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">warabamenaguye ariko ntibemera gukosorwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Bakomantaje mu maso habo haba nk’ibuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">maze banka kwihana.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Nariyumviriye nti: “Abo ni aboro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">ni ibijuju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">ntibazi inzira y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">ntibazi ivyo Imana yabo ishaka.<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Ni co gituma ngiye kurondera abarongozi babo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">maze mvugane na bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Ni ukuri barazi inzira y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">barazi ivyo Imana yabo ishaka.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Ariko n’abo nyene baravunaguye ingogo y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">kandi baracagaguye iminyororo.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Ni co gituma intambwe yo mw’ishamba izobatera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">imfyisi yo mu bugaragwa ikabatabagura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">ingwe izobabundira hafi y’ibisagara vyabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">kugira ngo itabagure umuntu wese asohoka hanze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">kuko ubugarariji bwabo ari bwinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">no gusubira inyuma kwabo ari kwinshi.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />Ni kuki nobaharira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">Abana banyu barampevye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">maze barahira mw’izina ry’izindi mana atari imana z’ukuri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Nabahaye ivyo bakeneye vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">ariko bagiye mu busambanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">kandi bahurumbira amazu y’abamaraya.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Bameze nk’amafarasi avyibushe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:8">umwe wese yiruka arondera umugore wa mugenziwe.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Mbega ivyo sinkwiye kubibahanira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">Mbega sinari nkwiye kwihora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">ihanga rimeze gutyo?<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />Nimugende muce mu mizabibu yaho, maze muyitikize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">ariko ntimuyimare rwose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Musangangure amashami yawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">kuko aba bantu atari ab’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Inzu ya Isirayeli n’inzu ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">barampemukiye bantera ibitugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />Bavuze ibinyoma k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">baravuze bati: “Nta na kimwe azokora!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Nta kibi kizodushikako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">ntituzokwigera tubona inkota canke ikigoyi.<verse eid="JER 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Abavugishwa ni umuyaga gusa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">kandi nta jambo riri muri bo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">Ivyo bavuga nibibashikeko bo nyene.”<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">Kubera ko abantu bavuze ayo majambo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">nzohindura amajambo yanje ari mu kanwa kawe acike umuriro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">aba bantu na bo babe nk’inkwi zo gutongorwa n’uwo muriro.<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />Yemwe ab’inzu ya Isirayeli, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">Nzozana ihanga rya kure rize kubagwanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">ni ihanga rikomeye kandi ryamyeho kuva kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">abantu bavuga ururimi mutazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">bafise imvugo mutumva.<verse eid="JER 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Isaho y’imyampi yabo ni nk’imva yuguruye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:16">kandi bose ni abagwanyi b’abahizi.<verse eid="JER 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Bazorigita imyimbu yanyu n’indya zanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">bazorandura abahungu banyu n’abakobwa banyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">bazoherengeteza amasho yanyu n’imikuku yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">bazorigata imizabibu yanyu n’imisukoni yanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Bazosambuza inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro mwari mwizigiye.<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />“Ariko no muri iyo misi,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> “sinzogusambura rwose. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Kandi igihe abantu bazobaza bati: ‘Ni kuki <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yadukoreye ibi vyose?’ Muzobabwire muti: ‘Ni kubera mwanteye ibitugu mugakorera izindi mana z’inyamahanga mu gihugu canyu bwite, ubu na ho muzokorera abanyamahanga mu gihugu kitari icanyu.’<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />Menyesha ibi ab’inzu ya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:20">mubivuge i Buyuda:<verse eid="JER 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />nimwumve ibi, yemwe bantu b’ibipfu mutagira ubwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">mufise amaso ariko ntimubone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">mufise amatwi ariko ntimwumve.<verse eid="JER 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />Mbega ntimwonyubaha?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">“Mbega ntimwohindira agashitsi imbere yanje?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Naremye umusenyi ngo ushingire akarimbi ikiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ube akarimbi k’ibihe bidashira kidashobora kurengana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Imipfunda yosuriranya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ariko ntishobora kuharenga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">irashobora kubomborana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ariko ntishobora kurenga ako karimbi.<verse eid="JER 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Ariko aba bantu bo bafise imitima ikomantaye kandi igarariza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:23">bakikamiye hirya bigira ahandi.<verse eid="JER 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Ntibibwira mu mitima bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">‘Reka twubahe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">aduha imvura y’agatasi n’iy’urushana ku gihe cayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">aduha amayinga meza yo kwimbura.’<verse eid="JER 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Ibibi vyanyu mwakoze ni vyo vyababujije kubironka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:25">ivyaha vyanyu ni vyo vyababujije ivyiza.<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />Mu bantu banje harimwo abantu babi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">babunda nk’abatega inyoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">nk’abantu batega imitego yo gufata abandi.<verse eid="JER 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Kurya imitego yuzuramwo inyoni zafashwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:27">ni ko amazu yabo yuzuyemwo kugunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">babaye abatunzi b’abanyenkomezi<verse eid="JER 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />kandi baravyibushe barasayangana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Ibikorwa vyabo bibi ntibigira akarimbi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">ntibababara urubanza rw’impfuvyi ngo bazirenganure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">ntibitaho urubanza rw’umukene.<verse eid="JER 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Mbega ivyo sinkwiye kubibahanira?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">“Mbega sinkwiye kwihora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">ihanga rimeze gutyo?<verse eid="JER 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />Ikintu giteye ubwoba kandi kibabaje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:30">carabaye mu gihugu:<verse eid="JER 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />abavugishwa bavugishwa ibinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">abaherezi baganzisha igikenye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">kandi abantu banje barabinezerererwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">Ariko none kw’iherezo muzokora iki?<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu hugarizwa n’abansi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />Hunga mukize amagara yanyu, yemwe bene Benyamini!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Nimuhunge muve i Yerusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Vuza inzamba i Tekowa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Manika ibendera i Beti-Hakeremu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Kuko icago kibahanamiye kivuye mu buraruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">kandi ni uguhonya guhambaye.<verse eid="JER 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Nzosangangura umukobwa w’i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:2">umwe mwiza kandi abereye ijisho.<verse eid="JER 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Abungere n’amasho yabo bazoza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">bazohakikuza amahema yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">umwe wese azoragira mu canya ciwe.<verse eid="JER 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />Mwitegurire kuja kuhagwanya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">Muhaguruke tuhatere mu mashoka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Ariko, turagowe, kuko burije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">kandi burahwibiriye.<verse eid="JER 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Nuko rero nimuhaguruke, dutere mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:5">maze dusambure inzitiro zaho!”<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">“Nimwicire ibiti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">mwubake ivyo kwuririrako ngo mugwanye Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Iki gisagara gitegerezwa guhanwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">cuzuye agacinyizo.<verse eid="JER 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Nk’uko iriba ridudubiza amazi yaryo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">ni ko na co kidudubiza ibibi vyaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Muri co humvikana umuryano n’uguhonya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">ingwara yaho n’ibikomere vyama imbere yanje.<verse eid="JER 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Burirwa wumve, yewe Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">ngo simpave ndabaheba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">ngatuma igihugu canyu gisigara ari umusaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">ata n’umwe agishobora kukibamwo.”<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">“Nibasorome amasigarira ya Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">bamaririkanye nk’uko bagira ku muzabibu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">nimusubiremwo musorome ivyasigaye mu mashami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">nk’uko umuntu yegeranya inzabibu.”<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />Ni nde nobwira nkamumenyesha imburi yanje?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">Ni nde yonyumviriza?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Amatwi yabo arazibwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">ngo ntibashobore kwumva.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni igitsitaza kuri bo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">ntibarinezerererwa.<verse eid="JER 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Ariko nuzuye uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">kandi sinshobora kwihangana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 6:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">“Busuke ku bana bari mu mabarabara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">no ku rwaruka rukoraniye hamwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">umugabo n’umugore wiwe bompi bazofatwa na bwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">n’abatama, bamwe bamaze kuremerwa n’imyaka bakagorama.<verse eid="JER 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />Amazu yabo azohabwa abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">hamwe n’amatongo yabo n’abagore babo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">ninaramvura ukuboko kwanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">ngo ngwanye ababa mu gihugu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />“Kuva ku muto gushika ku mukuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">bose buzuye umunoho w’amaronko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">kandi kuva ku muvugishwa gushika ku muherezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">bose ni abanyabinyoma.<verse eid="JER 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />Bavura igikomere c’abantu banje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">nk’aho kitababaje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">bakavuga ngo: ‘Ni amahoro, ni amahoro,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">kandi ata mahoro ariho.<verse eid="JER 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Mbega none boba bamaramazwa n’inyifato yabo igayitse?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">Oya na mba, nta soni bafise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">mbere ntibazi no kumaramara ico ari co.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Ni co gituma bazogwa aho abandi baguye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">bazotemba igihe nzoba ndiko ndabahana,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">“Nimuhagarare mu mayirabiri murabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">mubaze inzira za kera izo ari zo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">nimubaze inzira nziza iyo ari yo, maze muyicemwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">ni ho muzoronka uburuhukiro bw’imitima yanyu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">Ariko mwaravuze muti: ‘Nta yo tuzocamwo.’<verse eid="JER 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Nashizeho abarinzi bo kubarinda maze ndavuga nti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">‘Nimwumvirize ijwi ry’inzamba!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">Ariko mwavuze muti: ‘Ntituzoryumviriza.’<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />Nuko rero, nimwumve, yemwe mahanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">mwebwe muri ivyabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">nimurabe ibizobabako.<verse eid="JER 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Niwumve, yewe wa si we:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">Nzoteza icago kuri aba bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">gitewe n’ivyiyumviro vyabo bibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">kuko batumviye amajambo yanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">bagatera ibitugu Ivyagezwe vyanje.<verse eid="JER 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />Ni igiki conezera mu bimota neza vy’i Sheba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">canke urubingo rumota neza rwo mu gihugu ca kure?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">Ibimazi vyo guturirwa vyanyu ntivyemerwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">ibimazi vyanyu ntibimpimbara.”<verse eid="JER 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">“Nzoshira ibitsitaza imbere y’ubu bwoko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">Ba se co kimwe n’abahungu bazotsitara kuri vyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">ababanyi n’abagenzi bazohona.”<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">“Raba, ingabo ziraje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">zivuye mu gihugu co mu buraruko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">ihanga rikomeye rirahagurutse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">rivuye ku mpera z’isi.<verse eid="JER 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Bitwaje imiheto n’amacumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">bateye ubwoba kandi ni ba ruburakigongwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Akamo kabo, bariko bariruka ku mafarasi yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">ni nk’ukubomborana kw’ikiyaga gisuriranya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Baje kurya kw’abagabo bariko barimenyereza intambara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">ngo bagutere, yewe mukobwa w’i Siyoni.”<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />Twumvise inkuru zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">amaboko yacu yaciye acika inkokora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Umubabaro uradufata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">umubabaro nk’uw’umugore ariko aravyara.<verse eid="JER 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />Ntimuje mu mirima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">canke ngo mugendagende mu mayira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">kuko umwansi yitwaje inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">kandi hari ibiteye ubwoba impande zose.<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />Yemwe bantu, nimwambare amagunira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">mwitembagaze mu minyota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">mugandare muboroge cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">nk’uko umuntu aririra umuhungu wiwe w’ikinege.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">Kuko umuranduzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">adushitseko giturumbuka.<verse eid="JER 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />“Nakugize nk’igipimisho gipima ivyuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">hamwe n’abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:27">kugira ngo wihweze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">kandi upime inzira zabo.<verse eid="JER 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Bose ni abagarariji bakomantaye imitima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">bagenda hose bavuga abandi nabi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Bameze nk’umuringa n’icuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">bose bakora ivy’ubugarariji.<verse eid="JER 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />Itanure riraka cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">ngo rishongeshe ubutare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">ariko ivyuma ntibishonga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">ababi ntibamarwa inkamba.<verse eid="JER 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Bitwa ifeza yatawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:30">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabataye.”<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ugusenga kw’ibinyoma nta kimazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />“Hagarara kw’irembo ry’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> maze ushikirize ubu butumwa uri aho nyene uti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 7:2">‘Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe bantu b’i Buyuda binjira muri aya marembo gusenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli avuze: Nimuhindure ingeso zanyu n’ibikorwa vyanyu, nanje nzobaha kuba aha hantu. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Ntimwizigire amajambo y’uruhendo ngo muvuge muti: iyi ni Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>! <verse eid="JER 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />Nimwahindura vy’ukuri ingeso zanyu n’ibikorwa vyanyu kandi umuntu wese agakorera mugenziwe ibibereye, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />nimutacinyiza inyambukira, impfuvyi canke umupfakazi kandi ntimusese amaraso y’uwutagira icaha muyasesa aha hantu, kandi nimutakurikira izindi mana ari vyo bibazanira amarushwa, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />nuko nzobaha kuba aha hantu, mu gihugu nahaye ba sogokuruza banyu ibihe bidashira. <verse eid="JER 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />Ariko raba, mwizigiye amajambo y’uruhendo atagira ikimazi.<verse eid="JER 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />Mbega muzokwiba, mwice, musambane kandi murahire ibinyoma, muturirire Bayali ibimota neza, mukurikire izindi mana mutigeze mumenya, <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />hanyuma muheze muze guhagarara imbere yanje muri iyi Ngoro yitirirwa izina ryanje, muvuga muti: Turacuna! Muracuna kandi mukora ibibi nk’ivyo? <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" />Mbega iyi Ngoro yitirirwa izina ryanje, yahindutse isenga ry’abambuzi kuri mwebwe? Ariko namye ndavyihweza! Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" />Nimugende mu kibanza c’i Shilo aho nashize ubwa mbere ikibanza citirirwa izina ryanje, murabe uko nahagiriye kubera ibibi vy’abantu banje b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />Mu gihe mwariko murakora ivyo, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, navuganye namwe kenshi, ariko ntimwanyumviye; narabahamagaye ariko ntimwitaba, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Ni co gituma, ivyo nakoreye i Shilo ari vyo ngiye gukorera iyi Ngoro yitirirwa izina ryanje, Ingoro mwashizemwo ivyizigiro, ikibanza nahaye mwebwe na ba sogokuruza banyu. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Nzobirukana mumve imbere, nk’uko nagiriye benewanyu ari bo Bisirayeli, abantu ba Efurayimu.’<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />Nuko rero ntusengere ubu bwoko, ntubaborogere canke ngo unyinginge, kuko ntazokwumviriza. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Ntubona ivyo bariko barakora mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu mayira y’i Yerusalemu? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" />Abana begeranya inkwi, ba se bagacana umuriro, abagore na bo bakagira igikandu co gukoramwo udukate tw’umwamikazi wo mw’ijuru. Basesa hasi ishikanwa ry’ibinyobwa ku zindi mana ngo bavyure ishavu ryanje, bandatse. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Ariko mbega ni jewe bariko baratera ishavu? Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza. Mbega si bo bariko barigirira nabi, ibintu bizotuma bamaramara?<verse eid="JER 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />Nuko rero, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Uburake bwanje n’ubushangashirwe bwanje bizosukwa aha hantu, ku muntu no ku gikoko, ku biti vyo mu mirima no ku vyimburwa biva mw’ivu, buzorurumba kandi nta wuzobuzimya.<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli avuze ati: Bandanya, mwongere amashikanwa yanyu yo guturirwa ku bindi bimazi vyanyu, maze mwirire inyama! <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Kuko igihe nakura ba sogokuruza banyu muri Egiputa kandi nkavugana na bo, sinabahaye amabwirizwa gusa yerekeye ibimazi vyo guturirwa; <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />ariko nabahaye iki cagezwe ngo: Munyumvire, nanje nzoba Imana yanyu namwe mube abantu banje. Muze mugendere mu nzira zose ndababwira, kugira ngo ivyanyu bigende neza. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Ariko ntibanyumviye canke ngo babishireko n’umutima; ahubwo, bakurikiye ugukomantara kw’imitima yabo yanduye. Basubiye inyuma aho kuja imbere. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Kuva mu gihe ba sogokuruza bava muri Egiputa kugeza n’ubu, ku musi ku musi, nama ndungika abasavyi banje abo navugisha. <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />Ariko ntibagomba kunyumviriza canke ngo babishireko umutima. Bagamitse izosi maze bakora ibibi biruta ivya ba sekuruza babo.<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />Niwababwira ibi vyose, ntibazokwumviriza; niwabahamagara, ntibazokwitaba. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Nuko rero uze ubabwire uti: Iri ni ryo hanga ritumviye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo canke ngo ryemere guhanurwa. Ukuri kwarahonyanzwe; kwaraheze ku minwa yabo.<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />Nimwimweshe umushatsi wanyu maze muwute kure, mucure intimba muri ku dutwe tw’imisozi y’uruharabuga, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yataye kandi yahevye uru runganwe ruri musi y’uburake bwiwe.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikiyaya co gusogota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />Abantu b’i Buyuda bakoze ibibi mu nyonga zanje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. Bashinze ibigirwamana vyabo vyo kwankwa urunuka mu Ngoro yitirirwa izina ryanje maze barayihumanya. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" />Bubatse ibibanza basengeramwo vya Tofeti mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu ngo bahatangire abahungu babo n’abakobwa babo babatuririye mu muriro, ivyo ntari nabategetse gukora, canke ngo bice no mu bwenge bwanje. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" />Nuko nimwiyubare, imisi iraje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, aho abantu batazosubira kuhita Tofeti canke ikiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, ahubwo hazokwitwa ikiyaya co gusogota, kuko bazohamba abapfuye i Tofeti kugeza aho hatazosigara ikibanza na kimwe. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />Maze imivyimba y’aba bantu izoba ivyokurya vy’inyoni zo mu kirere n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba, kandi nta muntu azoshobora kuvyirukana. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" />Nzoshira kw’iherezo amajwi y’umunezero no guhimbarwa n’amajwi y’umukwe n’umugeni mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu mayira y’i Yerusalemu, kuko igihugu kizoba ari umusaka.<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />‘Muri ico gihe,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ‘amagufa y’abami n’abaganwa b’i Buyuda, ay’abaherezi n’ay’abavugishwa n’Imana, hamwe n’ay’abantu b’i Yerusalemu bose, azozurwa akurwe mu mva zayo. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Azokwanikirwa ku zuba, ku kwezi no ku nyenyeri zose zo kw’ijuru; ibigirwamana bakunze bakabikorera kandi ivyo bakurikiye, bakabisiguza, mbere bakanabisenga. Ntazokwegeranywa ngo asubire ahambwe, ahubwo azomera nk’amase ashanjwe kw’isi. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Aho nzobirukanira hose, abantu b’amasigarira bazoba barokotse bo muri iri hanga rikora ibizira bazohitamwo gupfa kuruta kubaho, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.’<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icaha n’igihano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />Babwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">Iyo abantu baguye hasi, mbega ntibavyuka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:4">Canke iyo umuntu ataye inzira, mbega ntagaruka?<verse eid="JER 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />None ni kuki aba bantu banteye ibitugu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">Mbega ni kuki ab’i Yerusalemu bamvuyeko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Bumiye ku majambo y’uruhendo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">baranse kugaruka.<verse eid="JER 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Narabumvirije neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">ariko ntibavuga ibigororotse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Nta n’umwe yihana ububi bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">ngo avuge ati: “Ibi nakoze ni ibiki?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Umwe wese ajana inzira yiwe ubwiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">nk’ifarasi igiye mu ntambara.<verse eid="JER 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Mbere n’agasoza kari mu kirere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">karazi ibihe kashingiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">kandi n’inuma, intamba n’umusambi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">bikurikiza ibihe vyo kuva ahantu bija ahandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Ariko abantu banje ntibazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashaka.<verse eid="JER 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />Ni kuki muvuga muti: “Turi abanyabwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">kuko dufise Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">kandi ikaramu y’ikinyoma y’abanyabwenge b’ivyanditswe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">yarabihinduye ikinyoma?<verse eid="JER 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Abanyabwenge bazomaramara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">bazoterwa n’ubwoba kandi bazofatwa mu mutego.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Ko bataye ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">bafise ubwenge nyabaki?<verse eid="JER 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />Ni co gituma nzotanga abagore babo nkabaha abandi bagabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">n’amatongo yabo nkayaha abandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Kuva ku muto gushika ku mukuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">bose bafise umunoho w’amaronko; kandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">kuva ku muvugishwa gushika ku muherezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">bose ni abanyabinyoma.<verse eid="JER 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Bavura igikomere c’abantu banje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">nk’aho kitababaje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">bakavuga ngo: “Ni amahoro, ni amahoro,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">kandi ata mahoro ariho.<verse eid="JER 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Mbega none boba bamaramazwa n’inyifato yabo igayitse?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Oya na mba nta soni bafise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">mbere ntibazi no kumaramara ico ari co.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Ni co gituma bazogwa aho abandi baguye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">bazotemba igihe nzoba ndiko ndabahana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />Nzotwara ivyimburwa vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">Nta nzabibu zizokwama ku mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Nta nsukoni zizokwama ku misukoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">kandi amababi yavyo azokabirana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Ivyo nabahaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">bazovyakwa.’ ”<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />Ni kuki twicaye hano?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">Nimwegerane!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Reka duhungire mu bisagara bizitijwe inzitiro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">maze duhonereyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yaduciriye urwo gupfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">maze akaduha amazi arimwo uburozi ngo tuyanywe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">kuko twamucumuyeko.<verse eid="JER 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Twari twizigiye amahoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">ariko nta ciza catujeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">twari twiteze igihe co gukiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">ariko twabonye ibidutera ubwoba gusa.<verse eid="JER 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />Imirindi y’amafarasi y’umwansi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">yumvikanira i Dani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">umurindi w’ibinono vyayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">binyiganyije igihugu cose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Baraje gukomvomvora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">igihugu n’ibiri muri co vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">igisagara n’abari muri co bose.<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />“Raba, nzorungika inzoka z’ubumara muri mwebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">incira zidashobora kugundwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">kandi zizobakomora,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />Yewe wewe undemesha mu mibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:18">umutima wanje ucikiye intege muri jewe.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Umve uko abantu banje bariko baraboroga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">bari mu gihugu ca kure:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">bati: “Mbega <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntari i Siyoni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">Mbega Umwami waho ntakiriho?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 8:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Ni kubera iki banteye ishavu bakandakisha ibishushanyo vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">n’imana zabo zidashoboye z’inyamahanga?”<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />“Iyimbura riraheze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">ici rirarangiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">kandi natwe ntitwakize.”<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />Ko abantu banje bamenaguwe, nanje ndamenaguwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:21">ndagandaye, kandi nishwe n’agahinda.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Mbega i Gileyadi nta muti wo gusomora uriyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">Nta muganga ariyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">None ni kuki ata gukira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">kw’igikomere c’abantu banje?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />Ese icompa umutwe wanje ukaba nk’isoko y’amazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">n’amaso yanje akaba imiringoti y’amosozi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">Norira ku murango no mw’ijoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">kubera abantu banje bariko barasogotwa.<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />Ese icompa nkaba mfise mu bugaragwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">inzu y’ingenzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">kugira ngo mve muri bano bantu banje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">nje kure yabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">kuko bose ari abasambanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">igugu ry’abantu bataye ubwizigirwa.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />“Bafora indimi zabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">nk’umuheto, kugira ngo barase ibinyoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">si kubera ukuri kwabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">batera imbere mu gihugu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Kuko bava mu caha kimwe bakaja mu kindi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">kandi ntibamenye jewe,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />“Mwirinde abagenzi banyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">ntimwizigire umuntu n’umwe wo mu nzu iwanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Kuko umwe wese muri bo ari umusukanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">kandi umugenzi wese akaba uwuvuga abandi nabi.<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Umugenzi abesha mugenziwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">kandi nta n’umwe avuga ukuri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Bigishije indimi zabo kubesha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">kandi biremereje ugucumura.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Uba hagati mu bubeshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">kandi mu bubeshi bwabo banka kumenya jewe,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">Raba, nzobavugutira ndabapime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">kuko ikindi nokora ni igiki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">kubera icaha c’abantu banje?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Ururimi rwabo ni umwampi uriko ubumara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">ruvuga ivyo guhendana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Mu kanwa kabo bose bavugana neza n’ababanyi babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">ariko mu mitima yabo bakabatega imitego.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Mbega ivyo sinkwiye kubibahanira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">Mbega sinkwiye kwihora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">abantu nk’abo?<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />Nzorira mboroge ndirira imisozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">kandi nzocura intimba kubera uburagiro bwo mu bugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Ni agahinga katagendwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">kandi nta jwi ryo kwabira kw’amasho ryumvikana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Inyoni zo mu kirere zose zarahunze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">n’ibikoko vyaragiye.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />Nzohindura Yerusalemu ikigunguzi c’isakamburira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">ihuriro ry’imbwebwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">mpindure imisaka ibisagara vy’i Buyuda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">Gushika aho ata n’umwe ashobora kuhaba.<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Ni nde w’umunyabwenge ashobora gutahura ibi? Ni nde yigishijwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku buryo ashobora kubisobanura? Ni kuki igihugu casambuwe kigahinduka umusaka nk’ubugaragwa ata wokwubahuka gucamwo?<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze ati: Ni kubera bateye ibitugu ivyagezwe vyanje, ivyo nari narabashize imbere; ntibanyumviye canke ngo bitondere Ivyagezwe vyanje. <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />Ahubwo bakurikiye ugukomantara kw’imitima yabo; bakurikiye za Bayali, nk’uko ba sekuruza babo babigishije. <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze ati: Raba, nzorisha iri hanga indya zirura banywe n’amazi arimwo ishano. <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Nzobasanzariza mu mahanga batigeze bamenya, baba bo canke ba sekuruza, kandi nzobakurikiza inkota gushika ndabahoneje.<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">Nimwiyumvire neza rero!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">Nimutumeko abagore bazi kurira baze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">Tumako abazi kuririra abapfuye kurusha abandi bo muri bo.<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Nibaze bihuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">kugira ngo batuborogere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">kugeza aho amaso yacu acunduguta amosozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">kandi imigezi itembe iva mu bigohe vyacu.<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />Ijwi ryo kuboroga rirumvikana i Siyoni, riti: Ehe ukuntu dusambaguritse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">Ehe ukuntu twuzuye ibimaramare!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Dutegerezwa kuva mu gihugu cacu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">kuko amazu yacu ari imisaka.<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />None rero, yemwe bagore, nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">mubangire amatwi yanyu amajambo yo mu kanwa kiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Mwigishe abakobwa banyu kuboroga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">mwigishanye gucura intimba.<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />Urupfu rwuriye ruca mu madirisha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">maze rwinjira mu bisagara bizitijwe inzitiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">rwamaze gukura abana mu mabarabara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">n’abasore rwabamariye aho bahora bagandagaje.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />Nimuvuge muti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">Imivyimba y’abantu izokwandagara hasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">nk’uko amase amera mu mirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">nk’imishi y’ingano inyuma y’uwimbura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">ata n’umwe wo kuyegeranya.<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">Umunyabwenge ntiyirate ubwenge bwiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">canke umunyenkomezi ngo yirate inkomezi ziwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">canke umutunzi ngo yirate ubutunzi bwiwe,<verse eid="JER 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />ariko uwirata wese yirate ibi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">ko yamenye, akantahura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nkerekana ukugira neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">ngaca imanza zibereye kandi ngakora mu bugororotsi kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">kuko ivyo ari vyo bimpimbara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />Imisi iraje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, aho nzohana abakebwe ku mubiri gusa, <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" />Egiputa, Ubuyuda, Edomu, Amoni, Mowabu n’ababa mu bugaragwa bose mu bihugu vya kure. Kuko abo bose batakebwe vy’ukuri, kandi mbere n’ab’inzu ya Isirayeli ntibakebwe mu mitima yabo.<verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s1">Imana n’ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Nimwumve ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ababwira, yemwe bantu ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">“Ntimwige ingeso z’amahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">canke ngo muterwe ubwoba n’ibimenyetso vyo kw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">nk’uko ayo mahanga aterwa ubwoba na vyo.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Kuko imigenzo y’abo bantu ata co imaze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">baca igiti mw’ishamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">maze umuhinga akakibaza akoresheje imbazo yiwe.<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Bakagishariza n’ifeza n’inzahabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">bakagihagarika bakoresheje inyundo n’imisumari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">kugira ngo ntigitembe.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Ivyo bigirwamana bimeze nk’ibikanganyoni, mu mirima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">ntibishobora kuvuga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">bitegerezwa guterurwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">kuko bidashobora kugenda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Ntimubitinye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">nta co bishobora gukora caba kibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">canke ciza.”<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />Nta n’umwe ameze nkawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">kuko uri nkuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">kandi izina ryawe rirahambaye rifise ubushobozi.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />Ni nde atokwubaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">yewe Mwami w’amahanga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Urabikwiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Mu banyabwenge bose bo mu mahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">no mu bwami bwabo bwose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">nta n’umwe ameze nkawe.<verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Bose ntibagira ubwenge kandi ni ibipfu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:8">bigishijwe n’imana zibajwe mu biti ata co zimaze.<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />Ifeza yatunganijwe iva i Tarushishi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">n’inzahabu iva muri Ufazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Ivyo abahinga n’abacuzi bakoze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">baca bavyambika impuzu z’agahama n’ubururu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">zose zakozwe n’abahinga babimogoreye.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni Imana y’ukuri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">ni Imana nzima, Umwami ahoraho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Ashavuye, isi yose iratigita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">amahanga ntashobora kwihanganira uburake bwiwe.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />“Babwire ibi, uti: ‘Izo mana, zitaremye amajuru ntizireme isi, zizorandurwa zikurwe kw’isi no musi y’amajuru.’ ”<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />Ariko Imana yaremye isi mu bushobozi bwayo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">iremesha isi ubwenge bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">kandi yagura amajuru mu gutahura kwayo.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />Iyo ituragaye, amazi yo hejuru aca abomborana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">ituma ibicu biduga biva ku mpera z’isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Irungika umuravyo n’imvura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">igasohora umuyaga iwukuye mu bubiko bwayo.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Umuntu wese ni ikijuju nta bwenge agira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">umucuzi w’inzahabu wese naterwe isoni n’ibigirwamana vyiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Kuko ibishushanyo vyiwe ari ibinyoma gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">nta mpwemu y’ubuzima iri muri vyo.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Nta co bimaze, ni ivyo gukengerwa gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:15">igihe c’urubanza rwavyo nicashika, bizohona.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Ariko wa wundi, we mugabane wa Yakobo, ntameze nka vyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">kuko ari Umuremyi w’ibintu vyose</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">harimwo na Isirayeli, abantu yagize inyegu yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo zina ryiwe.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uguhona kugiye kuza</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Nimwegeranye ibintu vyanyu kugira ngo muve mu gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:17">yemwe abugarijwe.<verse eid="JER 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">“Muri ico gihe, nzoshiburira hanze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">ababa muri iki gihugu bose;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">nzobateza ubwoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">gushika bose bafashwe mpiri, nta wuzocika.”<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />Ewe jewe ndagowe, kuko nkomeretse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">Kandi igikomere canje ntigishobora gukira!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Ariko naribwiye mu mutima nti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">“Iyi ni yo ngwara yanje, kandi ntegerezwa kuyihanganira.”<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />Ihema ryanje rirasambuwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">n’ibiziriko vyaryo vyose biracagaguwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Abahungu banje bagiye kandi ntibakiriho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">nta n’umwe asigaye ngo anyubakire ihema</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">canke ngo anyubakire urusago.<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Abungere nta co bibabwiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">kandi ntibasiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">ni co gituma batazotera imbere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">kandi umukuku wabo wose ukaba usanzaye.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Umviriza! Inkuru iraje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">ugutigita kw’isi kuje kuva mu gihugu co mu buraruko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Kuzosiga ibisagara vy’i Buyuda ari imisaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">ahakwiye kuba imbwebwe.<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />Ndazi, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ko ubuzima bw’abantu batabuganza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:23">kandi ko badashobora kwirongorera intambuko.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />Nkosora, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko ku rugezo rubereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">atari mu burake bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">kuko wompindura ubusa.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />Suka uburake bwawe ku mahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">arya atakwemera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">ku bantu batambaza izina ryawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Kuko bashihaguye aba Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">mbere barabashihaguye barabamara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">kandi basambuye n’igihugu ciwe.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s1">Isezerano ryarahonyanzwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, rivuga riti: <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" />“Nimwumve ibiri muri iri sezerano kugira ngo mubibwire abantu b’i Buyuda n’ababa i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Aravumwe umuntu atumvira ivyanditswe muri iryo sezerano, <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />ivyo nategetse ba sogokuruza banyu igihe nabakura muri Egiputa, mw’itanure rivugutira ivyuma.’ Navuze nti: ‘Munyumvire kandi mukore ivyo vyose ndabategetse, maze muzoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba Imana yanyu. <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />Ni ho nzoshitsa indahiro narahiye ba sogokuruza banyu, ko nzobaha igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki, ico na co ni iki gihugu mubamwo uwu musi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Maze ndishura nti: “Amen, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Menyekanisha aya majambo yose mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu mabarabara y’i Yerusalemu, uti: ‘Nimwumve ibiri mu iri sezerano maze muvyitondere. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Kuva igihe nakuriye ba sogokuruza banyu muri Egiputa gushika uwu musi, narababuriye kenshi cane, mvuga nti: Nimunyumvire. <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Ariko ntibanyumviye canke ngo banabibabare; ahubwo, bakurikiye ugukomantara kw’imitima yabo mibi. Ni co catumye ndabashitsako imivumo yose yari muri iryo sezerano nari nabahaye ngo baryitondere ariko bakarita.’ ”<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Hari uguhuza inama mbi mu bantu b’i Buyuda n’ababa i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Basubiye mu vyaha vya ba sekuruza, banse kwumva amajambo yanje. Bakurikiye izindi mana ngo bazisabe. Baba abo mu nzu ya Isirayeli canke abo mu nzu ya Yuda bavuye mw’isezerano nagiranye na ba sekuruza. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Nzobateza icago badashobora kwikiza. Naho bazontakambira, sinzobumva. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />Ibisagara vy’i Buyuda n’abantu b’i Yerusalemu bazogenda batakambire izo mana bazituririra ibimota neza, ariko ntizizobatabara na gatoya igihe icago kizoba kije. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Yemwe Bayuda, mufise imana zingana n’ibisagara vyanyu; kandi mwubatse ibicaniro vyo guturirirako ibimota neza iyo mana iteye isoni Bayali bingana n’amabarabara y’i Yerusalemu.’<verse eid="JER 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />Ntusabire aba bantu canke ngo unyambaze ku bwabo canke ngo ubingingire, kuko ntazokwumva nibantakambira mu gihe agatengo kabo kazoba kabafashe.<verse eid="JER 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />Mbega umukunzi wanje ariko akora iki mu Ngoro yanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">ko mbona we, n’abandi benshi bakora ibikorwa bibi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">Mbega inyama zejejwe zosubiza inyuma igihano muzohanwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">Kandi iyo muri mu bibi vyanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">muranezerwa!”<verse eid="JER 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabita igiti gitotahaye ca Elayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">gifise ivyamwa bisa neza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">Ariko ukubomborana kw’igihuhusi gihambaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">kuzotuma gifatwa n’umuriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">kandi amashami yaco azovunwa.<verse eid="JER 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, ari we yaguteye, yakugeneye ikiza, kuko abo inzu ya Isirayeli n’inzu ya Yuda bakoze ibibi bakandatsa mu guturirira ibimota neza Bayali.<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bagira inama yo kugirira nabi Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />Kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampishuriye inama bangira, narayimenye, kuko muri ico gihe yanyeretse ivyo bariko barakora. <verse eid="JER 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Nari nabaye nk’umwagazi w’intama ujanwa kubagwa; sinamenya ko bari bangiriye inama, bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">“Reka duhonye igiti n’ivyamwa vyaco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">reka tumurandure tumukure mw’isi y’abazima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">kugira ngo izina ryiwe ntirizosubire kwibukwa.”<verse eid="JER 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, ni wewe uca imanza zigororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">ugasuzuma imitima y’abantu ukamenya ivyo biyumvira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">Uze umpe kubona ingene uzobihora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">kuko ari wewe nashikirije urubanza rwanje.<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira abantu bo muri Anatoti barondera kukwica, bakavuga bati: “Reka kuvugishwa mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bitari uko turakwica.” <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />Nuko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Nzobahana. Abasore babo bazokwicwa n’inkota, abahungu babo n’abakobwa babo bicwe n’ikigoyi. <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />Nta n’umwe azorokoka. Nzorungikira ivyago abantu bo muri Anatoti mu mwaka wo guhanwa kwabo.”<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwidoga kwa Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ibihe vyose uragororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">igihe ndakuzaniye urubanza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Ariko nagomba mvugane nawe ku vy’ubutungane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Ni kuki abanyakibi batera imbere?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Ni kuki abatizera biberaho neza?<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />Warabateye, bashora imizi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">barakura bama ivyamwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Bakwamana mu kanwa kabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">mugabo uri kure y’imitima yabo.<verse eid="JER 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Ariko jeho uranzi, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">urambona kandi uzi n’ivyiyumviro nkwiyumvirako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Nubatware nk’intama zigiye kubagwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">Ubabikire umusi wo gusogotwa!<verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Igihugu kizogeza ryari kugandara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">n’ivyatsi ku misozi kwama bikabiranye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Kuko ababa muri co ari abanyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">ibikoko n’ibiguruka vyahonye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Vyongeye, abantu bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">“Ntazobona ibiriko biradushikako.”<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana yishura Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />“Nimba wasiganywe n’abiruka n’amaguru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">kandi bakakuruhisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">woshobora ute gusiganwa n’amafarasi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Ko utsitara mu gihugu kirimwo impore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">uzobigenza gute igihe Yorodani ruzoba rwarenze inkombe?<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />Abavukanyi bawe, umuryango wawe bwite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">na bo nyene baguhemukiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">baguhagurukiye ngo bakugwanye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Ntubizigire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">naho bakuvuga neza.<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />Nzoheba inzu yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">nzoreka n’iragi ryanje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">nzotanga umwe nkunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">mu maboko y’abansi biwe.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Iragi ryanje ryampindukiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">nk’intare mw’ishamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Riraroha rimbonye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">ni co gituma ndaryanka.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Mbega iragi ryanje ntiryambereye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">nk’igisiga c’amero gifise amabara menshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">ibindi bisiga vy’amero bikikuza ngo bikirye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Genda mukoranye ibikoko vyose vyo mw’ishamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">mubizane kugira ngo bishihagure amazimano.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />Abungere benshi bazohonyanga uruzabibu rwanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">kandi bazohonyanga umurima wanje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">bazohindura umurima wanje nakunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">ahantu h’ubugaragwa bw’agahinga.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />Hazohindurwa agahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">ahantu hahebwe kandi h’ubugaragwa imbere yanje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">igihugu cose kizoba ubugaragwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">kuko ata n’umwe abibabaye.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Ku dutwe twose tw’imisozi yose yo mu bugaragwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">abasambura ni ho bazoca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">kuko inkota y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> izoririka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">kuva ku mpera y’igihugu gushika ku yindi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">nta n’umwe azokira.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />Bazobiba ingano ariko bimbure amahwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">bazotama cane ariko ntihagire ico bunguka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Bazomaramazwe n’ivyo bimbuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">ku bw’uburake bw’inkazi bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Ku babanyi banje babi bafashe ishamvu nahaye abantu banje b’Abisirayeli, nzobarandura ndabakure mu bihugu vyabo ndandure n’inzu ya Yuda ndayikure hagati muri bo. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Ariko ninamara kubarandura, nzosubira ndabagirire imbabazi ngarukane umwe wese wo muri bo mw’ishamvu yiwe no mu gihugu ciwe bwite. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Kandi nibiga neza inzira z’abantu banje bakarahira mw’izina ryanje, bavuga bati: ‘Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima,’ naho babanje kwigisha abantu banje ngo barahire mw’izina rya Bayali, nuko bazoronka ikibanza mu bantu banje. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Ariko nihagira ihanga na rimwe ritumvira, nzorirandura rwose kandi ndariherengeteze,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s1">Umukanda wera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye, ati: “Genda ugure umukanda wera derere maze uwambare mu rukenyerero, ariko ntihagire amazi awukorako.” <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Nuko ngura umukanda, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabintegetse, ndawukenyera mu rukenyerero.<verse eid="JER 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza aho ndi ubwa kabiri, ati: <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“Twara uwo mukanda waguze kandi ukenyeje, maze ugende uwunyegeze i Perati mu mugaga wo mu bitandara.” <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Nuko ndagenda ndawunyegeza hafi ya Perati, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabimbwiye.<verse eid="JER 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Hashize imisi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Ubu na ho genda i Perati maze uzane wa mukanda nakubwira ngo ugende unyegezeyo.” <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Nuko nja i Perati nzura wa mukanda ndawukura aho nari narawunyegeje, ariko wari wononekaye rwose ata woshobora kuwukoresha.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ijambo ati: <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“Uko uwo mukanda umeze, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Uko ni ko nzokwonona ubwibone bwa Yuda n’ubwibone buhambaye bwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Abo banyakibi, banka kwumva amajambo yanje, bagakurikira ugukomantara kw’imitima yabo kandi bagakurikira izindi mana ngo bazisabe bongere bazisenge, bazoba nk’uwu mukanda, ata co ugishoboye kumara! <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Kuko, nk’uko umukanda bawukenyera mu rukenyerero, ni ko nakenyeye inzu yose ya Isirayeli n’inzu yose ya Yuda,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, kugira ngo babe abantu banje, bitirirwe izina ryanje, maze bampimbaze kandi bampe icubahiro. Ariko ntibanyumviye.<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imikuza y’insato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />Uze ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Umukuza wose w’urusato ukwiye kwuzuzwa umuvinyu. Kandi nibakubwira bati: None ntitubizi ko umukuza wose ukwiye kwuzuzwa umuvinyu?’ <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />Uzoce ubabwira uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ngiye kuzokwuzuza akaborerwe abantu bose baba muri iki gihugu, harimwo n’abami bicara ku ntebe y’ubwami ya Dawidi, abaherezi, abavugishwa, n’abantu bose baba i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Nzobamenagura umwe wese kuri mugenziwe, abavyeyi n’abana co kimwe, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. Nta kagongwe nzogira canke imbabazi canke ikibabarwe ngo bimbuze kubaherengeteza.’ ”<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyo kujanwa ari inyagano</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Nimwumve kandi muntege amatwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">ntimugire ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />Nimuhe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu icubahiro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">atarazana umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">ibirenge vyanyu bigatsitara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">ku misozi kuko iri mu mwijima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Mwizigira umuco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">ariko azowuhindura umwijima w’umuzitanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">kandi azowuhindura nk’igicu gitwaye isegenya.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Ariko nimutanyumvira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">nzoririra mu mpisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">kubera ubwibone bwanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">amaso yanje azorira abogoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">amosozi acundugute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">kuko umukuku w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uzoba utwawe kw’inyagano.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />Bwira umwami n’umugabekazi uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">“Nimuve ku ntebe zanyu z’ubwami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">kuko ingori z’ubwiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">zizokoroka zive ku mitwe yanyu.<verse eid="JER 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Ibisagara vy’i Negebu bizokwugarwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">kandi ntihazoboneka uwo kuvyugurura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Abayuda bose bazojanwa ari inyagano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">bazojanwa bose nta wuzosigara.<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />Nimwunamure amaso yanyu murabe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">abaje bava mu buraruko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">Mbega umukuku bakuragije uri he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">intama wari wishimiye?<verse eid="JER 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Mbega uzovuga iki <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyatuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">abo wimenyereje ko ari abakunzi bawe bagutegeka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Mbega ntuzofatwa n’uburibwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">nk’ubw’umugore afashwe n’ibise?<verse eid="JER 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />Kandi niwibaza uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">‘Ni kuki ibi vyanshikiye?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Ni kubera ivyaha vyawe vyinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">vyatumye uduhuzu twawe tugutabagurikirako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">n’umubiri wawe ukaba warakubaguwe.<verse eid="JER 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Mbega Abanyetiyopiya bohindura urukoba rwabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">canke ingwe yohindura amabara yayo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Ni ko na wewe utoshobora gukora ivyiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">kuko wamenyereye gukora ibibi.<verse eid="JER 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />Nzobasanzaza nk’umuguruka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:24">utwarwa mu bugaragwa n’umuyaga.<verse eid="JER 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Uyu ni wo mugabane wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">umugabane nakugereye,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">“kuko wanyibagiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">ukizigira imana z’ibinyoma.<verse eid="JER 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Nzoduza agahuzu kawe gashike mu maso yawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:26">kugira ngo umaramare,<verse eid="JER 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />Narabonye ubusambanyi bwawe n’ivyipfuzo vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">n’ubumaraya bwawe buteye isoni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Narabonye ibikorwa vyawe vyo kwankwa urunuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">ivyo wakoreye ku mirambi no ku misozi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Uragowe, Yewe Yerusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">Mbega uzogeza ryari kuba uwuhumanye?”<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s1">Uruzuba, ikigoyi n’inkota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye kuri Yeremiya ryerekeye uruzuba, ati:<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“I Buyuda baragandaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">ibisagara vyaho bicitse intege;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">baraborogera igihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">kandi akaruru kumvikana kava i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Abaganwa baho batuma amazi abakozi babo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">na bo bakaja ku binogo bibika amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">bagasanga nta mazi ariyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Bagasubirana inyuma imibindi yabo ata kirimwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">bamaramaye, bihebuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">bitwikiriye imitwe.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Isi yase imigaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">kuko ata mvura ikigwa mu gihugu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">abarimyi barihebuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">kandi bitwikiriye imitwe.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Mbere n’impongokazi iri mw’ishamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">yataye umwagazi wayo ihejeje kuvyara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">kuko ata bwatsi.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Indogoba z’inyeshamba zihagarara ku dutwe tw’imisozi y’uruharabuga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">zihuzagizwa nk’imbwebwe zinyotewe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">zahwereye mu maso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">kubera kubura ico zirya.”<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Naho ivyaha vyacu bitwagiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, gira ico ukoze ku bw’icubahiro c’izina ryawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Kuko twakugararije kenshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">twaragucumuyeko.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />Yewe vyizigiro vy’Abisirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">kandi ukaba umukiza wabo mu gihe c’amagorwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">ni kuki uri nk’umunyamahanga mu gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">nk’ingenzi iraye hano ijoro rimwe gusa?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Ni kuki umeze nk’umuntu azazaniwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">nk’umuhizi atagira inkomezi zo gutabara?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, wewe uri hagati muri twebwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">kandi twitirirwa izina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">ntuduhebe!<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira aba bantu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">“Bakunda cane kwangara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">ibirenge vyabo ntibitekana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atabemera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">agiye kwibuka ibibi vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">abahanire ivyaha vyabo.”<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Ntusengere aba bantu ngo bamererwe neza. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Naho bisonzesha, sinzokwumviriza ugutakamba kwabo; naho batanga ibimazi bituriwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu, sinzobemera. Ahubwo, nzobamarisha inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza.”<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Ariko ndavuga nti: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, abavugishwa babo baguma bababwira bati: ‘Ntimuzobona inkota canke ngo mwicwe na kigoyi. Ni ivy’ukuri, nzobaha amahoro adashira muri aha hantu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ati: “Abo bavugishwa bavuga ibinyoma mw’izina ryanje. Sinabatumye canke ngo ndabatoranye canke ngo mvugane na bo. Bavugishwa kuri mwebwe ivyo beretswe bitari vyo, n’indagu, ubupfumu n’uruhendo rw’ubwenge bwabo.<verse eid="JER 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku vyerekeye abo bavugishwa bariko bavugishwa mw’izina ryiwe: Si jewe nabatumye, ariko bavuga bati: ‘Inkota n’inzara ntibizoshika muri iki gihugu.’ Abo bavugishwa nyene bazorandurwa n’inkota n’inzara. <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Kandi abo bariko baravugishwako bazotererwa mu mayira y’i Yerusalemu kubera ikigoyi n’inkota. Nta muntu wo kubahamba azoboneka baba bo canke abagore babo, abahungu babo canke abakobwa babo. Nzobarekurirako ivyago bibakwiye.<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />Uze ubabwire iri jambo uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">‘Amaso yanje yuzuye amosozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">mw’ijoro no ku murango ubudasiba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">kuko umukobwa wanje w’inkumi, ari bo bantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">bakomerekejwe cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">uruguma rudakira.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Ninjiye mu gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">mbona abicishijwe inkota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">iyo ngiye mu gisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">mbona abishwe na kigoyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Umuvugishwa n’umuherezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">bagiye mu gihugu batazi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Mbega warahevye Ubuyuda rwose?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Mbega warataye Siyoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Ni kuki watubabaje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">gushika aho tutagikira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Twari twizigiye amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">ariko nta ciza twabonye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">twari twiteze igihe co gukira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">ariko haje iterabwoba gusa.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, turemeye ububi bwacu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">n’ukugabitanya kwa ba sogokuruza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">ni ukuri twaragucumuyeko.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />Ku bw’izina ryawe ntuduhebe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">ntutetereze intebe yawe y’ubwami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Niwibuke isezerano wasezeranye natwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">nturyice.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Mbega ibigirwamana vy’amahanga vyotanga imvura?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Mbega amajuru yonyene yozana imvura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Oyaye ni wewe wenyene, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yacu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Ni co gituma tukwizigiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">kuko ari wewe ukora ivyo vyose.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ati: “Naho Mose na Samweli bohagarara imbere yanje, basabira aba bantu umutima wanje ntiwobagirira imbabazi. Barungike kure bave imbere yanje! Nibagende! <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" />Nibakubaza bati: ‘Tuje he?’ Uze ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">Abagerewe gupfa, baje gupfa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">abagerewe kwicishwa inkota, baje kwicwa n’inkota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">abagerewe kwicwa n’inzara, baje kwicwa n’inzara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">abagerewe kujanwa ari inyagano, bajanwe ari inyagano.’<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />Nzorungika ivyo kubazimanganya bine,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “inkota yo kubica, imbwa zo kubakwega, ibisiga hamwe n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba vyo kubashihagura no kubahonya. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" />Nzobahindura akajoreza mu bwami bwose bwo kw’isi kubera ivyo Manase mwene Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda yakoze i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />Ni nde azokugirira akagongwe, ga yewe Yerusalemu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Ni nde azokugandarira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Ni nde azohagarara ngo abaze uko umeze?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />Warantaye,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">“Ushishikara gusubira inyuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Ni co gituma nzotuma ukuboko nkagusangangura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">singishoboye kukwihanganira.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />Nzobagosoza icuma c’amenyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">bari ku marembo y’igisagara ca kino gihugu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Nzosanzaza abantu banje ndabarandure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">kuko bataretse ingeso zabo mbi.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Nzorushaho kugwiza abapfakazi babo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">barute umusenyi wo ku kiyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Mu mashoka nzorungika umuranduzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">wo kwica ba nyina b’imisore;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">nzobahwikiza giturumbuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">ibiteye ubwoba n’uguhungabana.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Nyina w’abana indwi azocika intege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">hanyuma acikane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Izuba ryiwe rizocokera hakiri ku murango;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">azoteterwa amaramare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Amasigarira nzoyamarisha inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">imbere y’abansi babo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />Ese ayo ngowe, kubona mama yaramvyaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">jewe nkankwa n’igihugu cose!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">Sinaguranye canke ngo ngire uwungurana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">ariko bose baramvuma.<verse eid="JER 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:11">“Ni ukuri nzogukiza ku bw’intumbero nziza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">kandi ni ukuri abansi bawe bazoza bagutakambira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">mu bihe vy’ivyago n’amarushwa.<verse eid="JER 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />Mbega umuntu yovuna icuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:12">icuma kivuye mu buraruko, canke umwakaka?<verse eid="JER 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />Ubutunzi bwanyu n’ibitayega vyanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">nzobitanga bibe isahu, ata kiguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">kubera ivyaha vyanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">biri mu gihugu canyu cose.<verse eid="JER 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />Nzobahindura abagurano b’abansi banyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">mu gihugu mutazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">kuko uburake bwanje buzokwatsa umuriro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">kandi uzokwaka uturira mwebwe.”<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />Yewe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, urabizi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">unyibuke kandi unyiteho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">Umporere abampama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Kuko uteba kuraka, ntuze unjane kure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">wibuke ko nihanganiye ibitutsi ku bwawe.<verse eid="JER 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />Aho amajambo yawe yaza, narayariye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">yambereye umunezero kandi yahimbaye umutima wanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">kuko nambaye izina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana Mushoboravyose.<verse eid="JER 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Sinigeze nicarana n’abacokoranyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">ngo nje mu bihimbaro vyabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">nicaye ukwanje kuko ukuboko kwawe kwari kuri jewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">kandi ukaba wanyujuje umubabaro.<verse eid="JER 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Ni kuki umubabaro wanje udashira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">n’igikomere canje ntigikire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Mbega umbereye nk’umugezi utari wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">nk’isoko umuntu atokwizigira?<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">“Niwihana, nzokugarukana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">kugira ngo unkorere;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">niwavuga amajambo abereye, ukareka ayatabereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">uzoba umuvugizi wanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Abo bantu baze bahindukire baze iyo uri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">ariko wewe ntuze uhindukire ngo uje iyo bari.<verse eid="JER 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Nzoguhindura nk’uruzitiro kuri aba bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">uruzitiro rukomeye rw’umwakaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">bazokugwanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">ariko ntibazokunesha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">kuko ndi kumwe nawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">ngo ndagukize,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />“Nzogukiza ndagukure mu maboko y’abanyakibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:21">ndagucungure abantu babi b’ibirara.”<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s1">Umusi w’ivyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />“Ntuze urongore ngo uvyarire abahungu n’abakobwa aha hantu. <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku vyerekeye abahungu n’abakobwa bavukiye muri iki gihugu no ku bagore ari bo ba nyina babo n’abagabo ari bo ba se babo. <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" />Bazokwicwa n’ingwara zihonya. Ntibazogandarirwa canke ngo bahambwe, ariko bazoba nk’amase yandagaye hasi. Bazohona bishwe n’inkota n’ikigoyi, kandi imivyimba yabo izoba indya z’inyoni zo mu kirere n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba.”<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />Kuko ibi ari vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Ntuze winjire aho bariko bararya ibiryazagu; ntuze uje kugandara canke ngo ugire ikibabarwe, kuko namaze gukuraho umugisha wanje, urukundo rwanje n’akagongwe kanje kuri ubu bwoko,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />“Abakuru n’abato bose hamwe bazopfira muri iki gihugu. Ntibazohambwa canke ngo bagandarirwe, kandi nta n’umwe azokwimosha inkomvorera canke ngo yikebagure ku bwabo. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Nta n’umwe azozana indya zo kugaburira abagandaye, naho yoba ari se canke nyina, nta n’umwe azotanga ivyo kunywa ngo abagarukireko.<verse eid="JER 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />Kandi ntuze winjire aho bari mu birori ngo wicare urye canke unywe.” <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli avuze: Mu maso yawe kandi ukiriho nzokuraho ijwi ry’akanyamuneza n’uguhimbarwa hamwe n’amajwi y’umukwe n’umugeni aha hantu.<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />“Niwabwira aba bantu ibi vyose maze bakakubaza bati: ‘Ni kuki <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yageze ivyo vyago ngo bituzeko? Ikibi twakoze ni igiki? Ni ikihe caha twacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu?’ <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />Maze uze ubishure uti: Ni kubera ba sogokuruza banyu bampevye, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, bagakurikira izindi mana bakazisaba bakazisenga. Barantaye ntibakurikira Ivyagezwe vyanje. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Ariko mwigenjeje nabi kurusha ba sogokuruza banyu. Raba ingene umuntu akurikira ugukomantara kw’umutima wiwe mubi aho kunyumvira. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Ni co gituma nzobaterera hanze y’iki gihugu nkabajana mu gihugu; baba mwebwe canke ba sogokuruza banyu mutigeze mumenya, aho ni ho muzokorera izindi mana ku murango no mw’ijoro, kuko ntazobagirira ubuntu na gatoya.”<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />“Ariko, imisi iraje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “aho abantu batazosubira kuvuga ngo: Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima, yakuye Abisirayeli muri Egiputa, <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />ariko bazovuga bati: Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima, yakuye Abisirayeli mu gihugu co mu buraruko no mu bihugu vyose yari yarabangarijemwo. Kuko nzobasubiza mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza.”<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />“Ariko ubu ngira ntume abarovyi benshi,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “babarobe. Inyuma y’ivyo nzotuma abahigi benshi, bazobahiga ku musozi wose n’akarambi kose no mu bihoro vyo mu bitandara. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Inyonga zanje ziri ku nzira zabo zose; ntizihishijwe inyonga zanje, canke ngo icaha cabo gihishwe inyonga zanje. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Nzobasubiriza mu nkoko incuro zibiri ibibi vyabo n’icaha cabo, kuko bahumanije igihugu canje n’ibishushanyo vyabo bitagira ubuzima, bakuzuza ishamvu yanje ibigirwamana vyabo vyo kwankwa urunuka.”<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nkomezi zanje n’igihome kinkingira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">ubwihisho bwanje mu gihe c’ivyago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">amahanga azoza kuri wewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">bavuye ku mpera z’isi bavuge bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">“Ba sogokuruza nta co bari batunze atari ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">imana zitagira akamaro nta ciza zabazaniye.<verse eid="JER 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Mbega abantu bokwiremera imana zabo bwite?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:20">Egome, ariko si imana z’ukuri!”<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />Nuko rero nzobigisha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">ubu ngiye kubigisha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">ububasha bwanje n’inkomezi zanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:21">Maze bazomenya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">ko izina ryanje ari <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />Icaha ca Yuda candikishijwe ikaramu y’icuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">gikorogoshowe n’isonga rya diyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">ku bisate vy’imitima yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">no ku mahembe y’ibicaniro vyabo.<verse eid="JER 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />N’abana babo baribuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">ibicaniro vyabo n’inkingi za Ashera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:2">biri i ruhande y’ibiti bitotahaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">no ku misozi miremire.<verse eid="JER 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />Umusozi wanje uri mu gihugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">n’ubutunzi bwanyu n’ibitayega vyanyu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">vyose nzobitanga bibe isahu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">hamwe n’ibitabo vyanyu vyo ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">kubera icaha cakorewe hose mu gihugu canyu.<verse eid="JER 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Kubera icaha canyu muzotakaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">ishamvu yanyu nabahaye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">Nzotuma muba abaja b’abansi banyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">mu gihugu mutazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">kuko mwakije uburake bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">kandi uburake bwanje buzobarurumbirako ibihe vyose.<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">“Aravumwe uwizigira umuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">akishimira umuntu w’inyama n’amaraso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">kandi umutima wiwe ukava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />Azoba nk’igiti kiri mu bugaragwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">ntazobona ugutera imbere kumuzako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">Azoba ahagadutse ho mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">mu gihugu c’umunyu ata muntu ahaba.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />Ariko hahiriwe umuntu yizigira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:7">ivyizigiro vyiwe bikaba muri we.<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />Azomera nk’igiti gitewe hafi y’amazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">gishorera imizi yaco mu migende y’amazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Ntigitinya mu gihe c’ubushuhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">ibibabi vyaco bihora bitotahaye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Nticiganyira no mu mwaka w’uruzuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">kandi nticigera kireka kwama ivyamwa.<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />Umutima uribesha kuruta ibintu vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">kandi ugwaye ingwara idakira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">Ni nde yowutahura?<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni jewe nsesa umutima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">nkagera umushaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">ngo ngerere umuntu wese ibihwanye n’ingene yigenza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">ibikwiranye n’ibikorwa vyiwe.”<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Nk’uko inkware ibundikira amagi itataye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">ni ko n’umuntu aronka ubutunzi mu buryo bubi ameze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Niyacagatiza imyaka yiwe yo kubaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">ubwo butunzi buzomuhunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">kandi kw’iherezo azoboneka ko ari igipfu.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Hariho intebe y’icubahiro ishizwe hejuru, uhereye kw’itanguriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:12">iyo ni ca kibanza c’urusengero.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, vyizigiro vy’Abisirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">abaguta bose bazomaramara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Abagutera ibitugu bazomera nk’abanditswe mu mukungugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">kuko bahevye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">ari we soko y’amazi y’ubugingo.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />Mvura, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nca nkomera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">nkiza nca nkira vy’ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">kuko ari wewe mpimbaza.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Baguma bambaza bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">“Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riri hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">Nirishike none!”<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />Sinahunze ngo ndeke kuba umwungere wawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">urazi ko ntipfuje umusi wo kwihebura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">Ibiva mu minwa yanje vyose biri imbere yawe.<verse eid="JER 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />Ntumbere agaterabwoba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:17">uri ubuhungiro bwanje ku musi w’ivyago.<verse eid="JER 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Abampiga nibamaramare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">ariko jeho undinde kumaramara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">nibagwe igihumura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">ariko jeho undinde iterabwoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Ubashitseko umusi w’ivyago;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">ubaranduze agatikizo incuro zibiri.<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwitondera Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye, ati: “Genda uhagarare kw’Irembo ry’Abantu, iryo umwami w’i Buyuda acamwo asohoka canke yinjira; wongere uhagarare no mu yandi marembo y’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe bami b’i Buyuda namwe bantu bose b’i Buyuda na mwebwe mwese muba i Yerusalemu mugaca muri aya marembo. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Mwiyubare ntihagire uwikorera umuzigo ku musi w’Isabato canke ngo awinjize aciye mu marembo y’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" />Ntimusohore umuzigo muwukuye mu mazu yanyu canke ngo hagire igikorwa na kimwe mukora ku musi w’Isabato, ariko mwitondere Isabato kuko ari iyera, nk’uko nategetse ba sogokuruza banyu. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Ariko baranse kunyumviriza canke ngo banabishireko umutima, bagamitse amazosi banka kunyumviriza canke kwemera gutozwa indero. <verse eid="JER 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />Ariko nimwanyumvira, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ntimwinjize imizigo muri iki gisagara kw’Isabato, mukitondera Isabato yera mu kutagira ico mukora kuri yo, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />nuko rero abami bicara ku ntebe ya Dawidi bazoca muri aya marembo y’iki gisagara bari kumwe n’abaganwa babo. Bazokwinjira bari mu mikogote no ku mafarasi yabo, baherekejwe n’abantu b’i Buyuda n’ababa i Yerusalemu, kandi iki gisagara kizokwama kirimwo abantu ibihe bidashira. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Abantu bazoza bavuye mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu mihana ikikije Yerusalemu, no mu ntara ya Benyamini no mu kiyaya co mu burengero, no mu ntara y’imisozi y’i Negebu, bazanye amashikanwa n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa, amashikanwa y’ifu, ibimota neza vyose vy’ishimwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Ariko nimutanyumvira ngo mwubahe Isabato ngo mureke kugira ivyo mwiremeka kuri yo mwinjira mu marembo y’i Yerusalemu ku musi w’Isabato, nuko nanje nzokwatsa umuriro udashobora kuzima mu marembo y’i Yerusalemu uzoturira ingoro zaho.’ ”<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s1">Umubumvyi n’ibumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, rivuga riti: <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“Manuka uje ku nzu y’umubumvyi, aho ni ho nzogira ico ndakubwiye.” <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Nuko ndamanuka ku nzu y’umubumvyi, maze nsanga ariko arabumba. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />Ariko inkono yariko arabumbamwo iryo bumba yononekarira mu ntoke ziwe; maze wa mubumvyi aca yongera kuribumbamwo iyindi nkono, ayigira uko yagomba.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ijambo ati: <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />“Yemwe ab’inzu ya Isirayeli, mbega sinoshobora kubagira nk’uko uwo mubumvyi yagize?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. “Nk’uko ibumba rimera mu ntoke z’umubumvyi, ni ko mumeze mu kuboko kwanje, yemwe ab’inzu ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" />Ninamenyesha ko ihanga canke ubwami bugiye kurandurwa, gusamburwa no gusangangurwa, <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" />maze iryo hanga naburiye niryihana rikava mu bibi vyaryo, nzokwigarura sindabateze ivyago nari nateguye kubahanisha. <verse eid="JER 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Kandi ikindi gihe ninamenyesha ko nzokwubaka ngashinga ihanga canke ubwami, <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />maze iryo hanga rigakora ibibi mu nyonga zanje ntirinyumvire, nuko nanje nzoreka kubashitsako ivyiza nari nabagereye.<verse eid="JER 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />Nuko rero bwira abantu b’i Buyuda n’ababa i Yerusalemu uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Raba! Nateguye icago kuri mwebwe kandi nateguye kubagirira nabi. Nuko nimureke inzira zanyu mbi, umwe wese, maze mugaruke mu nzira nziza mureke n’ibikorwa vyanyu bibi.’ <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Ariko bazokwishura bati: ‘Oya na mba. Tuzokwibandaniriza mu migambi yacu; umwe wese azokwibandaniriza mu gukomantara kw’umutima wiwe mubi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Nimubaze mu mahanga:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">ni nde yigeze yumva ikintu nk’ico?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Hariho ikintu c’ubuyobe cakozwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">n’umukobwa wanje Isirayeli!<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Mbega shelegi y’i Libani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">murigera mubona yavuye ku gitandara yiberako?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Amazi akanye ava muri yo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">arigera areka gutemba?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Ariko abantu banje baranyibagiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">baturirira ibimota neza imana zitagira ikimazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">bituma batsitara mu ngendo zabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">no mu nzira zabo za kera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Bituma baca mu nzira zidaharuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">no mu miharuro itubatse.<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Nzohindura igihugu cabo amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">ahantu abantu bavugiriza agahwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">abazohaca bose bazotangara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">kandi bazozunguza imitwe.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Nk’uko umuyaga uhuha uvuye mu buseruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">nzobasanzaza imbere y’abansi babo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">nzobatera umugongo ndabahishe mu nyonga hanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">ku musi w’ivyago vyabo.”<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Baravuze bati: “Nimuze, tugire imigambi yo kugwanya Yeremiya; kuko umuherezi ntazoreka kwigisha ivyagezwe, umunyabwenge ntazoreka gutanga impanuro, canke abavugishwa ngo bareke gushikiriza ijambo. Nimuze rero, tumugwanye mu kumuvuga nabi kandi ntitwumvirize ikintu na kimwe avuga.”<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />Nyumviriza, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:19">niwumve ivyo abanyagiriza bariko bavuga!<verse eid="JER 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Mbega iciza cokwishurwa ikibi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">Ariko banyimbiye ikinogo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Wibuke ko nahagaze imbere yawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">nkabavugira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">kugira ngo uhwamike uburake bwawe bubaveko.<verse eid="JER 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Nuko rero reka abana babo bicwe n’ikigoyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">batange babe musi y’ubushobozi bw’inkota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Abagore babo nibabe ingumba n’abapfakazi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">abagabo babo nibicwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">abahungu babo bicwe n’inkota mu ntambara.<verse eid="JER 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Amaborogo niyumvikane mu mazu yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">aho uzozana giturumbuka abo kubatera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">kuko bimvye ikinogo ngo ndakigwemwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">kandi banteze imitego yo mu mpisho.<verse eid="JER 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Ariko wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, urabizi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">inama bangira zo kunyica.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Ntubaharire ibibi vyabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">canke ngo uhanagure ivyaha vyabo imbere yawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Nibatsitarire imbere yawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">ubagwanye mu gihe c’uburake bwawe.<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Genda ugure umubindi w’ibumba ku mubumvyi. Jana na bamwe mu batware, hamwe n’abaherezi <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" />maze usohoke uje mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, i ruhande y’Irembo ry’Inkono zamenetse. Aho ni ho uzobamenyeshereza amajambo nzokubwira. <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />Uze uvuge uti: ‘Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe bami b’i Buyuda n’ababa i Yerusalemu. Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: Umviriza! Ngiye guteza icago aha hantu kizotuma mu matwi ya bose haza iminzerere. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Kuko bantaye maze bagahindura aha hantu ikibanza c’imana z’inyamahanga; barahatangiye ibimazi vy’imana batigeze bamenya; baba bo, baba ba sekuruza canke abami b’i Buyuda, kandi bujuje aha hantu amaraso y’abatagira icaha. <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" />Batavye ibibanza vya Bayali ahantu hejuru ku misozi ngo bahatangire abahungu babo kw’ibimazi babishikanire Bayali, ikintu ntigeze ndabategeka canke ngo ncishe no mu kanwa, canke ngo cigere kiza no mu bwenge bwanje. <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Nuko nimwiyubare, imisi iraje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, aho abantu batazoba bacita aha hantu Tofeti canke ikiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, ahubwo bazohita ikiyaya co gusogotwa.<verse eid="JER 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />Muri iki kibanza ni ho nzokwicira imigambi y’Ubuyuda n’iya Yerusalemu. Nzobareka bicwe n’inkota y’abansi babo, bagwe mu maboko y’ababahiga ngo babice, kandi imivyimba yabo nzoyihindura indya z’inyoni zo mu kirere n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Nzosambura iki gisagara ndagihindure umusaka n’akajoreza; abahaca bose bazohinda agashitsi bavuze agahwa kubera ibikomere vyaho. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Nzotuma barya inyama z’abahungu babo n’iz’abakobwa babo, kandi bazoryana mu gihe bazoba bugarijwe n’abansi babo barondera kubica.’<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />Maze uze umene uwo mubindi mu maso y’abazoba bajanye nawe, <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" />ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: Nzomenagura iri hanga n’iki gisagara nk’uko uwu mubindi w’umubumvyi umenaguritse kandi ata woshobora kuwunga. Bazohamba abapfuye muri Tofeti kugeza aho ata kibanza kizoba kigisigaye. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Uku ni ko nzogirira aha hantu n’abahaba, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. Nzohindura iki gisagara nk’i Tofeti. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />Amazu y’i Yerusalemu n’ingoro z’abami b’i Buyuda bizohumanywa nk’aha i Tofeti, amazu yose batuririyemwo ibimota neza, bageneye inyenyeri, bagashikanira ishikanwa ry’ibinyobwa izindi mana.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />Maze Yeremiya arataha avuye i Tofeti, aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yamutumye kuvugishwa, hanyuma ahagarara ku mbuga y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira abantu bose ati: <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli avuze: ‘Nimwumve! Ngiye guteza muri iki gisagara no mu mihana ihakikije ivyago vyose vyahagenewe, kuko bagamitse amazosi ntibumvire amajambo yanje.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremiya na Pashuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />Umuherezi Pashuri mwene Imeri, umukuru w’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yumvise Yeremiya avugishwa ivyo, <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />aca atuma abamukubita kandi amushira mu minyororo kw’Irembo rya Benyamini riri haruguru y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Bukeye bw’aho, Pashuri arekuye Yeremiya, akamukura mu minyororo, Yeremiya aca amubwira ati: “Uhereye ubu, izina ryawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhaye si Pashuri, ariko ni Magori Misabibu, ni ukuvuga uwuba mu bwoba. <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Nzokurungikira ibiteye ubwoba wewe na bagenzi bawe bose; kandi uzobabonesha amaso yawe ubwawe basogotwa inkota n’abansi babo. Nzotanga Abayuda bose mu maboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni, na we azobatwara i Babiloni canke abicishe inkota. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Nzotanga ubutunzi bwose bw’iki gisagara ndabuhe abansi babo, ibintu vyaho vyose, ivy’igiciro n’ibitayega vy’abami b’i Buyuda. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Nawe Pashuri n’ababa mu nzu yawe bose muzojanwa mu kinyago i Babiloni. Aho ni ho uzopfira uhambwe, wewe n’abagenzi bawe abo wavugishijweko ibinyoma.’ ”<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ugucura intimba kwa Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, warampenze, nanje ndemera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">wandushije inkomezi uranesha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Nahindutse ikimaramare umusi urira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">bose barantwenga.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Iyo mvuze, ndasemerera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">menyesha umuryano n’uguhona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">None rero ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryanzaniye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">gutukwa no gucokorwa rikarinda rirenga.<verse eid="JER 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />Ariko iyo mvuze nti: “Sinzovuga ijambo ryiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">canke ngo nsubire kuvuga mw’izina ryiwe,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">ijambo ryiwe rica rimera nk’umuriro mu mutima wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">umuriro ukaka mu magufa yanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Ndarushe no kuvyihanganira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ni ukuri, sindabishoboye.<verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Numva benshi bongorerana bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">“Ibiteye ubwoba impande zose!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">Murege! Reka tumurege!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Abagenzi banje bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">biteze ko ntirimuka, bakavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">“Kumbure bomusuka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">natwe tugaca tumunesha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">tukamwihora.”<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe nanje nk’umuhizi w’inkomezi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">ni co gituma abangwanya bazotsitara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">ntibazonesha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Bazotemba rwose maze bamaramare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">kandi ibiteterwe vyabo ntibizokwigera vyibagiranwa.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, wewe usuzuma abagororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">ugatandukanya umutima n’umushaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">uze umpe kubona uguhora kwawe kuri bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">kuko urubanza rwanje naruguhaye.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />Ririmbira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">Himbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Akiza ubugingo bw’umukene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">abukuye mu maboko y’abanyakibi.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />Umusi navukiyeko urakavumwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:14">Umusi mama yamvyariyeko ntugahezagirwe!<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />Uwazaniye inkuru data arakavumwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">uwatumye anezerwa, akavuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">“Uronse umwana, umuhungu!”<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />Uwo muntu arakaba nk’ibisagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yasambuye ata kagongwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Arakumva akaruru mu gatondo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">akaruru k’intambara mu mashoka.<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />Kubera ko atanyishe nkiri mu nda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">ngo mama ampindukire imva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">ku buryo nigumira muri we ibihe vyose.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Ni kuki navutse nkava mu nda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">ngo mbone umubabaro n’amarushwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">kandi ngo ndangirize imisi yanje mu biteterwe?<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s1">Imana yanka ivyo Zedekiya yasavye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya igihe umwami Zedekiya yamurungikira Pashuri mwene Malikiya n’umuherezi Zefaniya mwene Mayaseya. Bavuga bati: <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" />“Dusigurize <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubu kuko Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni ariko aradutera. Kumbure <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yodukorera ibitangaza nko mu bihe vya kera maze akagenda akareka kudutera.”<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Ariko Yeremiya arabishura ati: “Bwira Zedekiya muti: <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: Ngiye kuguhindukirizako ibigwanisho vyose vy’intambara ufise mu ntoke zawe, ivyo uriko urakoresha mu kugwanya umwami w’i Babiloni n’Abanyababiloni bari inyuma y’uruzitiro bamaze kukwugariza. Kandi nzobakoraniriza hagati muri iki gisagara. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />Jewe ubwanje nzokugwanya n’ukuboko kwanje kubanguye kandi kw’inkomezi no mu burake n’ubushangashirwe n’ishavu ryinshi. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Nzokwica abantu bose baba muri kino gisagara, abantu n’ibikoko, kandi bazokwicwa n’ivyago biteye ubwoba. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />Inyuma y’ivyo, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda, abaganwa biwe n’abantu bo muri iki gisagara bazosigara batishwe n’icago, inkota n’ikigoyi, nzobatanga mu maboko ya Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni n’abansi babo bashaka kubamara. Azobicisha inkota; ntazobagirira imbabazi canke akagongwe canke ikibabarwe.’<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />Vyongeye, bwira abantu muti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Raba, ngira nshire imbere yanyu inzira y’ubugingo n’inzira y’urupfu. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Umuntu wese azoguma muri iki gisagara azokwicishwa inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza. Ariko uwuzokivamwo akishikana ku Banyababiloni babugarije azobaho; azokiza ubugingo bwiwe. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Nafashe ingingo yo kugirira nabi iki gisagara, si ineza, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. Kizotangwa mu maboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni, na we azogitongoza umuriro.’<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />Vyongeye, bwira abo mu nzu y’ingoma y’i Buyuda muti: ‘Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />Yemwe abo mu nzu ya Dawidi, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Nimuce imanza zibereye uko bukeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">mukure mu maboko y’uwuhahaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">uwanyazwe utwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">ahandi ho uburake bwanje buzoziriringa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">kubera ibibi mwakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">buzorurumba nk’umuriro utazima.<verse eid="JER 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />Nzobagwanya mwebwe, ab’i Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">mwebwe mwibera hejuru y’iki kiyaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">mu kibande c’amabuye, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">mwebwe muvuga muti: “Ni nde yoza kutugwanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">Ni nde yokwinjira mu bwihisho bwacu?”<verse eid="JER 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Nzobahana ibikwiranye n’ibikorwa vyanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Nzokwatsa umuriro mu mashamba yanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">na wo uzotongora ibintu vyose bibakikije.’ ”<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s1">Abami babi bacirwa urubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye: “Manuka uje ku kirimba c’umwami w’i Buyuda, maze uvuge ubu butumwa uti: <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />‘Niwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yewe mwami w’i Buyuda, wicara ku ntebe y’ubwami ya Dawidi, namwe baganwa hamwe n’abantu banyu muca muri aya marembo. <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Nimukore ibigororotse n’ibibereye, mukize uwanyazwe mumukure mu maboko y’uwumucinyiza. Ntimugirire nabi canke ngo murenganye umunyamahanga, impfuvyi canke umupfakazi, kandi ntimuvishirize aha hantu amaraso y’uwutagira icaha. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Kuko nimwagira umwete wo kwitondera aya mabwirizwa, abami bo kwicara ku ntebe y’ubwami ya Dawidi bazokwama baca muri aya marembo y’iki kirimba, bari mu mikogote kandi bagendera ku mafarasi, baherekejwe n’abaganwa babo n’abantu babo. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" />Ariko nimutitondera aya mabwirizwa, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, indahiro ni jewe nyene; aha hantu hazohinduka umusaka.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku vyerekeye iki kirimba c’umwami w’i Buyuda, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">“Naho mumeze nka Gileyadi kuri jewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">mukamera nk’agatwe k’umusozi w’i Libani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">ni ukuri nzoguhindura nk’ubugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">nk’ibisagara ata muntu abibamwo.<verse eid="JER 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Nzorungika abo kugusambura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">umuntu wese afise ikigwanisho ciwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">maze bazoca ibiti vyizavyiza vy’amasederi yawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">babiterere mu muriro.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />Abantu bo mu bihugu vyinshi bazoca i ruhande y’iki gisagara maze babazanye bati: ‘Ni kuki <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye ibi bintu iki gisagara gihambaye?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Maze bazokwishura bati: ‘Ni kubera bahemutse kw’isezerano ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, bagasenga bakongera bagakorera izindi mana.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Ntimuze muririre umwami apfuye canke ngo mumugandararire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">ahubwo, muze muborogere uwujanywe nk’inyagano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">kuko atazogaruka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">canke ngo asubire kubona igihugu c’amavukiro.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />Kuko ibi ari vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku vyerekeye Shalumu mwene Yosiya, yasubiye ku ngoma ya se umwami w’i Buyuda ariko akaba yarajanywe nk’inyagano: “Ntazogaruka. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Azopfira mu gihugu bamujanyemwo nk’inyagano; ntazosubira kubona iki gihugu.<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />Aragowe uwubakisha ikirimba ciwe ibigabitanyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">akubakisha ivyumba vyo hejuru akarenganyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">agakoresha abantu biwe atabahemba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">ntabahembe ku bw’ubutame bwabo.<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />Avuga ati: ‘Nzokwiyubakira ikirimba kinini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">gifise ivyumba vyo hejuru vyagutse.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Maze agaca amadirisha manini kuri co,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">akayashariza akoresheje amasederi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">hamwe n’irangi ritukura.<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />Mbega kugwiza amasederi menshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">ni kwo kukugira umwami?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Mbega so ntiyari afise ivyokurya n’ivyokunywa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">Yakoze ibigororotse n’ibikwiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">kandi vyose vyagenze neza kuri we.<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />Yaraburanira abakene n’impahazwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">maze vyose bikagenda neza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Mbega ivyo si co bisigura kumenya jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />“Ariko amaso yawe n’umutima wawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">vyose wabishize ku nyungu mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">ku kuvisha amaraso y’uwutagira icaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">gucinyiza no kunyaga.”<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze kuri Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">“Ntibazomugandarira, ngo bagire bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘Yo! Musazanje! Yo! Mushikanje!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Ntibazomugandarira bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘Yo! Databuja! Yo! Nyakwubahwa!’<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Azohambwa nk’indogoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">azokwegwa hasi maze atererwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">hanze y’amarembo y’i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />Duga i Libani maze usemerere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">ijwi ryawe ryumvikane i Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">semerera uri i Abarimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">kuko abo wikundiye bamenaguwe.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Narakuburiye igihe wari ukiri mu mutekano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">ariko uravuga uti: ‘Sinzokwumviriza!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Uko ni ko wagenda kuva mu buto bwawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">ntiwanyumviye.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />Umuyaga uzotwara abungere bawe ahandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">n’abo wikundiye bazojanwa ari inyagano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Maze na we uzomaramara uteterwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">ku bw’ibibi vyawe.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Wewe uba i Libani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">wubatse icari cawe mu masederi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">ese ukuntu uzoboroga mu gihe uburibwe buzogufata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">nk’umugore afashwe n’ibise!”<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />“Ndahiye uguhoraho kwanje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “naho wewe, Yehoyakini mwene Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda, wari impeta yo ku kuboko kwanje kw’i buryo, nzogukura ku rutoke rwanje. <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />Nzogutanga mu maboko y’abashaka kukwica, abo utinya, ari bo Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni n’Abanyababiloni. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />Wewe na nyoko yakuvyaye nzobirukana muje mu kindi gihugu mutavukiyemwo, kandi aho ni ho mwempi muzopfira. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Ntuzogaruka muri iki gihugu ico wipfuza kugarukamwo.”<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Mbega uwu muntu Yehoyakini, si umuntu yankwa, si inkono imenetse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">ikintu ata n’umwe agishaka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Ni kuki we n’abana biwe birukanywe mu gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">bakaja mu gihugu batigeze bamenya?<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />Yewe wa gihugu, wa gihugu, wa gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:29">niwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">“Nimwandike uwu muntu nk’aho ari umuntu atagira abana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">umuntu atazokwigera atera imbere mu buzima bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">kuko ata wo mu ruvyaro rwiwe azotera imbere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">nta n’umwe azokwicara ku ntebe y’ubwami ya Dawidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">ngo aganze i Buyuda.<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s1">Uwitwa Shami agororoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />Haragowe abungere bariko baratikiza bongera basanzaza intama zo mu buragiro bwanje!” Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Ku bw’ivyo, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, abungere baragira intama zanje: “Kubera mwasanzaje umukuku wanje mukazirukana ntimuzibabare, nzobasukako igihano kubera ibibi mwakoze,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />“Jewe ubwanje nzokwegeranya amasigarira y’umukuku wanje ndawukure mu bihugu nabirukaniyemwo maze ndabagarukane mu buragiro bwabo, aho bazogwirira kandi bakongerekana. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Nzoshiraho abungere babo bazobaragira, kandi ntibazosubira gutinya canke ngo bagwe igihumura, kandi nta n’umwe azobura muri bo,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />“Ehe imisi iraje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">“aho nzohagurukiriza Dawidi uwitwa Shami agororotse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">umwami azoganzisha ubwenge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">kandi agakora ibiroranye n’ibigororotse mu gihugu.<verse eid="JER 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Mu misi yiwe Yuda azokizwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">na Isirayeli azoba mu mutekano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">Iri ni ryo zina azokwitwa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni Ukugororoka Kwacu.”<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />“Nuko rero, imisi iraje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “aho abantu batazosubira kuvuga ngo: ‘Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima,’ yakuye Abisirayeli muri Egiputa, <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />ariko bazovuga bati: ‘Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima,’ yakuye uruvyaro rwa Isirayeli mu gihugu co mu buraruko mu bihugu yari yarabangarijemwo. Maze bazokwibera mu gihugu cabo bwite.”<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba kamenyi bavuga ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Ku vyerekeye ba kamenyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Umutima wanje umenekeye muri jewe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">amagufa yanje yose ahinda agashitsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Meze nk’imborerwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">meze nk’umugabo akomeye mugabo yaneshejwe n’umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">n’amajambo yiwe yera.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Igihugu cuzuye abasambanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">kubera umuvumo utumye igihugu kigandara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">kandi uburagiro bwo mu bugaragwa burakabiranye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Abavugishwa bakurikira ikibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">kandi bakoresha ububasha bwabo ukutari kwo.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />“Umuvugishwa n’umuherezi bompi nta vy’Imana bababaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">no mu Ngoro yanje nsangamwo ukugira nabi kwabo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />“Ni co gituma inzira yabo izoba iy’ubunyerere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">bazokwirukanirwa mu mwiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">kandi aho ni ho bazogwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Nzobateza icago</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">mu mwaka bazohanirwamwo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />“Mu bavugishwa b’i Samariya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">nabonye ikintu gisesema:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Bavugishwa mw’izina rya Bayali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">bakazimiza abantu banje b’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />No mu bavugishwa b’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">Nabonye ikintu c’ubuyobe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">barasambana kandi bakibera mu binyoma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Bakomeza amaboko y’abanyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe ava mu bibi vyiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Kuri jewe bose bameze nka Sodomu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">abantu b’i Yerusalemu bameze nka Gomora.”<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />Nuko rero, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze ku vyerekeye abo bavugishwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">“Nzobarisha ivyokurya birura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">kandi nzobanywesha amazi arimwo ishano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">kuko mu bavugishwa babo b’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">havuyemwo ukutubaha Imana kwakwiye mu gihugu hose.”<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">“Ntiwumvirize ivyo abo bavugishwa babavugako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">babuzuza ivyizigiro bitari vyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">Bavuga ivyo beretswe bikuriye mu mitwe yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">bitavuye mu kanwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Bashishikara babwira abankengera bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ngo: Muzoba amahoro.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">N’abashishikara inzira z’ugukomantara kw’imitima yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">bababwira bati: ‘Nta co muzoba.’<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />Ariko ni nde wo muri bo yahagaze mu nama y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">ngo abone canke yumve ijambo ryiwe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">Ni nde yumvirije canke yumvise ijambo ryiwe?<verse eid="JER 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Raba, isegenya y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">izoza ivuye mu burake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">igihuhusi kizomanuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">kizunguruke ku mitwe y’abanyakibi.<verse eid="JER 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntibuzosubira inyuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">kugeza aho azoba yashikije</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">imigabo yo mu mutima wiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Mu misi izoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">muzobitahura neza.<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />Sinatumye abo ba kamenyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">ariko bagiye bariruka bajanye ubutumwa bwabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">sinavuganye na bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">ariko baravugishijwe.<verse eid="JER 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Mugabo iyo baba barashishikaye mu nama yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">bari kumenyesha abantu banje amajambo yanje</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">kandi baba baratumye bahindukira bakava mu nzira zabo mbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">no mu bikorwa vyabo bibi.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />Mbega ndi Imana ya hafi gusa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:23">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:23">“mbega sindi n’Imana ya kure na ho?<verse eid="JER 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Hari uwokwinyegeza ahantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">kugira ngo sindamubone?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:24">“Mbega sinuzuye ijuru n’isi?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />“Numvise ivyo abavugishwa bavuga bavugishwa ibinyoma mw’izina ryanje. Bavuga bati: ‘Narose! Narose!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Ivyo bizobandanya gushika ryari mu mitima y’abo ba kamenyi babesha, bavugishwa ibitagira epfo na ruguru vyo mu bugunge bwabo? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Biyumvira ko inzozi babwirana zizotuma abantu banje bibagira izina ryanje, nk’uko ba sekuruza baryibagiye mu gusenga Bayali? <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Uwuvugishwa afise ivyo yarose nabivuge, ariko uwufise ijambo ryanje narivuge mu bwizigirwa. Mbega ivyatsi bipfana iki n’imbuto?” Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza. <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />“Mbega ijambo ryanje si nk’umuriro,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza, “canke si nk’inyundo imenagura urutare?<verse eid="JER 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />Nuko rero,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “nzogwanya abo bavugishwa b’ibisuma bibana amajambo; maze bakavuga ngo avuye iwanje. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Ego cane,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “nzogwanya abo bavugishwa bavuga amajambo bishakiye bakavuga bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze.’ <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Ni ivy’ukuri, nzogwanya abo berekwa inzozi z’ibinyoma,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. “Babibwira abantu banje bakabazimirisha ivyo binyoma vyabo, kandi ntabatumye canke ntabatoranije. Nta co bamariye aba bantu na mba,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuvugishwa kw’ibinyoma n’abavugishwa ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />“Aba bantu canke uwuvugishwa canke umuherezi, nibakubaza bati: ‘Mbega ijambo rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni irihe?’ Uze ubabaze uti: ‘Ijambo irihe? Nzobaheba, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Uwuvugishwa canke umuherezi canke umuntu wese niyavuga ati: ‘Iri ni ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,’ nzomuhana we n’abo mu nzu yiwe. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Ibi ni vyo umwe wese aguma abwira mugenziwe canke uwo mu muryango w’iwabo ati: ‘Mbega inyishu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni iyihe?’ canke ati: ‘Mbega <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ngw’iki?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Ariko ntimuze musubire kuvuga ngo: ‘Iri ni ijambo rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>’ kuko ijambo ry’umuntu wese ku giti ciwe rizoba ari irivuzwe na we. Rero mugoreka amajambo y’Imana nzima, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana yacu. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Mushishikara mubaza kamenyi ngo: ‘Mbega Imana yakwishuye iki?’ canke ngo: ‘Mbega <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze iki?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Naho mwemeza ngo: ‘Iri ni ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,’ uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Mwakoresheje amajambo avuga ngo: ‘Iri ni ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,’ naho nari nababujije kuvuga ngo: ‘Iri ni ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />Ni co gituma, vy’ukuri nzobibagira maze ndabaterere kure y’aho ndi mwe n’igisagara nabahaye mwebwe na ba sogokuruza banyu. <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Nzoshitsa kuri mwebwe agakengerwe n’ibimaramare bidashira kandi bitazokwigera vyibagirwa.”<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ibiseke bibiri vy’insukoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />Igihe Yehoyakini mwene Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda n’abatware bose, abakora utugenegene n’abanyamyuga b’i Buyuda bari bamaze kujanwa i Babiloni na Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni abakuye i Yerusalemu, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanyeretse ibiseke bibiri vy’insukoni biri imbere y’Ingoro y’Uhoraho. <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Igiseke kimwe carimwo insukoni nziza cane, nk’insukoni zeze imbere y’izindi, igiseke kindi carimwo insukoni mbi cane, ku buryo zitashobora kuribwa.<verse eid="JER 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambaza ati: “Mbega ubona iki ga Yeremiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Ndishura nti: “Mbona insukoni. Muri zo harimwo nziza cane, ariko harimwo na mbi cane ku buryo zitoribwa.”<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ijambo ati: <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Nk’uko izo nsukoni nziza zimeze, ni ko mbona abatwawe nk’inyagano b’i Buyuda, abo narungitse ngo bave aha hantu baje mu gihugu c’Abanyababiloni. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Inyonga zanje zizoba kuri bo kugira ngo ndabagirire neza, kandi nzobagarukana muri iki gihugu. Nzobubaka sinzobasambura, nzobateragira sinzobarandura. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Nzobaha umutima wo kumenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Bazoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba Imana yabo, bazongarukako n’umutima wabo wose.’<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />Ariko nk’uko zirya nsukoni zindi ari mbi, gushika n’aho zitoribwa, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, uko ni ko nzogirira Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda, abatware biwe n’amasigarira y’ab’i Yerusalemu, baba abagumye mu gihugu canke abahungiye muri Egiputa. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Nzobahindura agaterabwoba kandi bazoba nk’icago ku bwami bwose bwo mw’isi, bazoba agatukisha n’agatwengo, agacamugani n’umuvumo ahantu hose nzoba nabasanzarije. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Nzotuma inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza kuri bo gushika aho bazoherengeterera mu gihugu nabahaye bo na ba sekuruza babo.”<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s1">Imyaka mirongo indwi yo mu kinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />Ijambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’Uhoraho, rigenewe abantu bose b’i Buyuda, mu mwaka ugira kane Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, ukaba wari umwaka wa mbere Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni ari ku ngoma. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Nuko Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana abwira abantu bose b’i Buyuda n’ababa i Yerusalemu ati: <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />Kumara imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itatu, uhereye umwaka ugira icumi na gatatu Yosiya mwene Amoni umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma kugeza n’uwu musi, Uhoraho yampaye ijambo ndababwira kandi navuganye namwe ibihe vyinshi, ariko ntimwumva.<verse eid="JER 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />Kandi naho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarungitse abasavyi biwe yavugisha kuri mwebwe kenshi yongera yisubiriza, ntimwumviye canke ngo mubishireko umutima. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Barababwiye bati: “Hindukira, umwe wese ave mu nzira ziwe mbi n’ibikorwa vyiwe bibi, maze muzoshobore kuguma mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye mwebwe na ba sogokuruza banyu ibihe vyose. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Mureke gukurikira izindi mana, kuzikorera no kuzisaba, ntimundatse n’ibikorwa vy’intoke zanyu, maze nanje nta co nzobagira.”<verse eid="JER 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />“Ariko ntimwanyumviye,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “maze murandatsa mundakishije ibikorwa vy’intoke zanyu, bituma mwikwegera ingorane.”<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze ibi: “Ko mutumviye amajambo yanje, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />nzohamagaza amahanga yose yo mu buraruko n’umusavyi wanje Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “maze batere iki gihugu n’abakibamwo n’amahanga yose ahakikuje. Nzobarandura ndabaherengeteze, kandi ndabahindure agaterabwoba n’abo kwankwa habe umusaka ibihe vyose. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" />Nzokuraho amajwi y’umunezero, n’imisi mikuru, amajwi y’umukwe n’umugeni, ijwi ry’urusyo n’umuco w’itara. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" />Iki gihugu cose kizohinduka umusaka, kandi aya mahanga azokorera umwami w’i Babiloni kumara imyaka mirongo indwi.<verse eid="JER 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />Ariko, iyo myaka mirongo indwi niyashira, nzohana uwo mwami w’i Babiloni n’ihanga ryiwe, igihugu c’Abanyababiloni, kubera ukugabitanya kwabo,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “maze ndahahindure umusaka ibihe vyose. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Nzoshitsa kuri ico gihugu ibintu vyose navuze ko nzogiteza, vya bindi vyose vyanditswe muri iki gitabu vyavugishijwe na Yeremiya ku mahanga yose. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Bo ubwabo bazoba abagurano b’amahanga menshi n’abami bakomeye; nzobasubiriza mu nkoko ibikorwa bakoze n’ivyo bakoresheje intoke zabo.”<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igikombe c’uburake bw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, yambwiye, ati: “Akira iki gikombe kiri mu ntoke zanje cuzuye umuvinyu w’uburake bwanje maze ukinyweshe amahanga yose nzogutumako. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Nibakinywako, bazozungurirwa badandabagirane kubera inkota nzoba ndungitse hagati muri bo.”<verse eid="JER 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Nuko nakira ico gikombe mu kuboko kw’Uhoraho ndakinywesha amahanga yose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yantumyeko.<verse eid="JER 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Yerusalemu n’ibisagara vy’i Buyuda, abami baho n’abaganwa, ngo bihinduke imisaka n’ahantu hateye ubwoba ho gucokorwa no kuvumwa, nk’uko biri uwu musi;<verse eid="JER 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Farawo umwami w’i Egiputa, abasavyi biwe, abaganwa biwe n’abantu biwe bose; <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />n’abanyamahanga bose baba aho;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">abami bose bo muri Uzi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">abami bose bo mu Bafilisitiya (abo muri Ashikeloni, i Gaza, i Ekuroni, n’abantu basigaye i Ashidodi);<verse eid="JER 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />muri Edomu, i Mowabu n’i Amoni;<verse eid="JER 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />abami bose b’i Tiro n’i Sidoni;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:22">abami bo mu bizinga biri hakurya y’ikiyaga;<verse eid="JER 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />i Dedani, i Tema, i Buzi n’abari kure;<verse eid="JER 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />abami bose b’i Arabiya n’abami bose bo mu bihugu vy’abanyamahanga baba mu bugaragwa;<verse eid="JER 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />abami bose b’i Zimuri, i Elamu n’i Mediya;<verse eid="JER 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />n’abami bose bo mu buraruko, abo hafi n’abari kure, uko bakurikirana, ubwami bwose buri kw’isi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:26">Kandi inyuma yabwo bwose, umwami w’i Sheshaki na we nyene azonywako.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />Maze uze ubabwire uti: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: ‘Nimunywe kandi muborerwe maze mudahwe, hanyuma mugwe ubutakivyuka kubera inkota nzorungika muri mwebwe.’ <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />Ariko nibanka kwakira igikombe kiri mu kuboko kwawe ngo bakinywereko, uze ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: Mutegerezwa kukinywako! <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Raba, ntanguye guteza icago iki gisagara citirirwa izina ryanje, none muzogenda mudahanywe? Ntimuzogenda mudahanywe, kuko mpamagaye inkota ngo ize ku bari mw’isi bose, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.’<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />Nuko rero nuvugishwe aya majambo yose kuri bo, ubabwire uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwivuga ari iyo hejuru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">azoturagara ari ahera hiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">maze yivuge n’inkomezi atontomera iki gihugu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Azosemerera nk’abadandaza inzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">akankamire ababa kw’isi yose.<verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Urwo rwamo ruzokwumvikana gushika ku mpera z’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwagiriza amahanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">azocira amateka abantu bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">maze yicishe inkota ababi bose,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">“Raba, icago kiriko kirakwira hose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">kiva kw’ihanga kija ku rindi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">isegenya ihambaye iraje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">iva ku mpera y’isi ija ku yindi.”<verse eid="JER 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />Muri ico gihe abasogoswe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bazoba ahantu hose, kuva ku mpera y’isi imwe gushika ku yindi. Ntibazogandarirwa canke ngo begeranywe canke ngo bahambwe, ahubwo bazoba nk’amase yandagaye ku musozi.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Murire muboroge, yemwe bungere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">mwitembagaze mu mukungugu, yemwe bakuru b’umukuku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Kuko igihe canyu co kwicishwa inkota gishitse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">muzogwa hasi nk’ikibumbano c’igiciro.<verse eid="JER 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Abungere ntibazoronka aho bahungira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:35">abarongoye umukuku nta buhungiro bazoronka.<verse eid="JER 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Umve amaborogo y’abungere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">ugutakamba kw’abarongoye umukuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aranduye rwose uburagiro.<verse eid="JER 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />Uburagiro butotahaye bubaye uruharabuga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:37">kubera uburake buhambaye bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Azoheba ikibundo ciwe nk’intambwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">kandi igihugu cabo kizoba umusaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">kubera inkota y’uwuhonya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">no kubera uburake bw’inkazi bw’Uhoraho.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremiya aterwa ubwoba ko azokwicwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />Ingoma ya Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda igitangura, ni ho iri jambo ryaje rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riti: <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Hagarara mu rugo rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> maze ubwire abantu bose bo mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda baza gusengera mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ivyo nzogutegeka vyose; ntugire ikintu na kimwe ukuramwo. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Kumbure bazokwumviriza maze umwe wese areke inzira yiwe mbi. Nuko nanje nzokwigarura ngo sindabarekurireko icago nagabiye kubashitsako kubera ibibi bakoze. <verse eid="JER 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Uze ubabwire uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Nimutanyumvira ngo mwitondere Ivyagezwe vyanje, ivyo nabashize imbere, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />kandi nimutumvira amajambo y’abasavyi banje ari bo bavugishwa, abo nabatumyeko ibihe vyinshi; naho mutabumviye, <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" />nuko nzohindura iyi Ngoro nk’i Shilo, n’iki gisagara nzogihindura aho kuvumwa mu mahanga yose yo kw’isi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />Abaherezi, abavugishwa hamwe n’abantu bose bumva Yeremiya avuga ayo majambo ari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Ariko Yeremiya agiheza kubwira abantu ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamutumye kuvuga vyose, abaherezi, abavugishwa n’abantu bose baramufata bavuga bati: “Utegerezwa gupfa! <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Ni kuki uvugishwa mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko iyi Ngoro izomera nk’i Shilo kandi iki gisagara kikazoba umusaka ata muntu agishobora kukibamwo?” Maze abantu bose bakoranira aho ari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Abatware b’i Buyuda bumvise ivyo, baraduga bava ku kirimba c’umwami baja ku Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hanyuma bicara mu bibanza vyabo vyari ku rwinjiriro rwo kw’Irembo Rishasha ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Nuko abaherezi n’abavugishwa babwira abatware n’abantu bose bati: “Uyu muntu akwiye gucirwa urubanza rwo gupfa kuko yavugishijwe ibibi kuri iki gisagara. Mwavyiyumviye n’amatwi yanyu ubwanyu!”<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Nuko Yeremiya abwira abatware n’abantu bose ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yantumye kuvugishwa kuri iyi Ngoro n’iki gisagara ibintu vyose mwamaze kwumva. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />None rero nimuhindure ingeso zanyu n’ibikorwa vyanyu maze mwumvire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwigarura ngo ntabateze icago yavuze ko azobateza. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Ku binyerekeye ndi mu maboko yanyu; nimunkoze ico mubona ari ciza kandi kibereye. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Ariko mumenye neza ko nimwanyica, muzoba mushize kuri mwebwe, ku gisagara canyu no ku bantu bose bakibamwo, amaraso y’uwutagira icaha, kuko mu vy’ukuri <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yandungitse kuri mwebwe ngo ndababwire ayo majambo yose muriko murumva.”<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Nuko rero abatware n’abantu bose babwira abaherezi n’abavugishwa bati: “Uyu muntu ntakwiye gucirwa urubanza rwo gupfa! Yatubwiye amajambo mw’izina ry’Uhoraho Imana yacu.”<verse eid="JER 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Bamwe mu bakurambere bo mu gihugu bigira imbere babwira ikoraniro ryose bati: <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />“Mika w’i Moresheti yaravugishijwe mu gihe ca Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda. Yabwiye abantu bose b’i Buyuda ati: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">Siyoni hazorimwa hamere nk’umurima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">Yerusalemu hazoba ikigunguzi c’isakamburira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">umusozi wubatsweko Ingoro na wo uzomerako ibisaka.’<verse eid="JER 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />Yaba umwami Hezekiya w’i Buyuda canke uwundi uwo ari we wese w’i Buyuda, hari uwamwishe? Mbega Hezekiya ntiyubashe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akarondera ubuntu bwayo? Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyigaruye, ngo ntashitse ivyago yari yabagereye? Ni twebwe nyene tugomba kwikwegera ivyago!”<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />Kandi Uriya mwene Shemaya w’i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu ni uwundi muntu yavugishijwe mw’izina ry’Uhoraho; avugishwa ivyo nyene kuri iki gisagara n’iki gihugu nk’uko Yeremiya yavuze. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Nuko umwami Yehoyakimu n’abatware biwe n’abakuru b’ingabo bumvise ayo majambo yiwe, umwami aca afata ingingo yo kumwica. Ariko Uriya avyumvise, agira ubwoba, aca arahunga aja muri Egiputa. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Umwami Yehoyakimu arungika Elunatani mwene Akubori muri Egiputa, bari kumwe n’abandi bantu. <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />Bakura Uriya muri Egiputa bamushira umwami Yehoyakimu, na we amwicisha inkota umuvyimba bawuterera aho bahamba abantu basanzwe.<verse eid="JER 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Vyongeye, Ahikamu mwene Shafani ashigikira Yeremiya, bituma adashirwa mu maboko y’abantu ngo bamwice.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s1">Abayuda bakorera Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Mu bihe vya mbere vy’ingoma ya Zedekiya mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda, iri jambo ni ho ryatumwa kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye: “Ukore ingogo n’ibiziriko hanyuma ubishire ku bitugu vyawe. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Maze utumeko abami: uwa Edomu, uwa Mowabu, uwa Amoni, uwa Tiro n’uwa Sidoni, ubicishije ku ntumwa zaje i Yerusalemu kwa Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Uze ubahe ubutumwa bashira ba shebuja buvuga buti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: Muze mubwire ba shobuja muti: <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />Nakoresheje ubushobozi bwanje buhambaye n’ukuboko kwanje kw’inkomezi mu kurema isi n’abantu bayibako, n’ibikoko biri kuri yo, ndabiremesha ukuboko kwanje kubanguye, kandi ndabiha uwo ngomvye wese. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />None rero ngira nshire ibihugu vyanyu mu maboko y’umusavyi wanje Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni; kandi n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba bizomwubaha. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Amahanga yose azomukorera we n’umuhungu wiwe n’umwuzukuru wiwe kugeza aho igihe c’igihugu ciwe kizorangirira. Maze na we amahanga menshi n’abami bahambaye bazoza bamuganze.<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />Ariko nihagira ihanga na rimwe canke ubwami na bumwe bwanka gukorera Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni canke bakanka kwicisha bugufi musi y’ingogo yiwe, nzohanisha iryo hanga inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, gushika ndagisambuje ukuboko kwiwe. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Nuko rero ntimwumvirize abavugishwa banyu, canke abahamagara imizimu, abasobanura inzozi, abarozi canke abapfumu banyu bazobabwira bati: Ntimuzokorera umwami w’i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Bavugishwa ibinyoma imbere yanyu, ari vyo bizotuma mujanwa kure y’ibihugu vyanyu; nzobirukana kandi muzohonerayo. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Ariko nihagira ihanga ryunama musi y’ingogo y’umwami w’i Babiloni rikamukorera, nzotuma iryo hanga riguma mu gihugu ngo bakirime bongere bakibemwo, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Narungikiye ubwo butumwa nyene Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda. Ndamubwira nti: “Tega ibitugu vyawe ingogo y’umwami w’i Babiloni; umukorere we n’abantu biwe, ni ho uzobaho. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Ni iki cotuma wewe n’abantu bawe mupfa mwishwe n’inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yateguye kuzokwicisha ihanga ryose ritazosaba umwami w’i Babiloni? <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Ntiwumvirize amajambo y’abavugishwa bakubwira ngo: ‘ntuzokorera umwami w’i Babiloni,’ kuko bariko bavugishwa ibinyoma. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />‘Si jewe nabatumye,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. Bavugishwa ibinyoma mw’izina ryanje. Ni co gituma nzobirukana aha hantu maze mupfireyo, mwebwe n’abo bavugishwa banyu bavugishwa imbere yanyu.”<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Maze mbwira abaherezi n’abantu bose nti: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Ntimwumvirize abo bavugishwa bavuga ngo: Vuba cane ibikoresho vyo mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho bizogarukanwa bivuye i Babiloni. Bariko baravugishwa ibinyoma imbere yanyu. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Ntimubumvirize. Nimukorere umwami w’i Babiloni, kugira ngo mushobore kubaho. Ni igiki cotuma iki gisagara gihinduka umusaka? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Nibaba ari abavugishwa bafise ijambo ry’Uhoraho, nibinginge <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, bamusabe kugira ngo ibikoresho bisigaye mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho no mu ngoro y’umwami w’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu ntibize bijanwe i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze ku vyerekeye inkingi, ikiyaga c’umwakaka, vya bikarabiro biterurwa n’ibindi bikoresho vyasigaye muri iki gisagara, <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" />ivyo Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni atajanye igihe yatwara Yehoyakini mwene Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda nk’inyagano amukuye i Yerusalemu akamujana i Babiloni, ari kumwe n’abishikira b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />Ego, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli avuze ku vyerekeye ibintu vyasigaye mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no mu ngoro y’umwami w’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" />Bizojanwa i Babiloni kandi bizogumayo kugeza ku musi nzozira kubigarukana, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. Maze nzobigarukana ndabisubize aha hantu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s1">Hananiya umuvugishwa w’ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />Mu kwezi kwa gatanu kw’uwo mwaka, umwaka ugira kane, mu misi ya mbere y’ingoma ya Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda, kamenyi Hananiya mwene Azuri, yava i Gibeyoni, arambwira turi mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho imbere y’abaherezi n’abantu bose ati: <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: ‘Nzovunagura ingogo y’umwami w’i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Mu myaka ibiri nzogarukana aha hantu ibikoresho vyose mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho ivyo Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yakuye ngaha akabijana i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Kandi nzogarukana aha hantu Yehoyakini mwene Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda n’abajanywe bose ari inyagano i Babiloni bakuwe i Buyuda,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ‘kuko nzovunagura ingogo y’umwami w’i Babiloni.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Maze umuvugishwa Yeremiya yishura uwo muvugishwa Hananiya bari imbere y’abaherezi n’abantu bose bari bahagaze ngaho mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho; <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />amubwira ati: “Amen! Icompa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akabikora uko! Icompa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agashitsa amajambo uvugishijwe akagarukana ibikoresho vyo mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho n’abajanywe ari inyagano i Babiloni bakagaruka hano. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Ariko rero, niwumve ivyo ngomba mvugire imbere yawe n’imbere y’abantu bose: <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />Kuva mu bihe vya kera abavugishwa bakwitangiye imbere na jewe twavugishijwe ivy’intambara, ikiza n’icago bizoba ku bihugu vyinshi n’ubwami bukomeye. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Ariko umuvugishwa avugishwa ivy’amahoro azomenyekana ko vy’ukuri yatumwe n’Uhoraho mu gihe ivyo yavugishijwe bizoba bishitse gusa.”<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Maze uwo muvugishwa Hananiya afata ya ngogo yari ku bitugu vy’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya arayivunagura, <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />aca avugira imbere y’abantu bose ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Uku ni ko nzovunagura ingogo y’umwami Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni nkayikura ku bitugu vy’amahanga mu gihe kitarenze imyaka ibiri.’ ” Avuze ivyo, uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya aca arigira.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Inyuma y’igihe gitoya umuvugishwa Hananiya ahejeje kuvunagura ya ngogo ku bitugu vy’umuvugishwa Yeremiya, ijambo ry’Uhoraho ritumwa kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />“Genda ubwire Hananiya uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Wavunaguye ingogo y’igiti, ariko mu gishingo cayo uzoronka ingogo y’icuma. <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: Nzoshira ingogo y’icuma ku bitugu vy’aya mahanga ngo ndabahe gukorera Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni, kandi bazomukorera. Mbere nzomuha no kuganza ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Maze uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya abwira uwo muvugishwa Hananiya ati: “Umve, yewe Hananiya! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyagutumye, ariko wabwiye aba bantu ngo bizigire ibinyoma. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Kubera ivyo, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Ngiye kugukura kw’isi. Muri uwu mwaka nyene ugiye gupfa, kuko wigishije abantu kugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />Mu kwezi kw’indwi kw’uwo mwaka nyene, umuvugishwa Hananiya arapfa.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ikete ryandikiwe abajanywe mu kinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />Ibi ni vyo vyari mw’ikete uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya yarungitse ari i Yerusalemu ku batware bacitse kw’icumu bari mu bajanywe ari inyagano, no ku baherezi, n’abavugishwa hamwe n’abandi bantu bose Nebukadineza yari yarajanye mu kinyago i Babiloni abakuye i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />Aho hari inyuma y’uko umwami Yehoyakini n’umugabekazi ari we nyina, abatware b’i bwami n’abarongozi b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu, abazi ubuhinga butandukanye n’abanyamyuga bari barajanywe mu kinyago bakuwe i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Yarungikanye iryo kete Elasa mwene Shafani na Gemariya mwene Hilukiya, igihe bari bagiye i Babiloni kuvugana n’umwami Nebukadineza batumwe na Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda. Yanditse avuga ati:<verse eid="JER 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze ku bajanywe ari inyagano bava i Yerusalemu bakaja i Babiloni: <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />“Nimwubake amazu muyabemwo; murime imirima murye ivyo yeze. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Murongore muvyare abahungu n’abakobwa; mukwere abahungu banyu abagore mushingire abakobwa banyu, kugira ngo na bo nyene bavyare abahungu n’abakobwa. Mugwire mube benshi; ntimugabanuke. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Vyongeye, muronderere amahoro no gutera imbere igisagara mwajanywemwo muri inyagano. Mugisengere k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko nicatera imbere, na mwebwe muzotera imbere.” <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Ego, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: “Ntimwemere ko abavugishwa n’abahamagara imizimu bari hagati muri mwebwe babahenda. Ntimwumvirize inzozi mubasaba kurota. <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />Bariko baravugishwa ibinyoma mw’izina ryanje. Si je nabatumye,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Imyaka mirongo indwi niyahera muri i Babiloni, nzoza aho muri maze nshitse isezerano ryo kugira neza kwanje ryo kubagarukana aha hantu. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />Kuko nzi imigambi ndabafitiye,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “ni imigambi yo kubateza imbere, si iyo kubagirira nabi, ni imigambi yo kubaha ivyizigiro muri kazoza. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Maze, muzonyambaza muze munsenge, nanje nzobumva. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" />Muzondondera kandi muzombona mundondeye n’imitima yanyu yose. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Nzokwemera mumbone,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “kandi nzobagarukana ndabakure mu kinyago. Nzobegeranya ndabakure mu mahanga n’ahantu hose aho nabangarije,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “maze ndabagarukane hano aho nabakuye nkabajana mu kinyago.”<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Mwovuga muti: “Uhoraho yaduhagurukirije abavugishwa na we i Babiloni,” <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />ariko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku vyerekeye umwami yicara ku ntebe y’ubwami ya Dawidi n’abantu bose mu basigaye muri iki gisagara, abo musangiye igihugu batajanywe nkamwe mu kinyago. <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />Ego, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Nzorungika inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza kuri bo bamere nk’insukoni ziboze zimwe ata muntu yoshobora kuzirya. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Nzobakinagiza n’inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza kandi nzotuma bazinukwa n’ubwami bwose bwo kw’isi babe abantu bo kuvumwa bankwa na bose, bo gucokora n’iciro ry’umugani mu mahanga yose. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Kuko batumviye amajambo yanje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “ayo narungikanye kenshi abasavyi banje navugisha. Kandi namwe nyene abagiye mu kinyago ntimwumviye,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Nuko rero, nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe abajanywe nk’inyagano abo nirukaniye i Babiloni bavuye i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze kuri Ahabu mwene Kolaya na Zedekiya mwene Mayaseya, bariko baravugishwa ibinyoma muri mwebwe mw’izina ryanje: “Nzobashira mu maboko ya Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni, maze azobicira imbere y’amaso yanyu. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Kubera bo, abajanywe ari inyagano bavuye i Buyuda bari i Babiloni bazovuma abantu bavuga bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakakugirira nk’ivyo yagiriye Zedekiya na Ahabu, abo umwami w’i Babiloni yaturiye mu muriro.’ <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Kuko bakoze ivyo kwankwa urunuka mu Bisirayeli; bakoze ivy’ubusambanyi hamwe n’abagore b’ababanyi babo kandi bavuze ibinyoma mw’izina ryanje, ivyo ntari nababwiye gukora. Ndabizi kandi ndi icabona cavyo,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa burungikiwe Shemaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Mubwire Shemaya Umunehelamu, muti: <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Warungikiye amakete abantu bose b’i Yerusalemu mw’izina ryawe, no kuri Zefaniya mwene Mayaseya umuherezi, no ku bandi baherezi. Wabwiye Zefaniya uti: <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagutoranije ngo ube umuherezi mu gishingo ca Yehoyada ngo uzezwe inzu y’Uhoraho; uze ushire umusazi wese yiyadukiza ngo ni umuherezi mu minyororo no mu mpatane z’ivyuma mw’izosi. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />None rero ni igiki catumye ata co ukora kuri Yeremiya w’i Anatoti, yigize umuvugishwa muri mwebwe? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Yaturungikiye ubu butumwa turi i Babiloni, ngo: tuzotebayo. Nuko nimwubake amazu muyabemwo; murime imirima murye ivyeze muri yo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Maze Zefaniya umuherezi asomera uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya iryo kete. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Hanyuma ijambo ry’Uhoraho ritumwa kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Rungika ubu butumwa ku bajanywe nk’inyagano bose uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze kuri Shemaya Umunehelamu: kuko Shemaya yabavugishirijwe imbere, naho ntari namutumye, agatuma mwizera ikinyoma, <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ni ukuri nzohana Shemaya Umunehelamu n’abamukomokako. Ntazogira n’umwe azosigara muri mwebwe, canke ngo abone ivyiza nzogirira aba bantu, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, kuko yigishije abantu kungarariza.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s1">Kwibukwa kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’Uhoraho: <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: ‘Niwandike mu gitabu amajambo yose nakubwiye. <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />Imisi iraje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, aho nzogarukana abantu banje b’Abisirayeli n’Abayuda ndabakuye mu kinyago nkabasubiza mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza babo ngo bacegukire, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.’ ”<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Aya ni yo majambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze, yerekeye Isirayeli na Yuda: <verse eid="JER 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">Induru itewe n’ubwoba irumvikanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:5">ni iterabwoba, si ijwi ry’amahoro.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Nimubaze kandi murabe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">Mbega umugabo yoja ku bise ngo avyare abana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">None ni kuki mbona umugabo wese w’inkomezi agenda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">yifashe ku nda nk’umugore ari ku bise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">mu maso habo bose hijiriwe biteye ubwoba?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Ewe kuntu uwo musi uzoba ari mubi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">Nta wundi uzosa na wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Kizoba ari igihe c’amarushwa kuri Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">ariko azokivamwo impore.<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />‘Kuri uwo musi,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">‘nzovuna ingogo yari ku mazosi yabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">maze ncagagure iminyororo ibaboshe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">Abanyamahanga ntibazokwongera kubagira abaja babo.<verse eid="JER 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Ahubwo, bazokorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">na Dawidi umwami wabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">uwo nzohagurutsa ku bwabo.<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />Nuko ntutinye, yewe Yakobo musavyi wanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">ntugire ubwoba yewe Isirayeli,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Ni ukuri nzogukiza ndagukure mu kibanza ca kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">abagukomokako bave iyo bajanywe ari inyagano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Yakobo azokwongera kwibera mu mahoro n’umutekano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">kandi nta wuzosubira kumutera ubwoba.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Ndi kumwe nawe kandi nzogukiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">N’aho noherengeteza amahanga yose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">ayo nakwangarijemwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">wewe sinzoguherengeteza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Nzoguhana, ariko nzobikora ku rugero rukwiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">sinzokureka ngo ugende udahanywe.”<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">“Igikomere cawe ntigishobora gukira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:12">wakomeretse ku buryo bidashoboka ko ukira.<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Nta wo kukuburanira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">nta muti w’igisebe cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">nta muti wogukiza.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Abo mwasezeranye bose barakwibagiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">nta co bitwararitse mu vyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Nagukubise nk’uko umwansi wawe yobigira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">kandi naguhanye nka ruburakigongwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">kuko ukugabitanya kwawe ari kwinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">ivyaha vyawe bikaba umurengera.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Ni kuki urizwa n’igikomere cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">kandi uburibwe bwawe butagira umuti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Kubera ukugabitanya kwawe guhambaye n’ivyaha vyawe vyinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">ni co catumye nkugirira gutyo.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />Ariko abagusahuye na bo bazosahurwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">abansi bawe bose bazojanwa ari inyagano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Abagusahura bose bazosahurwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">ababanyaga na bo bazonyagwa.<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Ariko mwebwe nzobakiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">kandi nzokiza ibikomere vyanyu,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">“kuko witwa umuntu ata co amaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">Siyoni hahebwe.”<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">“Nzosubira kwubaka amahema ya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">ngirire akagongwe aho muba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">igisagara kizosubira cubakwe ku misaka yaco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">kandi ikirimba kizosubira guhagarara mu kibanza cahozemwo.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Muri bo hazokwumvikana indirimbo n’amashimwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">n’ijwi ry’umunezero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Nzobagwiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ntibazoba bake na mba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">nzobatera iteka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ndabakureko agakengerwe.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Abana babo bazoba nk’uko bahoze kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">kandi bazosubira kuba ikoraniro imbere yanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">nzohana abacinyiza bose.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Umurongozi wabo azoba umwe muri bo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">umutware wabo azova hagati muri bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Nzomwiyegereza na we azonyegera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">kuko ni nde yokwemera kwiheba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">ngo aze yegere aho ndi?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />“Nuko muzoba abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:22">nanje nzoba Imana yanyu.”<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />Raba, isegenya y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">izozanana n’uburake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">igihuhuta gikomeye kizoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">ku mitwe y’abakora ibibi.<verse eid="JER 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />Ishavu ry’inkazi ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntirizosubira inyuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">kugeza ashikije</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">imigambi iri mu mutima wiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Mu misi izoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">ivyo muzobitahura.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />Muri ico gihe, Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Muri ico gihe, nzoba Imana y’imiryango yose ya Isirayeli, na bo bazoba abantu banje.”<verse eid="JER 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">“Abantu bazoba barokotse inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">bazogirirwa ubuntu bageze mu bugaragwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">kuko nzoza kugira ngo mpe akaruhuko Isirayeli.”<verse eid="JER 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaratwiyeretse muri kahise, avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">“Narabakunze urukundo rudashira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:3">nabakwegesheje imbabazi zanje.<verse eid="JER 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Nzosubira kububaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">kandi wewe mukobwa Isirayeli, uzosubira kwubakwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Kandi uzosubira gutora udushako tw’ingoma twawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">maze usohoke utamba uri kumwe n’abanezerewe.<verse eid="JER 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Kandi uzosubira gutera imizabibu yawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">ku turambi tw’i Samariya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">abarimyi bazoyitera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">kandi bazonezererwa ivyo yamye.<verse eid="JER 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Hazobaho umusi abarinzi bazosemerera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">bari ku mirambi ya Efurayimu bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">‘Nimuze tuduge i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">tuduge aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu iri.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">“Muririmbane umunezero ku bwa Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">nimutere impundu ku bw’ihanga riruta ayandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Mutume uguhimbaza kwanyu kwumvikana, muvuga muti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">‘Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kiza abantu bawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">amasigarira y’Abisirayeli.’<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Raba, nzobazana ndabakuye mu gihugu co mu buraruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">ndabegeranye ndabakuye ku mpera z’isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Muri bo hazoba harimwo impumyi n’abamugaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">abagore bibungenze n’abari ku bise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">bazogaruka ari isinzi.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Bazoza barira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">bazonsenga nanje ndabagarukane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Nzobarongorera i ruhande y’imigezi y’amazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">mu nzira igororotse aho batazotsitara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">kuko ndi Se wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">kandi Efurayimu akaba imfura yanje.”<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe mahanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">murimenyeshe mu bizinga vya kure muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">“Uwasabagije Abisirayeli azobegeranya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">kandi azoragira umukuku wiwe nk’umwungere.<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobohora aba Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">abacungure abakuye mu maboko y’ababarusha inkomezi.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Bazoza biha akamo k’umunezero ku misozi ya Siyoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">bazonezererwa ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">ingano, umutobe musha w’umuvinyu n’amavuta ya elayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">imyagazi y’imikuku n’inyana z’inka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Bazomera nk’umurima wavomerewe neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">kandi ntibazosubira kubabara.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />Abakobwa b’inkumi bazotamba banezerwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">n’abasore hamwe n’abatama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Nzohindura ikigandaro cabo umunezero;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">nzobahoza ndabanezereze mu gishingo c’umubabaro.<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Nzoha abaherezi umusesekara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">kandi abantu banje bazohazwa n’ivyo ndabahaye birusha ibindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.”<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">“Induru yumvikaniye i Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">amarira n’amaborogo menshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Rasheli aririra abana biwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">kandi yanka guhozwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">kuko batakiriho.”<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">“Hoza ijwi ryawe rireke kurira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">n’amaso yawe areke gukorora amosozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">kuko igikorwa cawe kizohabwa ingero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">Bazogaruka bavuye mu gihugu c’umwansi wabo.<verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />Nuko rero hariho ivyizigiro ku bagukomokako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">Abana bawe bazogaruka mu gihugu cabo.”<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />“Numvise neza ukuniha kwa Efurayimu, ngo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">Wampanye nk’uko bakubita ishuri y’ikigaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">kandi warampanye vy’ukuri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Ngarukana, nanje nzogaruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">kuko uri <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Inyuma y’aho nangariye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">narihanye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">aho mariye gutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">narikubise mu gikiriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Naramaramaye nterwa n’isoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">kuko niremetse ibiteterwe vyo mu buto bwanje.<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />Mbega Efurayimu si umuhungu wanje nkunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">umwana wanje nezererwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Naho namwagirije kenshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">ndacamwibuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Ni co gituma umutima wanje ukimugirira ikibabarwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">ndamubabara cane,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />“Shinga ivyapa vyo ku nzira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">ushinge imambo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Wiyumvire inzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">ibarabara ucamwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Garuka, yewe mukobwa wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">garuka mu bisagara vyawe.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Uzogeza ryari kwangara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">yewe mukobwa w’ikigaba wa Isirayeli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agira areme ikintu gishasha kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">umugore azorondera umugabo.”<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: “Aho nzobagarukanira ndabakuye mu kinyago, abantu bo mu gihugu c’i Buyuda no mu bisagara bihakikije bazosubira kuvuga aya majambo bati: ‘Uhoraho aguhezagire, yewe wa nzu y’ubugororotsi, yewe musozi wera.’ <verse eid="JER 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />Abantu bazoba hamwe i Buyuda no mu bisagara vyaho vyose, abarimyi n’abaragira amasho yabo. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Nzosubiza intege abadendebukiwe, mpaze n’abaguye isari.”<verse eid="JER 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Inyuma y’ivyo nca ndikangura nderaguza hirya no hino. Itiro ryanje ryari riryoshe cane.<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />“Imisi iraje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “nzoteragira ubwami bwa Isirayeli n’ubwa Yuda mu kubaha umunago w’abantu n’uw’ibitungwa. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Nk’uko nabakurikiranye kugira ngo ndabarandure, ndabatsinde hasi, ndabahonye, ndabamare kandi ndabateze ivyago, ni ko nzogira umwete wo kububaka no kubateragira,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" />“Muri iyo misi abantu ntibazosubira kuvuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">‘Ba se bariye inzabibu zitarera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:29">abahungu babo baba ari bo bajigurwa mu menyo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />Ahubwo, umwe wese azozira ivyaha vyiwe; uwuzorya inzabibu zitarera, ni we nyene azojigurwa mu menyo.<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />“Igihe kiraje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">“aho nzogirana isezerano rishasha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:31">n’inzu ya Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">hamwe n’inzu ya Yuda.<verse eid="JER 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />Ntirizoba risa na rya sezerano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">nagirana na ba sekuruza babo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">aho nabafata ukuboko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">nkabarongora ndabakura mu gihugu ca Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">kuko bavuye mw’isezerano ryanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">naho nari Shebuja,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" />“Iri ni ryo sezerano nzogirana n’inzu ya Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">inyuma y’ico gihe,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">“Nzoshira ivyagezwe vyanje mu bwenge bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">ndavyandike mu mitima yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">Nzoba Imana yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">na bo babe abantu banje.<verse eid="JER 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" />Ntibazosubira kwigisha ababanyi babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">canke ngo babwirane hagati yabo bati: ‘Menya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">kuko bose bazomenya jewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">kuva kuri muto muri bo kugeza ku mukuru,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">“Kuko nzobaharira ibibi vyabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">kandi sinzosubira kwibuka ivyaha vyabo.”<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">uwatumye izuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">kwaka ku murango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">agategeka ukwezi n’inyenyeri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">ngo vyake mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">avyura ikiyaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">ngo gisuriranye imikuba yaco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo zina ryiwe:<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />“Kiretse ivyo vyagezwe nashinze bimvuye imbere,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">“Abisirayeli ntibazokwigera bareka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">kuba ihanga imbere yanje.”<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">“Iyo amajuru aba yoshobora gupimwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">n’amatanguriro y’isi agashobora guserangurwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">ni ho noshobora guheba uruvyaro rwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">kubera ivyo bakoze vyose,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />“Imisi iraje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “aho iki gisagara kizokwubakwa ku bwanje uhereye ku munara wa Hananeli kugeza kw’Irembo ryo mu Mfuruka. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />Umugozi wo kugera uzogororwa kuva ngaho kugeza ku gasozi ka Garebu maze uhindukire gushika i Gowa. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Mu Kiyaya cose aho bata imivyimba n’umunyota, no ku misezero yose gushika mu mwonga wa Kidironi kubandanya mu buseruko gushika mu mfuruka yo kw’Irembo ry’Amafarasi, hazoba ahera h’Uhoraho. Iki gisagara ntikizosubira kurandurwa no gusamburwa.”<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremiya yigurira itongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu mwaka ugira icumi Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, ukaba wari umwaka wa cumi n’umunani Nebukadineza ari ku ngoma. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />Ingabo z’umwami w’i Babiloni zari zugarije i Yerusalemu, kandi Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana yari yugaraniwe mu rugo rw’abarinda ku kirimba c’umwami w’i Buyuda.<verse eid="JER 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Maze Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda yari yamushize mw’ibohero ngaho amwagiriza ati: “Ni kubera iki uvugishwa gutyo? Uvuga uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ngira nshire iki gisagara mu maboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni, kandi azogifata. <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda ntazokwikiza ngo ave mu maboko y’Abanyababiloni ariko ni ukuri azofatwa mpiri n’umwami w’i Babiloni, kandi azovugana na we imbonankubone amwibonere n’amaso yiwe. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Azojana Zedekiya i Babiloni, aho azoguma gushika maze guhigura na we, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. Niwagwana n’Abanyababiloni ntuzotsinda.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Yeremiya avuga ati: “Ijambo Uhoraho yantumyeko ryavuga riti: <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />‘Hanameli mwene Shalumu sowanyu agira aze aho uri akubwire ati: Gura itongo riri i Anatoti, kuko uri uwo mu muryango wa hafi ufise uburenganzira kandi utegerezwa kurigura.’<verse eid="JER 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />Maze, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabivuze, mwenewacu Hanameli aza aho ndi mu rugo rw’abarinzi bo ku kirimba arambwira ati: Gura itongo ryanje riri i Anatoti mu ntara ya Benyamini. Ko biri mu vyo urekuriwe ngo uricungure ribe iryawe, ryigurire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 32:8">Nari nzi ko ivyo bivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />Nuko nca ngura iryo tongo ryari i Anatoti ryari irya mwene datawacu Hanameli nca ndamupimira shekeli icumi n’indwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 200.</char></note> z’ifeza. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Ndamwandikira kandi nshirako n’ikidodo ku rwandiko rw’ubuguzi, nshirako n’ivyabona, mpima na za feza ku munzane. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Ntwara rwa rwandiko rw’ubuguzi, ruriko vya bidodo rwanditsemwo ingingo n’amasezerano, hamwe n’urundi rutariko ikidodo, <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />Maze mpa rwa rwandiko Baruki mwene Neriya, mwene Mahaseya, imbere ya mwenewacu Hanameli na vya vyabona vyose vyashira umukono kuri urwo rwandiko n’Abayuda bose bari bicaye mu rugo rw’abarinzi b’umwami.<verse eid="JER 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />Mbwirira Baruki mu maso yabo nti: <verse eid="JER 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: Akira aya makopi yompi, y’urwandiko rw’ubuguzi, iyiriko ikidodo n’iyitariko ikidodo, maze ubishire mu mubindi w’ibumba kugira ngo aze amare igihe kirekire.’ <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: ‘Amazu, amatongo n’imizabibu bizosubira kugurwa muri iki gihugu.’<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />Maze gutanga ya makete y’ubuguzi nkayaha Baruki mwene Neriya, nsenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nti:<verse eid="JER 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />‘Ewe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, waremye ijuru n’isi ubiremesheje ububasha bwawe n’ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi, nta na kimwe kikunanira. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />Werekanye urukundo ku bantu ibihumbi ariko uzana igihano c’ivyaha vy’abavyeyi ku bana babo. Yewe Mana ihambaye, izina ryawe ni <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />imigambi yawe irahambaye kandi ivyo ukora birakomeye. Inyonga zawe zibona inzira zose z’abantu; uha ingero umuntu wese ikwiranye n’ingeso ziwe n’ibikorwa vyiwe. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />Wakoze ibitangaza n’ibimenyetso muri Egiputa kandi washishikaye kubikora, haba muri Isirayeli, haba no mu bantu bose, kandi wihaye izina rihambaye nk’uko biri n’uwu musi. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Wakuye ubwoko bwawe Isirayeli muri Egiputa ubukujeyo ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza, n’ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi kuramvuye n’ibiteye ubwoba. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Wabahaye iki gihugu wari wararahiye ba sekuruza babo, igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Baraza baracinjira baracegukira, ariko ntibakwumvira canke ngo bitondere Ivyagezwe vyawe; ntibakora ivyo wabategetse gukora. Ni co catumye ubateza ivyago.<verse eid="JER 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />Raba ingene hubatswe ivyo kwuririrako ngo bafate igisagara. Kubera inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza, igisagara kizoshirwa mu maboko y’Abanyababiloni bagiteye. Ivyo wavuze vyarashitse, nk’uko mubibona ubu. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Kandi naho iki gisagara kizogwa mu maboko y’Abanyababiloni, wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, umbwiye uti: Nugure itongo n’ifeza zawe urondere n’ivyabona.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Nuko ijambo ry’Uhoraho ritumwa kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’abafise umubiri bose. Hari ikintu conanira jewe?” <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />Nuko, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: “Ngira nshire iki gisagara mu maboko y’Abanyababiloni na Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni, na bo bazogifata. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Abanyababiloni bariko batera iki gisagara bazocinjira bagiturire; bazogitongoza umuriro, harimwo n’amazu yose abantu bantereyemwo ishavu mu kwurira hejuru kuri yo no gucanira ibimota neza Bayali no mu kumijagira amashikanwa y’ibinyobwa imbere y’izindi mana.<verse eid="JER 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />Abantu bo muri Isirayeli mu Buyuda nta kindi bakoze atari ibibi gusa mu nyonga zanje uhereye mu buto bwabo; ni ukuri, Abisirayeli nta kindi atari ukuntera ishavu kubera ivyo intoke zabo zakoze,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />“Kuva igihe cubakiwe gushika uwu musi, iki gisagara cavyuye uburake n’ubushangashirwe bwanje ku buryo ntegerezwa kukirandura mu nyonga zanje. <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />Abisirayeli n’Abayuda n’abantu bose baranshavuje kubera ibibi bakoze, bo ubwabo, abami babo n’abaganwa babo, abaherezi babo n’abavugishwa, abantu b’i Buyuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Banteye ibitugu, ntibantumbera; naho nabigishije kenshi, ntibanyumviye canke ngo bemere guhanwa. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" />Bashinze ibigirwamana vyabo vy’ubuyobe mu Ngoro yitirirwa izina ryanje maze barayihumanya. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" />Bubatse ibibanza vya Bayali mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu ngo bahashikanire ibimazi vy’abahungu babo n’abakobwa babo babiha Moleki, naho ntigeze ndabibategeka, canke ngo vyinjire no mu bwenge bwanje, ko bokora ikizira kingana gutyo gituma Yuda acumura.<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />Muvuga kuri iki gisagara muti: ‘Iki gisagara kizoshirwa mu maboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni biciye mu nkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza,’ ariko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />‘Ni ukuri nzobegeranya bavuye mu bihugu vyose ivyo nzobirukaniramwo mu bushangashirwe no mu burake bwanje; nzobagarukana aha hantu bahabe mu mahoro. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Bazoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba Imana yabo. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Nzobaha kugira umutima umwe wo kunyumvira, kugira ngo bame banyubaha imisi yose kandi kugira ngo bibabere vyiza bo ubwabo n’abana babo bazovuka hanyuma. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Nzogiriranira na bo isezerano ritazoshira: Sinzokwigera mpeba kubagirira neza, kandi nzobashiramwo umutima wo kunyubaha, kugira ngo ntibaze bantere ibitugu na mba. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Nzonezerwa no kubagirira neza kandi vy’ukuri nzobateragira muri iki gihugu n’umutima wanje wose n’umushaha wanje wose.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Nk’uko narekuriye ubu bugesera bungana butya kuri aba bantu, ni ko nzobaha ukugubwa neza nabasezeraniye. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Bazosubira kugura amatongo muri iki gihugu ico muvuga muti: ‘Ni umusaka, nta bantu canke ibikoko bikirimwo, kuko cahawe Abanyababiloni.’ <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Amatongo azogurwa ifeza, impapuro z’ubuguzi zizokwandikwa zishizweko umukono, zishirweko ikidodo n’ivyabona bijeko mu ntara ya Benyamini, mu mihana ikikije Yerusalemu, mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu bisagara vyo mu ntara y’imisozi, iri mu kiyaya n’iy’i Negebu, kuko nzosubira kuhubaka, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.”<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s1">Isezerano ryo gusubira kwubakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Yeremiya acugaraniwe mu rugo rw’abarinzi, ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryatumwe kuri we ubwa kabiri, riti: <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, Uwaremye isi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yayiremye akayikomeza, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni ryo zina ryiwe, ati: <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />‘Mpamagara nanje ndakwitaba ndakubwire ibihambaye kandi bidaserangurwa utazi.’ <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />Kuko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze ku vyerekeye amazu yo muri iki gisagara n’ibirimba vy’abami b’i Buyuda vyasambuwe kugira ngo bikoreshwe mu kugwanya igitero kibugarije hamwe n’inkota y’umwansi <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />mu gihe bazoba bariko baragwanya Abanyababiloni: amazu yabo azokwuzura imivyimba y’abantu nzokwicisha inkota kubera ishavu ryanje n’uburake bwanje. Nzohisha mu nyonga zanje iki gisagara kubera ibibi vyose bakoze.<verse eid="JER 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />Ariko, nzohazana amagara meza n’ugukiza; nzokiza abantu banje kandi nzobaha kunezererwa amahoro y’umusesekara n’umutekano mwinshi. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Nzogarukana Abayuda n’Abisirayeli ndabakuye mu kinyago maze nzobubaka ndabahindure nk’uko bahoze ubwa mbere. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Nzobeza icaha cabo bancumuyeko ndabababarire ivyaha vyabo vyose vy’ubugarariji bakoze. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Maze iki gisagara kizosubira kumbera izina ry’umunezero, ubwiza n’icubahiro imbere y’amahanga yose yo kw’isi azokwumva ivyiza vyose nzohagirira; kandi bazotangara bahinde agashitsi bumvise amahirwe, n’amahoro nzobaha.”<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Muravuga kuri aha hantu muti: ‘Ni ahantu h’umusaka, hatagira abantu canke ibikoko.’ Ariko mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu mabarabara y’i Yerusalemu agaragara, atagiramwo abantu canke ibikoko bihaba, hazosubira kwumvikana <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" />amajwi y’umunezero n’agahimbare, amajwi y’umukwe n’umugeni, n’amajwi y’abazana ibimazi vy’ishimwe mu nzu y’Uhoraho, bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">‘Nimushimire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari mwiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">urukundo rwiwe rwamaho ibihe vyose.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Kuko nzosubira kwubaka igihugu nk’uko cari kimeze ubwa mbere, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.”<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Muri iki kibanza, kigaragara kitarimwo abantu canke ibikoko, mu bisagara vyaho vyose hazoba uburagiro bw’abungere aho bazovyagiza imikuku yabo. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />Mu bisagara vyo mu ntara y’imisozi, mu kiyaya co mu burengero n’i Negebu, mu ntara ya Benyamini, mu mihana bikikije i Yerusalemu no mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda, imikuku izosubira guca musi y’ukuboko k’uwuziharura,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />“Imisi iraje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “aho nzoshitsa rya sezerano ryiza nagiranye n’ab’inzu ya Isirayeli n’ab’inzu ya Yuda.<verse eid="JER 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />Muri iyo misi no muri ico gihe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">nzomeza Ishami rigororotse mu ruvyaro rwa Dawidi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">azokora ibigororotse n’ivy’ukuri mu gihugu.<verse eid="JER 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />Muri iyo misi Yuda azokizwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">kandi Yerusalemu hazoba impore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">Iri ni ryo zina azokwitwa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">‘Uhoraho ni Ukugororoka Kwacu.’<verse eid="JER 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Dawidi ntazokwigera abura uwo kwicara ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami muri Isirayeli, <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" />canke ngo abaherezi, ari bo Balewi, babure uwo guhagarara imbere yanje ubudasiba ngo atange ibimazi biturirwa, atange n’ifu iturirwa yongere anshikanire ibimazi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />Ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryongera gutumwa kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Nimba mwoshobora gukuraho isezerano ryanje nasezeranye n’umurango hamwe n’iryo nasezeranye n’ijoro, bigatuma bidaseruka mu bihe vyavyo vyashingiwe; <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />aho rero n’isezerano ryanje nagiranye n’umusavyi wanje Dawidi, hamwe n’iryo nasezeranye n’Abalewi ari bo baherezi bakorera imbere yanje, ryoheza rigashobora gukurwaho, kandi Dawidi ntazosubira kuronka uwo mu ruvyaro rwiwe wo kumusubirira ku ngoma. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Nzogwiza abo mu ruvyaro rwa Dawidi umusavyi wanje n’Abalewi bakorera imbere yanje babe nk’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru canke nk’umusenyi wo kw’isesero ry’ikiyaga udashobora guharurwa.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryongera gutumwa kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Ntiwamenye ko aba bantu bariko bavuga bati: ‘Uhoraho yarahevye Abisirayeli n’Abayuda, imiryango ibiri yari yaratoranije’? Nuko rero baranka abantu banje kandi ntibakibabona nk’ihanga. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Nimba ntagiraniye isezerano n’umurango n’ijoro kandi ntashizeho amategeko y’intahava agenga ijuru n’isi, <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />nuko rero nzoshobora guheba uruvyaro rwa Yakobo na Dawidi umusavyi wanje kandi sinzotoranya abahungu biwe ngo baganze abakomoka kuri Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. Kuko nzosubira kububaka ndabagirire akagongwe.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Zedekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />Mu gihe Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni n’ingabo ziwe zose n’ubwami butandukanye bwo mu bwami bunini yaganza bariko baragwanya Yerusalemu n’ibisagara bihakikije, iri jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’Uhoraho, riti: <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Genda kuri Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda maze umubwire uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ndi hafi gutanga iki gisagara mu maboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni, na we azogitongoza umuriro. <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Ntuzokira ariko uzofatwa mpiri utangwe mu maboko yiwe. Uzokwibonera uwo mwami n’amaso yawe, kandi azovugana nawe imbonankubone, kandi uzoja i Babiloni.<verse eid="JER 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />Ariko kandi niwumve isezerano ry’Uhoraho, yewe Zedekiya mwami w’i Buyuda. Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku bikwerekeye: Ntuzokwicishwa inkota, <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />uzokwipfira mu mahoro. Nk’uko abantu bacana umuriro wo guhesha icubahiro ba sogokuruza bawe mu kubagandarira, abami bakwitangiye imbere, ni ko na wewe bazogucanira uwo muriro bongere bagucurire intimba bati: Yo, mwami! Ni jewe ubwanje nsezeranye iri sezerano, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.’ ”<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Maze Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana abwira ivyo vyose Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda, abimubwirira i Yerusalemu, <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />mu gihe ingabo z’umwami w’i Babiloni zariko ziragwanya Yerusalemu n’ibindi bisagara vy’i Buyuda vyari bizitijwe inzitiro, Lakishi na Azeka. Ivyo ni vyo bisagara vyonyene vyari bizitijwe inzitiro vyari bisigaye i Buyuda.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwidegemvyo w’Abagurano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Ijambo ryongera gutumwa kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’Uhoraho inyuma y’aho umwami Zedekiya yari yagiranye isezerano n’abantu bose b’i Yerusalemu ngo bahe umwidegemvyo abaja. <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />Umuntu wese yasabwe kurekura umuja wiwe w’Umuheburayo, yaba umugabo canke umugore; nta n’umwe yari yemerewe kugumiza mu buja mugenziwe w’Umuyuda. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Nuko abaganwa bose n’abantu bose binjiye muri iryo sezerano bemera kurekura abagurano babo b’abahungu canke b’abakobwa ngo ntibashishikare kubagumiza mu buja. Baravyemera, maze barabarekura. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Ariko inyuma y’aho barisubirako bagarukana abo bari barekuye babasubiza mu buja.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Maze ijambo ry’Uhoraho ritumwa kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: ‘Nasezeranye isezerano na ba sogokuruza banyu igihe nabavana muri Egiputa, mu gihugu c’ubuja. Ndavuga nti: <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" />Uko imyaka indwi iheze muze mureke bagenzi banyu b’Abaheburayo babigurishijeko ngo babe abaja banyu bidegemvye. Bamaze kubakorera imyaka itandatu, muze mubareke bidegemvye. Ariko ba sogokuruza banyu ntibanyumviye canke ngo bantege ugutwi. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Haciye igihe gitoya mwihanye mukora ivy’ukuri kandi bigororotse: umwe wese yaramenyesheje ko arekuye mugenziwe. Kandi mwaranashizeho isezerano imbere yanje muri mu Ngoro yitirirwa izina ryanje. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Ariko raba mwagarukanye abagurano banyu b’abahungu n’abakobwa mwari mwarekuye ngo baje aho bagomba. Mwabategetse ngo basubire kubabera abaja.’ ”<verse eid="JER 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />Nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Ntimwanyumviye; ntimwatangaje umwidegemvyo kuri bagenzi banyu b’Abaheburayo. Ko bimeze gutyo, nanje ndamamaje umwidegemvyo kuri mwebwe, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, umwidegemvyo wo kwicwa n’inkota, ikiza n’ikigoyi. Nzobahindura akabarore ku bami bose bo kw’isi. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18" />Abantu bose barenze kw’isezerano ryanje ntibitondere ivyanditswe muri ryo kandi barigiriye imbere yanje, nzobagenza nka ya mpfizi bacamwo kubiri bagaca hagati y’ibihimba vyayo. <verse eid="JER 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19" />Abatware b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu, abajejwe guca imanza, abaherezi n’abantu bose bo mu gihugu baciye hagati y’ivyo bihimba bibiri vy’iyo mpfizi, <verse eid="JER 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />nzobatanga mu maboko y’abansi babo barondera kubica. Imivyimba yabo izoba indya z’ibisiga vyo mu kirere n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba.<verse eid="JER 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />Nzotanga Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda n’abaganwa biwe mu maboko y’abansi babo bagomba kubica, mu maboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni, naho yaretse kubatera. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />Ngiye gutegeka, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, maze ndabagarukane muri iki gisagara. Bazokigwanya, bagifate, bagitongoze umuriro. Kandi nzosiga ibisagara vy’i Buyuda ari imisaka ku buryo ata n’umwe azoshobora kubibamwo.”<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s1">Abarekabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku ngoma ya Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda, rivuga riti: <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“Genda ku muryango wa Rekabu ubatumire ngo baze mu cumba kimwe co mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubahe umuvinyu banywe.”<verse eid="JER 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Nuko ngenda kurondera Yazaniya mwene Yeremiya, mwene Habaziniya, n’abavukanyi biwe n’abahungu biwe, umuryango wose w’Abarekabu. <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />Ndabazana mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mu cumba ca bene Hanani mwene Igidaliya umuntu w’Imana. Cari i ruhande y’icumba c’abatware, cakurikirana n’ica Mayaseya mwene Shalumu umurinzi w’irembo. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Maze nzana imibindi yuzuye umuvinyu n’ibikombe imbere y’Abarekabu nca ndababwira nti: “Nimunywe uwu muvinyu.”<verse eid="JER 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Ariko barishura bati: “Ntitunywa umuvinyu, kuko sogokuruza wacu Yonadabu mwene Rekabu yadutegetse ati: ‘Yaba mwebwe canke uruvyaro rwanyu ntimuze munywe umuvinyu. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />Kandi vyongeye ntimuze mwigere mwubaka inzu, ngo mubibe imbuto canke ngo mutere inzabibu; ntimuze mukore na kimwe muri ivyo, ariko muze mugume mwibera mu mahema. Ni ho muzorambira mu gihugu murimwo nk’ingenzi.’ <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Twumviye ikintu cose Sogokuruza Yonadabu mwene Rekabu yadutegetse. Baba twebwe, baba abagore bacu, abahungu bacu canke abakobwa bacu, ntitwigeze tunywa umuvinyu <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />canke ngo twubake amazu yo kubamwo canke ngo dutere imizabibu, tugire imirima canke ivyimburwa. <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />Twabaye mu mahema kandi twumviye ivyo sogokuruza wacu Yonadabu yadutegetse. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Ariko igihe Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yatera iki gihugu, twaravuze tuti: ‘Nimuze, tugende i Yerusalemu kugira ngo dukire ingabo z’Abanyababiloni n’Abanyaramu.’ Nuko twagumye i Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rica ritumwa kuri Yeremiya, riti: <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Genda ubwire abantu b’i Buyuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu uti: ‘Ntimuriga icigwa ngo mwumvire amajambo yanje?’ Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />‘Yonadabu mwene Rekabu yategetse abahungu biwe ngo ntibanywe umuvinyu kandi ico cagezwe baracitondeye. Gushika uwu musi ntibanywa umuvinyu, kuko bubahirije icagezwe ca sekuruza wabo. Jewe navuganye namwe kenshi, ariko ntimwanyumviye. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Ni kenshi natumye abasavyi banje navugisha kuri mwebwe. Bakavuga bati: Umwe wese nave mu nzira ziwe mbi ahindure ibikorwa vyiwe; ntimukurikire izindi mana ngo muzisabe. Ni ho muzoba mu gihugu nabahaye mwebwe na ba sogokuruza banyu. Ariko ntimwanteze ugutwi canke ngo munyumvire. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Uruvyaro rwa Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu bagumye bitondera icagezwe yabahaye, ariko aba bantu ntibanyumviye.’<verse eid="JER 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />Ni co gituma, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze ati: ‘Nimwumve! Ngiye kuzana ku Bayuda no ku baba i Yerusalemu ivyago vyose nabagereye ko nzobateza. Navuganye na bo, ariko ntibumva; narabahamagaye, ariko ntibitaba.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Maze Yeremiya abwira umuryango w’Abarekabu ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: ‘Mwitondeye icagezwe ca sogokuruza wanyu Yonadabu, mwumvira ivyo yategetse vyose kandi mukora ivyo yababwiye vyose.’ <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />Nuko rero, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: ‘Yonadabu mwene Rekabu ntazokwigera abura umuntu wo kunkorera.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoyakimu aturira igitabu ca Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />Mu mwaka ugira kane Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riti: <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Fata igitabu wandike muri co amajambo yose nakubwiye yerekeye Isirayeli, Yuda n’ayandi mahanga yose uhereye igihe natanguriye kuvugana nawe ku ngoma ya Yosiya kugeza n’ubu. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Kumbure abantu b’i Buyuda nibumva ivyago vyose nateguye kubahanisha, umwe wese azohindukira ave mu nzira yiwe mbi; maze nanje nzobababarira ibibi vyabo n’icaha cabo.”<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Nuko Yeremiya ahamagara Baruki mwene Neriya, maze Yeremiya amubwira amajambo yose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamubwiye, Baruki na we ayandika mu gitabu. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Maze Yeremiya abwira Baruki, ati: “Ndapfunzwe; sinshobora kuja ku Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Nuko rero uze uduge uje mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku musi wo kwisonzesha uheze usomere abantu ivyo muri iki gitabu, amajambo yose y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wanditse nk’uko nakubwiye. Uze uyasomere abantu bose b’i Buyuda bazoza bavuye mu bisagara vyabo vyose. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Kumbure bazokwinginga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze umwe wese ave mu nzira ziwe mbi, kuko ishavu n’uburake <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze ko bizoza kuri ubu bwoko bihambaye cane.”<verse eid="JER 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Baruki mwene Neriya akora vyose nk’uko Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana yabimubwiye; aja mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahasomera amajambo y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari muri ca gitabu. <verse eid="JER 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />Mu kwezi kw’icenda kw’umwaka wa gatanu Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, hashingwa igihe co kwisonzesha imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku bantu bose b’i Yerusalemu no ku bari baje bavuye mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Uhereye ku cumba ca Gemariya mwene Shafani umunyamabanga, cari mu rugo rwo haruguru ku muryango w’Irembo Rishasha ry’urusengero, Baruki asomera abantu bari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amajambo ya Yeremiya yari muri ca gitabu.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Igihe Mikaya mwene Gemariya, mwene Shafani, yumva ayo majambo y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari muri ico gitabu, <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />amanuka mu cumba c’umunyamabanga mu kirimba c’umwami, aho abatware bose bari bicaye: Elishama umukarani, Delaya mwene Shemaya, Elunatani mwene Akubori, Gemariya mwene Shafani, Zedekiya mwene Hananiya, n’abandi batware bose. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Mikaya amaze kubabwira ivyo yumvise vyose Baruki ariko arasomera abantu biri mu gitabu, <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />abo batware bose batuma Yehudi mwene Netaniya, mwene Shelemiya, mwene Kushi, ngo abwire Baruki ati: “Zana ico gitabu wasomeye abantu kandi na wewe uze.” Nuko Baruki mwene Neriya aja iyo bari afise ca gitabu mu minwe. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Baramubwira bati: “Niwicare, turabigusavye, maze ukidusomere.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Nuko Baruki arakibasomera. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Bumvise ayo majambo yose, barabana mu maso bafise ubwoba maze babwira Baruki bati: “Dutegerezwa kumenyesha umwami aya majambo yose.” <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Nuko babaza Baruki bati: “Tubwire, ibi vyose wavyanditse gute? Mbega Yeremiya ni we yabikubwiye?”<verse eid="JER 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Baruki arabishura ati: “Egome, yambwiye aya majambo yose, nanje ndayandikisha irangi muri iki gitabu.”<verse eid="JER 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Maze ba baganwa babwira Baruki bati: “Wewe na Yeremiya, nimugende mwinyegeze. Ntihagire uwumenya aho mwinyegeje.”<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Bamaze gushira ico gitabu mu cumba ca Elishama umunyamabanga, baja aho umwami yari ari mu rugo bamubwira vyose. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Umwami atuma Yehudi kuzana ico gitabu, maze Yehudi arakizana agikuye mu cumba ca Elishama umunyamabanga maze agisomera umwami n’abatware bose bari bahagaze i ruhande yiwe. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Hari mu kwezi kw’icenda kandi umwami yari yicaye mu nzu yo kwikingira imbeho, umuriro uriko uraka mu cotero imbere yiwe. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Uko Yehudi yaba amaze gusoma uduce dutatu canke tune two mu gitabu, ni ko umwami yaja araducagagura akoresheje imbugita y’umwanditsi aduterera mu cotero, kugeza ca gitabu cose gihiye kigaherengetera. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Umwami n’abagendanyi biwe bose bumvise ayo majambo ntibagira ubwoba, canke ngo bitaburireko impuzu. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Naho Elunatani, Delaya na Gemariya binginze umwami ngo ntaturire ico gitabu, ntiyabumviye. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Ahubwo umwami yategetse Yerameyeli, umuhungu w’umwami, Seraya mwene Aziriyeli na Shelemiya mwene Abudeyeli ngo bafate Baruki umwanditsi na Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana. Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabanyegeje.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Umwami amaze guturira ico gitabu carimwo amajambo Baruki yari yanditse nk’uko Yeremiya yabimubwiye, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ritumwa kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />“Fata ikindi gitabu wandike ya majambo yari muri ca gitabu ca mbere, ico umwami Yehoyakimu w’i Buyuda yaturiye. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Kandi ubwire Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda uti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: Waturiye igitabu maze urabaza uti: ni kuki wanditse muri co ko umwami w’i Babiloni ategerezwa kuza no gusambura iki gihugu akureho abantu n’ibikoko vyo muri co? <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />Nuko rero, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku vyerekeye Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda ngo: ntazoronka n’umwe wo kwicara ku ntebe y’ubwami ya Dawidi; umuvyimba wiwe uzotererwa hanze uhure n’ubushuhe bw’izuba ku murango hamwe n’imbeho yo mw’ijoro. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Nzomuhana we n’abana biwe n’abamukomokako kubera ibibi bakoze; nzoshitsa kuri bo no ku baba i Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda ivyago vyose navuze ko nzobateza, kuko batumviye.’ ”<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Nuko Yeremiya afata ikindi gitabu agiha umwanditsi Baruki mwene Neriya, maze yandika muri co amajambo yose yari muri ca gitabu umwami Yehoyakimu w’i Buyuda yaturira, uko Yeremiya yayamubwira. Kandi amajambo menshi asa nk’ayo arongerwamwo.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremiya ashirwa mw’ibohero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />Zedekiya mwene Yosiya yimitswe na Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni ngo abe umwami w’i Buyuda; atwara mu kibanza ca Yehoyakini mwene Yehoyakimu. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Yaba we, yaba abamukorera canke abantu bo mu gihugu, nta n’umwe yumviye amajambo y’Uhoraho ayo yacishije mu kanwa k’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya.<verse eid="JER 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Ariko umwami Zedekiya arungika Yehukali mwene Shelemiya hamwe na Zefaniya mwene Mayaseya kuri Yeremiya umuvugishwa ngo bamubwire bati: “Ndakwinginze udusengere k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu.”<verse eid="JER 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />Muri ico gihe Yeremiya yarashobora kuja aho abandi bari no gutaha, kuko atari bwashirwe mw’ibohero. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Ingabo za Farawo zari zasohotse ziva muri Egiputa, maze Abanyababiloni bari bugarije Yerusalemu bavyumvise, baca bava i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Nuko ijambo ry’Uhoraho ritumwa kuri Yeremiya umuvugishwa riti: <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Bwira umwami w’i Buyuda, yakurungitse ngo unsiguze uti: Ingabo za Farawo, zaje ngo zigutabare, zizokwisubirira inyuma, muri Egiputa. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />Maze Abanyababiloni bazogaruka batere iki gisagara; bazogifata mpiri bagitongoze umuriro.’ ”<verse eid="JER 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: “Ntimwihende, ngo mwibaze muti: Turazi ko Abanyababiloni bazotureka. Ntibazobareka! <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Naho mwonesha ingabo zose z’Abanyababiloni ziriko zirabatera maze hagasigara abakomeretse gusa bari mu mahema yabo, bosohoka bagatongoza iki gisagara umuriro.”<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Ingabo z’Abanyababiloni zimaze kuva i Yerusalemu kubera ingabo za Farawo, <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />Yeremiya atangura kuva mu gisagara ngo aje mu ntara ya Benyamini ngo aronke umugabane wiwe w’itongo mu bantu baho. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Ariko ashitse kw’Irembo rya Benyamini, Umukuru w’Abarinzi, yitwa Iriya mwene Shelemiya, mwene Hananiya, aramufata aca avuga ati: “Uriko urahunga Abanyababiloni!”<verse eid="JER 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Yeremiya amwishura ati: “Ivyo si ukuri! Simpunze Abanyababiloni.” Ariko, Iriya ntiyamwumviriza; ahubwo, afata Yeremiya amujana ku batware. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Bari bashavujwe na Yeremiya bituma bamukubita baca bamushira mw’ibohero mu nzu ya Yonatani umunyamabanga, iyo bari bahinduye ibohero.<verse eid="JER 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Yeremiya ashirwa mu kumba gatoya k’ibohero, aho yamaze igihe kirekire. <verse eid="JER 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Hanyuma, umwami Zedekiya aramutumako, baramumuzanira ku kirimba, maze aramubaza biherereye ati: “Mbega hari ijambo na rimwe rivuye k’Uhoraho ufise?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Yeremiya aramwishura ati: “Egome, uzotangwa mu maboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni.”<verse eid="JER 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Nuko Yeremiya abwira umwami Zedekiya ati: “Ni ikihe kibi nagukoreye wewe canke abatware bawe canke ubu bwoko, cotuma unshira mw’ibohero? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />Abavugishwa bawe bari hehe, bamwe bakuvugishwako ngo: ‘Umwami w’i Babiloni ntazogutera canke ngo ntazotera iki gihugu’? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Ariko ubu, mwami wanje, ndakwinginze unyumvirize. Ndakwinginze ntunsubize muri irya nzu ya Yonatani umunyamabanga, kuko nopfirayo.”<verse eid="JER 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Umwami Zedekiya ategeka ko bashira Yeremiya mu rugo rw’abarinzi bakamuha umukate uvuye kw’ibarabara ry’abakora imikate uko bukeye gushika aho imikate muri ico gisagara itazoba ikiboneka. Nuko Yeremiya aguma mu rugo rw’abarinzi.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremiya atererwa mu kinogo kibika amazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Shefatiya mwene Matani, Gedaliya mwene Pashuri, Yehukali mwene Shelemiya, na Pashuri mwene Malikiya bumva ivyo Yeremiya yariko arabwira abantu bose igihe yavuga ati: <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Uwuzoguma muri iki gisagara wese azokwicwa n’inkota, ikigoyi canke ikiza, ariko abantu bose bazokwishikana ku Banyababiloni bazobaho. Bazokiza ubuzima bwabo, bazobaho.’ <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />Kandi uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Iki gisagara nta kabuza kigiye gutangwa mu maboko y’ingabo z’umwami w’i Babiloni, na we azogifata.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Maze abatware baca babwira umwami bati: “Uwu mugabo akwiye kwicwa. Ariko araca intege ingabo zisigaye mu gisagara, hamwe n’abantu, kubera ibintu ariko arababwira. Uyu mugabo ntariko ararondera ineza y’aba bantu atari ukubamara.”<verse eid="JER 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Umwami Zedekiya abishura ati: “Ari mu maboko yanyu, umwami nta co yokora kinyuranye n’ico mugomba.”<verse eid="JER 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Nuko bafata Yeremiya bamushira mu kinogo ca Malikiya umuhungu w’umwami, cari mu rugo rw’abarinzi. Bamanura Yeremiya n’ibiziriko muri ico kinogo; nta mazi yarimwo, atari ivyondo gusa, maze Yeremiya anyikira muri ivyo vyondo.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Ariko Ebedi-Meleki, Umunyakushi, umutware yakora ku kirimba i bwami, yumva ko bataye Yeremiya muri ico kinogo. Umwami acicaye mw’Irembo rya Benyamini, <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Ebedi-Meleki asohoka ava mu kirimba aramubwira ati: <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“Nyakwubahwa mwami wanje, aba bantu bakoze nabi ku vyo bakoreye Yeremiya uwuvugishwa n’Imana. Bamutereye mu kinogo c’amazi, aho azokwicwa n’inzara gushika apfuye mu gihe ata vyokurya bizoba bikiri mu gisagara.”<verse eid="JER 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Nuko umwami ategeka Ebedi-Meleki Umunyakushi ati: “Fata abantu mirongo itatu ubakuye ngaha mujane mukure Yeremiya uwuvugishwa muri kirya kinogo atarapfa.”<verse eid="JER 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Nuko Ebedi-Meleki afata abantu bajana na we baja mu cumba cari musi y’ububiko ku kirimba. Akurayo ibihuzu vy’imishire abimanuza imigozi aho Yeremiya yari muri ca kinogo. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Ebedi-Meleki Umunyakushi abwira Yeremiya ati: “Shira ibi bihuzu vy’imishire mu kwaha kwawe ubipfundikeko ibi biziriko.” Yeremiya agira atyo, <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />maze baca bakwega vya biziriko bamukura muri ca kinogo. Nuko Yeremiya aguma mu rugo rw’abarinzi.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zedekiya yongera kubaza Yeremiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Nuko umwami Zedekiya atumako uwavugishwa Yeremiya bamumuzanira ku muryango ugira gatatu w’Ingoro y’Uhoraho. Umwami abwira Yeremiya ati: “Ngomba nkubaze ikintu, kandi ntugire ico umpisha.”<verse eid="JER 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Yeremiya abwira Zedekiya ati: “Ninakwishura, ntuca unyica? Kandi naho noguha impanuro, ntiwonyumvira.”<verse eid="JER 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Ariko umwami Zedekiya arahira Yeremiya mu mpisho ati: “Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima, ari we yaduhaye guhumeka, sinzokwica canke ngo ndagutange ku bagomba kukwica.”<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Nuko Yeremiya abwira Zedekiya ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Niwishikana ku bakuru b’ingabo z’umwami w’i Babiloni, ubuzima bwawe buzorokoka kandi iki gisagara ntikizotongozwa umuriro; wewe n’umuryango wawe muzobaho. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Ariko nutishikana ku bakuru b’ingabo z’umwami w’i Babiloni, iki gisagara kizotangwa mu maboko y’Abanyababiloni kandi bazogitongoza umuriro; kandi nawe ubwawe ntuzocika ariko uzogwa mu maboko yabo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Umwami Zedekiya abwira Yeremiya ati: “Ndatinya Abayuda bamaze kwishikana ku Banyababiloni, kuko abo Banyababiloni bohava bandekurira mu maboko yabo na bo bakangirira nabi.”<verse eid="JER 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Yeremiya amwishura ati: “Ntibazogutanga. Niwumvire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku vyo ndakubwiye, ni ho ivyawe bizogenda neza, ugakiza ubuzima bwawe. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Ariko niwanka kwishikana, ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampishuriye: <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />Abagore bose basigaye mu kirimba c’umwami w’i Buyuda bazosohorwa bahabwe abatware b’umwami w’i Babiloni. Maze abo bagore bazokubwira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">‘Baraguhenze kandi barakunesheje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">abari abagenzi bawe bizigiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Ibirenge vyawe biranyitse mu vyondo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">abagenzi bawe bose bagutaye.’<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />Abagore bawe bose n’abana bawe bazosohorwa bahabwe Abanyababiloni. Nawe ubwawe ntuzokira amaboko yabo ariko uzofatwa n’umwami w’i Babiloni; kandi iki gisagara kizotongorwa n’umuriro.”<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Nuko Zedekiya abwira Yeremiya ati: “Ntubwire umuntu n’umwe ivyo tuvuganye, kuko ubikoze wopfa. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Abatware nibumva ko navuganye nawe, maze bakaza kukubaza bati: ‘Tubwire ivyo wabwiye umwami n’ivyo umwami yakubwiye; kandi ntuduhishe canke na ho tukwice,’ <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />uze ubabwire uti: ‘Nariko ndinginga umwami ngo ntansubize mu nzu kwa Yonatani gupfirayo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Abaganwa bose baca baja kuraba Yeremiya baramubazagiza, na we ababwira ivyo umwami yari yamutegetse vyose kuvuga. Nuko ntibasubira kugira ico bamubaza, kuko ata n’umwe yari yumvise ivyo bavuganye n’umwami.<verse eid="JER 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" />Maze Yeremiya aguma mu rugo rw’abarinzi gushika ku musi Yerusalemu hafatiweko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 38:28">Uku ni ko i Yerusalemu hafashwe:<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu hafatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />Mu mwaka ugira icenda Zedekiya ari umwami w’i Buyuda, mu kwezi kw’icumi, Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni ni ho yaja gutera Yerusalemu ajanye n’ingabo ziwe zose, barahakikuza. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Maze ku musi ugira icenda w’ukwezi kwa kane kw’umwaka ugira cumi na rimwe Zedekiya akiri ku ngoma, basatura uruzitiro rw’igisagara. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />Abakuru b’ingabo z’umwami w’i Babiloni bose baraza bicara kw’Irembo ryo Hagati. Abo bari Nerugali-Sharezeri w’i Samugari-Nebo, Sarusekimu umukuru w’ingabo, Nerugali-Sharezeri umuhanuzi mukuru n’abandi batware bose b’umwami w’i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Maze Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda hamwe n’ingabo zose bababonye barahunga, bava mu gisagara mw’ijoro bajanye inzira ica mu murima w’umwami, baca mw’irembo riri hagati y’ibihome bibiri, bahunga berekeye ikiyaya ca Araba.<verse eid="JER 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Ariko ingabo z’Abanyababiloni zikurikira umwami Zedekiya bamufatira mu kiyaya c’i Yeriko. Baramucakira, bamushira Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aho yari ari i Ribula mu ntara y’i Hamati, na we amucira urubanza aho nyene. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Umwami w’i Babiloni yicira abahungu ba Zedekiya imbere yiwe aho nyene i Ribula, yica n’abatware bose b’i Buyuda. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Maze anogora amaso Zedekiya, amubohesha iminyororo y’umwakaka kugira ngo amujane i Babiloni.<verse eid="JER 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Abanyababiloni baturira ikirimba c’umwami n’amazu y’abantu, basenyurira hasi inzitiro z’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Nebuzaradani umukuru w’abarinzi b’umwami ajana mu kinyago i Babiloni abantu bari basigaye mu gisagara, hamwe n’abari bagiye kwishikana kuri we, n’abandi bose bari basigaye. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Ariko uwo Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami asigaza inyuma mu gihugu c’i Buyuda bamwe mu bantu b’abakene, ata co bari batunze; maze aca abaha imizabibu n’imirima.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Muri ico gihe umwami Nebukadineza w’i Babiloni yari yatanze itegeko ryerekeye Yeremiya abicishije kuri Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami ati: <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Mumufate mumurinde; ntimumugirire nabi ariko mumukorere ico azobasaba cose.” <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Nuko Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami, Nebushazibani umukuru w’ingabo, Nerugali-Sharezeri umutware mukuru n’abandi batware bose b’umwami w’i Babiloni <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" />barungika Yeremiya bamukura mu rugo rw’abarinzi, bamushikiriza Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, ngo amusubize iwe. Nuko yigumira mu b’iwabo.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Igihe Yeremiya yari acugaraniwe mu rugo rw’abarinzi, ijambo ry’Uhoraho ritumwa kuri we riti: <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />“Genda ubwire Ebedi-Meleki Umunyakushi uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuze: Ngira nshitse ivyo navuze kuri iki gisagara biciye mu vyago, atari mu mahirwe. Muri ico gihe bizoshitswa uvyibonera. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Ariko nzokurokora kuri uwo musi, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze; ntuzogwa mu maboko y’abo utinya. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Nzogukiza; ntuzokwicwa n’inkota ahubwo uzorokora ubugingo bwawe, kuko unyizigiye,’ ” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremiya ahunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Ijambo ritumwa kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, inyuma y’uko Nebuzaradani umukuru w’abarinzi b’umwami yari amubohoye akamurungika i Rama. Yari yasanze Yeremiya aboheshejwe iminyororo ari hagati y’abandi bagizwe imbohe bategerezwa kujanwa i Babiloni bavuye i Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Wa mukuru w’abarinzi abonye Yeremiya, aramubwira ati: “Ni <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe yashinze ko haba iki cago kikabera aha hantu. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />Kandi raba ubu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aragishikije; yabikoze nk’uko yari yabivuze. Ibi vyose vyabaye kubera ko mwacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntimwamwumvira. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Ariko uwu musi ndakubohoye iminyororo iri ku maboko yawe. Nuze tujane i Babiloni, niwaba ubishaka, nanje nzokurinda; ariko nimba utabishaka, ntuze. Ehe raba, igihugu cose kiri imbere yawe; genda aho ugomba hose.” <verse eid="JER 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Ariko Yeremiya atarahindukira ngo agende, Nebuzaradani yongerako ati: “Subira kwa Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, uwo umwami w’i Babiloni yashinze ibisagara vy’i Buyuda, maze ubane na we mu bandi, canke wigire ahandi ugomba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 40:5">Nuko uwo mukuru amuha ivyo akeneye n’ingabire aca aramureka aragenda. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />Nuko, Yeremiya agenda kwa Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu i Misipa agumana na we mu bantu bari basigaye inyuma mu gihugu.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedaliya agandagurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />Maze intwazangabo zose n’abantu babo bari bakiri mu gihugu hagati bumvise ko umwami w’i Babiloni yagenye Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu ngo abe umukuru w’intara y’i Buyuda kandi ko yamushinze abagabo, abagore n’abana bakenye kurusha abandi bose bo mu gihugu batajanywe nk’inyagano i Babiloni; <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />baca baja kubonana na Gedaliya i Misipa. Abo na bo ni Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, Yohanani na Yonatani bene Kareya, Seraya mwene Tanihumeti, bene Efayi Umunetofati, na Yazaniya umuhungu w’Umumayaka, n’abantu babo. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, arabarahira kugira ngo abahumurizanye n’abantu babo. Arababwira ati: “Ntimutinye Abanyababiloni. Nimugende mube amahoro mu gihugu, muyoboke umwami w’i Babiloni, ibindi vyose bizogenda neza. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />Nanje ubwanje nzoguma i Misipa ngo ndabaserukire imbere y’Abanyababiloni baza iwacu, ariko mwebwe muze mube abo kwimbura imivinyu, ivyamwa vyo ku mpeshi n’amavuta, mubishire mu mibindi yo kubibika, mwibere mu bisagara mwigaruriye.”<verse eid="JER 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Abayuda bose bahungiye i Mowabu, mu Bamoni, muri Edomu no mu bindi bihugu bumvise ko umwami w’i Babiloni yasigaje amasigarira i Buyuda kandi ko yashinze Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, kuba umukuru w’intara ngo abarongore, <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />bose baragaruka mu gihugu c’i Buyuda, kuri Gedaliya i Misipa, bavuye mu bihugu aho bari barasanzariye. Bimbura imivinyu myinshi cane n’ivyamwa vyo ku mpeshi.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abakuru b’ingabo bose bari bagisigaye mu gihugu baza aho Gedaliya ari i Misipa. <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />Baramubwira bati: “Mbega ntuzi ko Bayalisi umwami w’Abamoni yarungitse Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya ngo akwice?” Ariko Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu ntiyabizera.<verse eid="JER 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Nuko Yohanani mwene Kareya abwira Gedaliya mu mpisho i Misipa ati: “Ndeka ngende nice Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, kandi nta n’umwe azobimenya. Ni iki cotuma akwica agatuma Abayuda bose bagukikije basanzara n’amasigarira y’i Buyuda agahona?”<verse eid="JER 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Ariko Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu abwira Yohanani mwene Kareya ati: “Ntukore ikintu nk’ico! Ivyo uriko uravuga kuri Ishimayeli si ivy’ukuri.”<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />Mu kwezi kugira indwi Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, Netaniya mwene Elishama, wo mu muryango w’abami akaba yari yahoze ari umwe mu batware b’umwami, aza azananye n’abagabo icumi kwa Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu i Misipa. Bakiriko barasangirira hamwe aho nyene, <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" />Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya na ba bagabo cumi bari kumwe na we bava hasi bicisha inkota Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, bica uwo umwami w’i Babiloni yari yagenye ngo abe umutware w’intara y’i Buyuda. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Ishimayeli yica n’Abayuda bose bari kumwe na Gedaliya i Misipa, hamwe n’abasoda b’Abanyababiloni bari aho.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Haciye umusi umwe Gedaliya agandaguwe, ata n’umwe arabimenya, <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" />abagabo mirongo umunani bari bimosheje inkomvorera ubwanwa bwabo, bitabaguriyeko impuzu zabo kandi bikebaguye baza bavuye i Shekemu, Shilo n’i Samariya, bazanye amashikanwa y’ifu n’ibimota neza mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya arasohoka ava i Misipa aja kubasanganira, agenda arira ingenda. Ahuye na bo, avuga ati: “Nimuze kwa Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu murabe ivyamushikiye.” <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Binjiye mu gisagara, Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya n’abagabo bari kumwe na we babicisha inkota baca babaterera mu kinogo kibika amazi. <verse eid="JER 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Ariko icumi muri bo babwira Ishimayeli bati: “Ntutwice! Turafise ingano na sayiri, amavuta n’ubuki, binyegejwe mu murima umwe.” Nuko aca arabareka ntiyabicana n’abandi. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Ico kinogo batayemwo ya mivyimba yose ya ba bagabo yari yiciye hamwe na Gedaliya cari ico umwami Asa yari yarimbishije mu kwikingira kubera umwami Bayasha w’Abisirayeli. Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya acuzuza imivyimba y’abapfuye.<verse eid="JER 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Ishimayeli aca afata abasigaye bose bari i Misipa abagira imbohe, abakobwa b’umwami hamwe n’abandi bose bari basigaye aho, abo Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami yari yashinze Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu. Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya arabafata aca aragenda ajabuka yerekeye mu Bamoni.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abakuru b’ingabo bari kumwe na we bumvise ibibi Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya yakoze, <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />baca bajana n’ingabo zose bari kumwe kugwanya Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya. Bamufatira i ruhande y’ikidengeri kinini c’i Gibeyoni. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Ba bantu Ishimayeli yari afise babonye Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abakuru b’ingabo bari kumwe na we, baranezerwa. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />Abantu bose Ishimayeli yari yafashe i Misipa barahindukira baja ku ruhande rwa Yohanani mwene Kareya. <verse eid="JER 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Ariko Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya n’abantu umunani mu ngabo ziwe batoroka Yohanani baja mu Bamoni.<verse eid="JER 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bahungira muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abakuru b’ingabo zari kumwe na we baca batwara abarokotse bose b’i Misipa, abo Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya yari yafashe amaze kwica Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, bari abasoda, abagore, abana n’abakora i bwami yari yakuye i Gibeyoni. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" />Maze barabandanya, baruhukira i Geruti Kimuhamu i ruhande y’i Betelehemu bariko baraja muri Egiputa <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />ngo bahunge Abanyababiloni. Barabatinya kubera Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya yari yishe Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, uwo umwami w’i Babiloni yari yashizeho ngo abe umukuru w’intara y’i Buyuda.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />Nuko abakuru b’ingabo bose, harimwo na Yohanani mwene Kareya na Yezaniya mwene Hoshaya, n’abantu bose, uhereye ku muto inyuma y’abandi ukageza ku mukuru aruta abandi, begera <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" />Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana bamubwira bati: “Turakwinginze wumve ico tugusaba maze udusengere k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe usabire aba bantu bose b’amasigarira. Kuko nk’uko ubibona ubu, naho twari benshi, ubu hasigaye bake cane. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />Senga ngo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe atubwire aho twoja n’ico twokora.”<verse eid="JER 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Yeremiya arabishura ati: “Nabumvise. Ni ivy’ukuri ndabasengera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu nk’uko mwabisavye; kandi ndabamenyesha ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kuvuga vyose. Nta co nza kubahisha.”<verse eid="JER 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Nuko babwira Yeremiya bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atubere icabona c’ukuri kandi co kwizigirwa kandi aduhane nitutakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe aza kugutuma kuri twebwe vyose. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Vyaba ari vyiza canke bibi, tuzokwumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe, iyo tugutumyeko, kugira ngo ivyacu bigende neza, tuzokwumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe.”<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Haheze imisi icumi, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ritumwa kuri Yeremiya. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Maze akoranya Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abakuru b’ingabo bose bari kumwe na we n’abantu bose uhereye ku muto inyuma y’abandi ukageza ku mukuru aruta abandi. <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Arababwira ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, uwo mwantumyeko ngo ndabasabire, avuze: <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />‘Nimwaguma muri iki gihugu, nzobubaka sinzobasambura; nzobateragira sinzobarandura, kuko mbabajwe n’icago nabateje. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Ntimutinye umwami w’i Babiloni, uwo mutinya ubu. Ntimumutinye, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, kuko ndi kumwe namwe kandi nzobatabara ndabakize amaboko yiwe. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Nzobagirira akagongwe kugira ngo na we abagirire akagongwe abasubize mu gihugu canyu.’<verse eid="JER 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />Ariko, nimwavuga muti: ‘Ntituzoguma muri iki gihugu, maze ntimunyumvire jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu,’ <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />kandi nimwavuga muti: ‘Oya, tuzoja kwibera muri Egiputa, aho tutazobona intambara canke ngo twumve inzamba canke ngo dusonze tubure ico kurya,’ <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />nuko nimwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho, yemwe masigarira ya Yuda. Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Nimwaba mwafashe ingingo yo kuja muri Egiputa mukabayo, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />inkota mutinya izobasangayo, n’inzara mutinya izobakurikira muri Egiputa, mupfireyo. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Ni ukuri, abafashe ingingo yo kuja muri Egiputa ngo babeyo bazokwicwa n’inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza; nta n’umwe azorokoka canke ngo akire icago nzobateza.’ ” <verse eid="JER 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: “Nk’uko uburake bwanje n’ubushangashirwe bwanje vyasutswe ku baba i Yerusalemu, ni ko uburake bwanje buzosukwa kuri mwebwe nimwaja muri Egiputa. Muzoba akamenyo, agatwengo, abo gucirwa urubanza no kuvugirizwa agahwa; ntimuzosubira kubona aha hantu.”<verse eid="JER 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />Yemwe masigarira ya Yuda, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arababwiye ati: “Ntimuje muri Egiputa.” Nimumenye ibi mudakekeranya: ndababuriye uwu musi <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />ko mwakoze ikosa ry’agacamutwe igihe mwantuma k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu mukavuga muti: “Dusengere k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe; utubwire ivyo aza kuvuga vyose kugira ngo natwe tubikore.” <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Ndababwiye uwu musi, ariko n’ubu ntimurumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu mu vyo yantumye kubabwira vyose. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Nuko rero, mumenye ibi mudakekeranya: muzopfa mwishwe n’inkota, ikigoyi n’ikiza muri aho mugomba kuja kuba.<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />Yeremiya ahejeje kubwira abantu amajambo yose y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yamutumye ngo ababwire vyose, <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />Azariya mwene Hoshaya na Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abantu bose b’ubwibone babwira Yeremiya bati: “Urabesha! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu ntiyagutumye kuvuga ngo: ‘Ntimuje muri Egiputa kubayo.’ <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Ariko Baruki mwene Neriya ni we akuduteranyako ngo adutange mu maboko y’Abanyababiloni, kugira ngo batwice canke batujane turi inyagano i Babiloni.”<verse eid="JER 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Nuko Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abakuru b’ingabo bose n’abantu bose bagarariza icagezwe c’Uhoraho co kuguma mu gihugu c’i Buyuda. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />Mbere Yohanani mwene Kareya n’abakuru b’ingabo baca barongora amasigarira yose y’i Buyuda yari yagarutse kuba mu gihugu c’i Buyuda bavuye mu mahanga yari yasanzariyemwo barabajana. <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />Bajana abagabo bose, abagore, n’abana n’abakobwa b’umwami abo Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami yari yasigaranye Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, mwene Shafani, na Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana na Baruki mwene Neriya. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Nuko binjira muri Egiputa ntibumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> baca baragenda gushika i Tafanihesi.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Bari aho i Tafanihesi ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Yeremiya riti: <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Fata amabuye maninimanini uyahambe mw’ibumba, Abayuda bose bariko barakuraba, mu musezero w’amatafari mu rwinjiriro rw’ikirimba ca Farawo i Tafanihesi. <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Maze ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Nzorungika umushumba wanje Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni, kandi nzoshira intebe y’ubwami yiwe kuri aya mabuye nahamvye aha; azosasa umusezero wiwe w’ubwami hejuru yayo. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />Azoza atere Egiputa, yice abagerewe gupfa, afate mpiri abagerewe gufatwa mpiri, yicishe inkota abagerewe kwicishwa n’inkota. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />Azotongoza umuriro ingoro z’imana zo muri Egiputa; azoturira ingoro zazo atware mu kinyago imana zaho. Nk’uko umwungere yizingirako umutamana wiwe, ni ko na we azokwizingirako Egiputa aheze yigire anesheje. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />Harya mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana c’izuba muri Egiputa azosenyura inkingi zaco atongoze umuriro ingoro z’imana zo muri Egiputa.’ ”<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyago bitewe no gusenga ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya ryerekeye Abayuda bose baba muri Egiputa mu kiyaya, i Migidoli, i Tafanihesi n’i Memfisi, no muri Egiputa hari imisozi, rivuga riti: <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Mwarabonye icago gikomeye nateje i Yerusalemu n’ibisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda. Uwu musi ni imisaka nta bantu babibamwo <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />kubera ibibi bakoze. Baranshavuje kuko batuririye ibimota neza izindi mana, bagasenga izo mana bo canke ba sekuruza batigeze bamenya. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />Narungitse kenshi abasavyi banje navugisha, ngo bababwire bati: Ntimukore ivyo bintu bisesema, ivyo nanka urunuka! <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Ariko ntibigeze bavyumva canke ngo bantege ugutwi; ntibavuye mu bibi canke ngo bareke gucanira ibimota neza izindi mana. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Ni co catumye, uburake bwanje bw’inkazi busukwa; buziriringira ibisagara vy’i Buyuda n’amabarabara y’i Yerusalemu bukabisiga ari imisaka nk’uko biri uwu musi.<verse eid="JER 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />Ubu rero, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Ni kuki mugomba ko abateza icago nk’ico kizozimanganya abagabo n’abagore, abana n’abonka b’i Buyuda, maze ntabasigire amasigarira? <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Ni kuki mugomba kumuratsa n’ivyo ibikorwa vy’intoke zanyu vyamye, mu guturirira izindi mana ibimota neza muri Egiputa, aho mwaje kuba? Muzokwiyica ubwanyu muhinduke akabarore n’abo kwankwa urunuka mu mahanga yose yo kw’isi. <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Mwibagiye ibibi vyakozwe na ba sogokuruza banyu n’abami n’abamikazi b’i Buyuda no mu mayira y’i Yerusalemu? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Kugeza uwu musi ntibaricisha bugufi canke ngo batinye, canke ngo bitondere ivyagezwe vyanje n’amategeko yanje nashize imbere yanyu na ba sogokuruza banyu.<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />Nuko rero, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: Nagabiye guteza icago mwebwe no guherengeteza Abayuda bose. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Nzokuraho amasigarira y’Abayuda bafashe ingingo yo kuja muri Egiputa kubayo. Bose bazopfira muri Egiputa. Bazokwicwa n’inkota canke bicwe na kigoyi. Bazoba ibivume n’agaterasoni, abo gucirwa urubanza no kuvugirizwako agahwa. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Nzohana ababa muri Egiputa ndabahanishije inkota, ikigoyi n’icago, nk’uko nahanye Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />Nta n’umwe wo mu masigarira y’i Buyuda yagiye kuba muri Egiputa azorokoka canke ngo asigare aze agaruke i Buyuda, aho bipfuza cane kugaruka no kuba; nta n’umwe azogaruka kiretse bake mu bacitse kw’icumu.”<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Hanyuma abagabo bose bari bazi ko abagore babo bariko baraturirira ibimota neza izindi mana, hamwe n’abagore bari aho, ikoraniro rinini, n’abantu bose baba muri Egiputa mu kiyaya no mu misozi, babwira Yeremiya bati: <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />“Ntitugomba kwumva ubutumwa watubwiye mw’izina ry’Uhoraho! <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Twebwe tuzokora ivyo twavuze ko tuzokora vyose: Tuzoturirira ibimota neza Umugabekazi wo mw’ijuru kandi tuzosuka ishikanwa ry’ibinyobwa hasi ku bwiwe nk’uko twebwe na ba sogokuruza, n’abami n’abatware bacu, babikora i Buyuda no mu mayira y’i Yerusalemu. Muri ico gihe twari dufise agahimbo k’ivyokurya kandi twari tumerewe neza ata ngorane dufise. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Ariko kuva igihe twarekeye guturirira ibimota neza Umugabekazi w’Ijuru no kumushikanira amashikanwa y’ibinyobwa, nta kintu twari tugifise kandi twamazwe n’inkota n’ikigoyi.”<verse eid="JER 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Abagore bongerako bati: “Aho twaturirira ibimota neza umugabekazi wo mw’ijuru tukamushikanira ishikanwa ry’ibinyobwa, mbega abagabo bacu ntibamenye ko twakora udutsima dusa n’ishusho yiwe tukamushikanira ishikanwa ry’ibinyobwa?”<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Maze Yeremiya abwira abantu bose, abagabo n’abagore, bariko baramwishura, ati: <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“Mbega <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyibuka kandi akagarukana mu bwenge bwiwe ibimota neza vyatuririwe mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu mabarabara y’i Yerusalemu na mwebwe na ba sogokuruza banyu, abami banyu n’abatware banyu n’abantu bose bari mu gihugu? <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atari agishoboye kwihanganira ibikorwa vyanyu bibi n’ibindi bigayitse mwakoze, igihugu canyu yagihinduye umuvumo n’umusaka, ahatakigira abantu, nk’uko biri uwu musi. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Kubera ko mwatuririye ibimota neza izindi mana, mugacumura k’Uhoraho kandi ntimumwumvire ngo mwitondere ivyagezwe vyiwe canke amabwirizwa yiwe n’ivyo yihanikirije, ni co gituma iki cago caje kuri mwebwe, nk’uko mubibona uwu musi.”<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Maze Yeremiya abwira abantu bose, harimwo n’abagore, ati: “Nimwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho, yemwe bantu mwese b’i Buyuda muri muri Egiputa. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Mwebwe n’abagore banyu mwarakoze ivyo mwavuze ko muzokora muranabisezerana muti: Tuzoshitsa indahiro twarahiye yo guturira ibimota neza no gutanga ishikanwa ry’ibinyobwa ku Mugabekazi w’Ijuru.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 44:25">Nuko nimushishikare, mukore ivyo mwasezeranye! Nimushitse ivyo mwarahiye! <verse eid="JER 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />Ariko nimwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho, yemwe Bayuda mwese muba muri Egiputa: Ndahiye izina ryanje rihambaye, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ko ata n’umwe yavuye i Buyuda aho ari hose muri Egiputa azokwigera asubira kwambaza izina ryanje canke ngo arirahire ati: ‘Ndahiye Imana nzima.’ <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Kuko ndabarindiriye ngo ndabagirire nabi, si ukubagirira neza. Abayuda bari muri Egiputa bazohona n’inkota n’ikigoyi gushika aho bazoherengetezwa bose. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Abazokira inkota bagasubira mu gihugu c’i Buyuda bavuye muri Egiputa bazoba bake cane. Maze amasigarira yose y’i Buyuda yaje kuba muri Egiputa azomenya ijambo rizokwubahirizwa; na mba ari iryanje canke ari iryabo.<verse eid="JER 44:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />Iki ni co kimenyetso kuri mwebwe ko nzobahanira muri iki kibanza, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, kugira ngo mumenye ko ivyo nababwiye ko nzobagirira nabi bitazohinduka vy’ukuri. <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Ngiye gutanga Farawo Hofura umwami wa Egiputa mu maboko y’abansi biwe barondera kumwica, nk’uko natanze umwami Zedekiya w’i Buyuda mu maboko ya Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni, umwansi wiwe yarondera kumwica.’ ”<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Baruki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />Igihe Baruki mwene Neriya yandika mu muzingo amajambo uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya amubwiye, mu mwaka ugira kane umwami Yehoyakimu, mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda, ari ku ngoma, Yeremiya yabwiye Baruki ati: <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze kuri wewe Baruki: <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />Waravuze uti: ‘Ewe jewe ndagowe! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> anyongerereje imibabaro ku yo nari mfise; ncitse intege ku bwo kuniha kandi nta buruhukiro ngira.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />Ariko, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambariye ngo ndakubwire nti: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Nzosenyura ivyo nubatse kandi nzorandura ivyo nateye, mu gihugu cose. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Mbega none woba ukwiye kwironderera ibihambaye? Ntubirondere. Kuko nzoteza ivyago abantu bose, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ariko aho uzoja hose nzokiza ubugingo bwawe.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye kuri Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana ryerekeye amahanga ngo:<verse eid="JER 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />Ku vyerekeye Egiputa:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 46:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 46:2">Ubu ni bwo butumwa butumwe ku ngabo za Farawo Neko umwami wa Egiputa, zanesherejwe i Karikemishi ku ruzi Efurate na Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni, mu mwaka ugira kane Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma:<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />“Tegura inkinzo zanyu, nini na ntoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:3">maze mugende mu ntambara!<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Shira amatandiko ku mafarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">mutegure imikogote!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Fata ibibanza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">mwambare inkofero!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Karisha amacumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">mwambare ibigwanisho!<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />Mbega mbona iki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">Batekewe n’ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">basubije umugongo inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">abahizi babo baraneshejwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Bahunze isabagire</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">bataraba inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">kandi hari ibiteye ubwoba impande zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />Unyaruka cane ntashobora guhunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">kandi umunyenkomezi ntashobora gukira urugamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Mu buraruko bw’uruzi Efurate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">baratsitaye kandi baratemvye.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />Uwo ni nde ava hasi nk’uruzi Nili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:7">nk’inzuzi z’amazi asebuye?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Egiputa hahagurutse nk’uruzi Nili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">nk’inzuzi z’amazi asebuye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Haravuga ngo: ‘Nzova hasi maze nkwire isi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">nzosangangura ibisagara n’abantu bavyo.’<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Nimugende, yemwe mafarasi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Munyaruke, yemwe abagendera ku mikogote!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Nimuje imbere yemwe bahizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">bagabo b’i Kushi n’i Puti mwitwaje inkinzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">bagabo b’i Ludiya bitwaje imiheto.<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />Ariko uwo musi ni uw’Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">umusi wo kwihora, wo kwihora abansi biwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Inkota izorya gushika ihaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">gushika yimaze inyota y’amaraso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Kuko Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, azotanga ikimazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">mu gihugu co mu buraruko i ruhande y’uruzi Efurate.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />Duga uje i Gileyadi wironkere umuti wo gusomora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">yewe mukobwa wa Egiputa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Ariko ugwiriza imiti ubusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">nta gukira kuri kuri wewe.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Amahanga azokwumva ibimaramare vyawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">n’amaborogo yawe bizokwuzura isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Umuhizi azotsitara ku wundi muhizi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">bose bazogwira hasi rimwe.”<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />Ubu ni bwo butumwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabwiye Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana bwerekeye ukuza kwa Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aje gutera Egiputa:<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />“Menyesha ibi muri Egiputa, kandi ubivuge i Migidoli;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">bivuge kandi n’i Memfisi n’i Tafanihesi uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">‘Fata ibibanza mwitegure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">kuko inkota igira itabagure abagukikuje.’<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Ni kuki abahizi bawe baryamye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:15">Ntibashobora guhagarara, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobatsinda hasi.<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Bazotsitagurika kenshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">bazogwanako bahindikirane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Bazovuga bati: Va hasi dusubire inyuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">mu bacu no mu mavukiro yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">duhunge inkota y’uwuducinyiza.<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />Aho ni ho bazokwiha akamo bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">‘Umwami Farawo wa Egiputa ni akarimi gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">yahushije akaryo.’<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />‘Ni ukuri nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari muzima,’ ni ko Umwami avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">izina ryiwe ni <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">hari uwuzoza ameze nk’umusozi Tabori iyo uri hagati mu yindi misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">nka Karumeli i ruhande y’ikiyaga.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Tekera ivyawe witegurire kuja mu kinyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">wewe uba muri Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">kuko Memfisi hazosigara ari amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">kandi hazocika umusaka ata muntu ahaba.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />Egiputa ni inyana nziza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">ariko ikibugu kirayiziye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">giturutse mu buraruko.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Kandi n’abacangero bari muri bo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">bameze nk’inyana zinuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Na bo nyene bazohindukira bahunge bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">ntibazoshobora kurinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">kuko umusi w’ivyago uje kuri bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">ni igihe co guhanwa kwabo.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Egiputa hazovuza agahwa nk’inzoka ihunze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">aho umwansi azoba ariko arabegereza abakurikiye n’inkomezi nyinshi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">bazomutera bafise incabiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">nk’abantu bicira ibiti.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Bazotemera hasi ishamba ryiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">naho ari insobane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Ni benshi bameze nk’inzige,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">ntiboharurika.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Umukobwa wa Egiputa azoteterwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:24">ashirwe mu maboko y’abantu bo mu buraruko.”<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze ati: “Ngira nshitse igihano kuri Amoni imana y’i Tebesi, kuri Farawo, kuri Egiputa n’imana zaho n’abami baho, n’abizigiye Farawo. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Nzobatanga mu maboko y’abagomba kubica, ya Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni n’abakuru b’ingabo biwe. Hanyuma ariko, Egiputa hazosubira kubamwo abantu nk’uko vyahoze ubwa mbere,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />“Ntutinye, yewe Yakobo musavyi wanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">ntucike intege, yewe Isirayeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Kuko vy’ukuri nzogukiza ngukuye mu gihugu ca kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">uruvyaro rwawe ndarukuye mu gihugu bajanywemwo ari inyagano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Yakobo azosubira kugira amahoro n’umutekano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">kandi nta wuzomutera ubwoba.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Ntutinye, Yakobo musavyi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">kuko ndi kumwe na we,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">“Naho nzosangangura rwose amahanga yose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">ayo nzogusanzarizamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">wewe sinzoguherengeteza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Nzoguhana ariko mu kugororoka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">sinzokureka ngo ugende udahanywe rwose.”<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa ku Bafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />Iri ni ryo jambo ryatumwe kuri Yeremiya umuvugishwa rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryerekeye Abafilisitiya imbere y’uko Farawo atera i Gaza, ryavuga riti:<verse eid="JER 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Ehe ingene amazi asuriranije mu buraruko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">azohinduka umugezi utemba amazi menshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Azosendanisha mu gihugu no ku bintu vyose biri muri co,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">ibisagara n’ababibamwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Abantu bazoboroga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">ababa mu gihugu bose bazovuza induru<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />bumvise imirindi y’amafarasi akomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">bakumva uguhinda kw’imikogote y’umwansi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">hamwe n’uruyogoyogo rw’amaguru yayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Abavyeyi ntibazohindukira gutabara abana babo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">amaboko yabo azocika nk’imigozi.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Kuko umusi uje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">wo gutikiza Abafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">no gukuraho abacitse kw’icumu bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">boshoboye gutabara Tiro na Sidoni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yiteguye gusangangura Abafilisitiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">amasigarira yo ku kizinga c’i Kafutori.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Gaza hazokwimwesha inkomvorera ku bwo kugandara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">Ashikeloni hazozibwa akanwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Yemwe masigarira yo mu kiyaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">muzogeza ryari kwikebagura?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />‘Yo, wa nkota y’Uhoraho we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">mbega uzoruhuka ryari?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Subira mu rwubati rwawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">sigaho guma hamwe.’<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Ariko yotekereza gute?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we yayitegetse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">yarayihaye itegeko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">ryo gutera Ashikeloni n’inkengera y’ikiyaga?”<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />Ku vyerekeye Mowabu:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 48:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:1">Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">I Nebo haragowe, kuko hazosangangurwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">I Kiriyatayimu hazoteterwa hafatwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">umunara waho uzoteterwa usangangurwe.<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />I Mowabu ntihazosubira guhimbazwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">i Heshiboni ni ho abantu bazogirira inama yo kuhasenyura:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">Nimuze dukureho rirya hanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Na wewe nyene, yewe Madimeni, uzozibwa akanwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">inkota izogukurikirana.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Umve amaborogo aturutse i Horonayimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:3">amaborogo atewe n’icago gihambaye n’agatikizo.<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />I Mowabu hazovunagurwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:4">abana baho bazoboroga.<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Baduze umusozi baja i Luhiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">bagiye barira cane ingenda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">ku nzira imanuka ija i Horonayimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">amaborogo y’umubabaro kubera gusamburwa kwaho arumvikana.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Hunga! Nyaga amagara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">mumere nk’indogoba y’inyeshamba mu bugaragwa.<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />Ko mwizigiye ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu n’ubutunzi bwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">na mwebwe nyene muzofatwa mujanwe muri inyagano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">kandi n’imana yanyu Kemoshi izojanwa ari inyagano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">hamwe n’abaherezi bayo n’abatware bayo.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Uwutikiza azoza atumbereye ibisagara vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">kandi nta gisagara na kimwe kizokira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Ibiyaya bizosigara ari amatongo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">n’intara z’imirambi zizosamburwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabivuze.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Shira umunyu kuri Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">kuko hazosigara ari amatongo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">ibisagara vyaho bizohinduka imisaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">ata muntu n’umwe wo kubibamwo.<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />Aravumwe umuntu anebwa mu gikorwa c’Uhoraho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:10">Aravumwe umuntu arinda inkota yiwe ngo ntivishe amaraso!<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />“I Mowabu hamye hatekanye kuva mu buto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">nk’umuvinyu wiretse ku mvuzo zawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">utacuranuwe ngo uve mu mubindi uje mu wundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">ntihigeze hajanwa ari inyagano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Ni co catumye hadahindura uburyohe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">n’akamoto kaho ntikahindutse.<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />Ariko imisi iraje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">aho nzorungika abagabo bazi gucuranura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">kandi bazohacuranura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">bazosiga imibindi yaho igaragara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">kandi bazomenagura imikuza yaho.<verse eid="JER 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Nuko i Mowabu hazoteterwa ku bwa Kemoshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">nk’uko ab’inzu ya Isirayeli bateterewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">igihe bizigira i Beteli.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />Ni gute mushobora kuvuga muti: Turi abagwanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:14">abahizi mu ntambara?<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />I Mowabu hazosamburwa n’ibisagara vyaho bizoterwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">abasore baho bezabeza bazomanukanwa gusogotwa inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">ni ko Umwami, izina ryiwe ni <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avuze.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />Ugusangangurwa kwa Mowabu kuri hafi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:16">ivyago vyaho biraje vyihuta.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />Nimuhagandarire, mwebwe mwese muhakikije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">mwebwe mwese muzi icubahiro caho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">muvuge muti: ‘Ese ingene inkoni yo kuganza gukomeye ivunaguwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">ese ingene inkoni y’ubwiza ivunaguwe!’<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />Ururuka muve mu bwiza bwanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">mwicare mu mukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">yemwe ababa ku mukobwa w’i Diboni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">kuko uwuriko arasangangura Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">azoduga abashikire</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">maze azohindura imisaka ibisagara vyanyu bizitijwe inzitiro.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Hagarara ku nzira maze mwirabire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">mwebwe ababa i Aroweri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Mubaze umugabo ariko arahunga n’umugore ariko aranyaga amagara yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">mubabaze muti: Ni ibiki vyabaye?<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />I Mowabu harateterejwe, kuko hahinduwe amatongo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">Boroga ushire induru ku munwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Bimenyeshe uri kuri Arunoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">ko i Mowabu hasanganguwe.<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />Amateka aciriwe uturambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:21">Holoni, Yahiza na Mefayati,<verse eid="JER 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />Diboni, Nebo na Beti-Dibulatayimu,<verse eid="JER 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />Kiriyatayimu, Beti-Gamuli na Beti-Meyoni,<verse eid="JER 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />Keriyoti na Bozira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:24">ku bisagara vyose vy’i Mowabu, ivya hafi n’ivya kure.<verse eid="JER 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />Ihembe rya Mowabu rirakondotse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">ukuboko kwaho kuravunitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />Nimuhaboreze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">kuko hagararije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">Mowabu nihitembagaze mu vyo hadashwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">maze hahinduke akamenyo.<verse eid="JER 48:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />Mbega ntiwashinyaguriye Isirayeli?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">Mbega bari bafashwe bariko bariba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:27">ko wabazunguriza umutwe ubatwenga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">igihe cose wabavuga?<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />Nimuhebe ibisagara vyanyu maze muje kuba mu bitandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">mwebwe ababa i Mowabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Mumere nk’inuma yiyubakira icari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">ku munwa w’igihomoka.<verse eid="JER 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />Twarumvise ubwibone bwa Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">ubwibone bwiwe burenze urugero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">ukwishira hejuru, ubwibone, ukwirata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">n’ukwidundarika kwo mu mutima wiwe.<verse eid="JER 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />Ndazi ukwishira hejuru kwiwe ariko ni ukw’ubusa, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">kandi ukwirata kwiwe nta co kumaze.<verse eid="JER 48:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Ni co gituma mborogera Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">kubera Abanyamowabu bose ndaboroga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">ndagandaye kubera abantu b’i Kiru-Hareseti.<verse eid="JER 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Ndakuririra nk’uko Yazeri arira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">yemwe mizabibu y’i Sibuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Amashami yawe yari asagaraye gushika ku kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">yashika ku kiyaga c’i Yazeri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Uwutikiza yaguye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">ku mizabibu yawe yimbuwe.<verse eid="JER 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Umunezero n’agahimbare biraheze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">mu mirima no mu gihugu c’i Mowabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Mpagaritse ugutemba kw’umuvinyu mu bwato bugana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">nta wukigana aririmbana umunezero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Naho hari akamo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">si akamo k’umunezero.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />Ijwi ryo kuboroga kwabo riduga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">riva i Heshiboni gushika i Eliyalehi n’i Yahazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">kuva i Zowari gushika i Horonayimu n’i Egulati-Shelishiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">kuko mbere n’amazi ya Nimurimu arakamye.<verse eid="JER 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Nzoshira iherezo kuri Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">no ku batanga ibimazi ku mpinga z’imisozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">bagaturirira ibimota neza imana zabo, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 48:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />Nuko umutima wanje ucura intimba ku bwa Mowabu kurya kw’ijwi ry’umwironge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">ucura intimba nk’umwironge kubera abantu b’i Kiru-Hareseti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">Ubutunzi bwegeranijwe buraheze.<verse eid="JER 48:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Umutwe wose umowe inkomvorera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">kandi ubwanwa bwose buramowe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:37">amaboko yose arikebaguye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">kandi urukenyerero rwose rwambaye igunira.<verse eid="JER 48:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Hejuru ku mazu y’i Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">no mu bibanza bahuriramwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">nta kindi kihari atari kugandara gusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">kuko menaguye Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">nk’umubindi abantu bose bazinutswe, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 48:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />Ese ukuntu amenaguwe! Ese ukuntu baboroga!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">Ese ukuntu i Mowabu bahunze kandi bateterewe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">Mowabu hahindutse ikimaramare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">agaterantimba ku bantu bose bahakikije.<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">Raba! Inkona iriko irarara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:40">ishanje amababa yayo hejuru ya Mowabu.<verse eid="JER 48:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Keriyoti hazofatwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">n’iminara izofatwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Kuri uwo musi imitima y’abahizi b’i Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">izomera nk’umutima w’umugore ari ku gise.<verse eid="JER 48:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Mowabu hazosamburwa nk’ihanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:42">kuko bagararije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 48:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Ibiteye ubwoba n’imanga n’umutego birabarindiriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">yemwe bantu b’i Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 48:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />Uwuzohunga ibiteye ubwoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">azogwa mu manga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">uwuzokwurira ngo ave mu manga azofatwa n’umutego;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">kuko nzoshitsa kuri Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">umwaka wo guhanwa kwaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 48:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />Mu gitutu ca Heshiboni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">abahunze ni ho bahagaze batagira gitabara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">kuko umuriro uvuye i Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">urubeya ruvuye muri Sihoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">ruturira ab’i Mowabu ku ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">n’ubuhanga bw’abantu birata bayogora.<verse eid="JER 48:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Uragowe, ewe Mowabu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">Abantu ba Kemoshi bararanduwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">abana bawe bajanywe ari inyagano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">n’abakobwa bawe bajanywe mu kinyago.<verse eid="JER 48:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />Ariko nzosubira kwubaka Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">mu misi izoza,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:47">Aho ni ho amateka ya Mowabu ahereye.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />Ku vyerekeye Abamoni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:1">Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">“Mbega Abisirayeli ntibari bafise abahungu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Mbega ntibari bafise abo kuraga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">None ni kuki Moleki yigaruriye intara ya Gadi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Ni kuki abantu biwe baba mu bisagara vyaho?<verse eid="JER 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Ariko, imisi iraje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">aho nzovuza inzamba y’urugamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">rwo kugwanya i Raba ho mu Bamoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">hazohinduka ikigunguzi c’isakamburira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">kandi n’imihana ihakikuje izotongozwa umuriro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Maze Abisirayeli bazosohora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">abigeze kubasohora hanze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />Boroga, yewe Heshiboni, kuko Hayi hasanganguwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">Nimurire cane, yemwe bantu muba i Raba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Nimwambare amagunira mugandare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">nimwiruke irya n’ino muri mu nzitiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">kuko Moleki izojanwa ari inyagano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">hamwe n’abaherezi bayo n’abatware bayo.<verse eid="JER 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Ni kuki mwishimira ibiyaya vyanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">mukishimira ibiyaya vyanyu vyimbuka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Mukobwa Amoni utizigirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">wizigira ubutunzi bwawe maze ukavuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">‘Ni nde yoza kungwanya?’<verse eid="JER 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Nzoguteza ibiteye ubwoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">bivuye mu mpande zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">Umwe wese muri mwebwe azojanwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">kandi nta n’umwe azokwegeranya abahunze.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />Ariko, naho biri uko, nzosubira kwubaka Abamoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:6">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.”<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa ku Banyedomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />Ku vyerekeye Edomu:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:7">uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">“Mbega nta bwenge bukiri i Temani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Mbega inama nziza yarahonye mu banyabwenge?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Mbega ubwenge bwabo bwaguye ingese?<verse eid="JER 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Hindukira uhunge, wihishe mu binogo birebire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">wewe uba i Dedani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">kuko nzozana icago kuri Esawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">aho nzomuhanira.<verse eid="JER 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Abimbuzi b’inzabibu baje kwimbura mw’itongo iwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">mbega ntibasigaza dukeya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Ibisuma biguteye mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">mbega ntivyokwiba ivyo bikeneye vyose?<verse eid="JER 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Ariko jewe nzosiga Esawu ari gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">nzokwerekana ibibanza yinyegezamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">kandi ntazosubira kuronka aho yihisha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Abana biwe bazohona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">hamwe n’abavukanyi biwe n’ababanyi biwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">kandi ntazokwongera kubaho.<verse eid="JER 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />Siga impfuvyi zawe; nzokingira ubugingo bwazo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:11">Kandi n’abapfakazi banyu bakwiye kunyizigira.”<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Nimba abatari bakwiye kunywa ku gikombe bategerezwa kukinywako, ni kuki mwogenda mudahanywe? Ntimuzogenda mudahanywe, ariko muzotegerezwa kukinywako. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />Indahiro ni jewe nyene,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “I Bozira hazohinduka umusaka kandi hazoba akabarore, n’aho kuvuzako agahwa no kuvumwa; kandi n’ibisagara vyaho bizoba imisaka ibihe bidashira.”<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Numvise inkuru ivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">kandi intumwa yatumwe ku mahanga kuyabwira iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">“Nimwegerane muhatere!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">Nimuhaguruke muje mu ntambara!”<verse eid="JER 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />“Ubu, ngiye kukugira muto mu yandi mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:15">ube inkengerwa mu bantu bose.<verse eid="JER 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Gutera abantu ubwoba hamwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">n’ubwibone bw’umutima wawe vyaraguhenze;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">wewe wibera mu myobo yo mu bitandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">ukagerera mu mataba y’imisozi miremire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Naho wokwarika icari cawe kure nk’inkona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">nzokumanurayo, ndagukororere hasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />Edomu hazotuma abantu bajugumira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">abahaca bose bazohinda agashitsi bavuze agahwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">kubera ibikomere vyaho.<verse eid="JER 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" />Nk’uko Sodomu na Gomora hasambuwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">hamwe n’ibisagara vyari bihakikije, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">ni ko ata muntu n’umwe azosubira kuhaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">nta bantu bazosubira kukibamwo.<verse eid="JER 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />Nk’uko intare iduga iva mu bibundo vya Yorodani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">ije gutera mu buragiro butotahaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">ni ko nzokwirukana Abanyedomu ndabakure mu gihugu cabo mu kanya isase.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Ni nde yatoranijwe nzotuma kunkorera ivyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Ni nde ameze nkanje kandi ni nde yompangara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Ni uwuhe mwungere yoza kumpagarara imbere?”<verse eid="JER 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Nuko rero, nimwumve umugambi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yateguye wo kugwanya Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">n’imigabo yagize yo kugwanya ababa i Temani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">Imyagazi yo mu mikuku izojanwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">uburagiro bwabo buzoherengetezwa nk’uko vyashinzwe kuri bo.<verse eid="JER 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Isi niyumva ugutemba kwabo izojugumira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:21">ijwi ry’amaborogo yabo rizosamirana gushika ku Kiyaga Gitukura.<verse eid="JER 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Raba! Inkona izoduga maze yarare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">isanze amababa yayo kuri Bozira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">Kuri uwo musi imitima y’abahizi ba Edomu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">izoba nk’umutima w’umugore ari ku gise.<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Damasiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />Ku vyerekeye Damasiko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">“Hamati na Arupadi batekewe n’ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">kuko bumvise inkuru mbi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Bahagaritse umutima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">babuze uburagamo nk’ikiyaga gisuriranya.<verse eid="JER 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Damasiko hahindutse nk’umunyantegenke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">hahindukiye inyuma harahunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">kandi hafashwe n’ubwoba bwinshi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">umubabaro n’agahinda birabafashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">uburibwe nk’ubw’umugore ari ku gise.<verse eid="JER 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Ni kuki ico gisagara rurangiranwa kitahebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:25">igisagara nanezererwa?<verse eid="JER 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />Ni ukuri, abasore baho bazogwa mu mabarabara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">abasoda baho bose bazozibwa akanwa kuri uwo musi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="JER 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />“Nzodomeka inzitiro z’i Damasiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:27">maze umuriro uzotongora iminara ya Beni-Hadadi.”<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Kedari na Hazori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Ku vyerekeye Kedari n’ubwami bw’i Hazori, ubwo Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yateye:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:28" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:28">Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">“Haguruka, utere Kedari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:28">kandi uherengeteze abantu bo mu buseruko.<verse eid="JER 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Amahema yabo n’imikuku yabo bizonyagwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">insago zabo zizonyagwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">hamwe n’ibirimwo vyose n’ingamiya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Abantu bazokwiha akamo bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">Iterabwoba riri impande zose!<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />Hunga ningoga!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">Guma mu masenga, yemwe ababa i Hazori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yagiye inama yo kukugirira nabi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">agufitiye umugambi mubi.<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />Haguruka utere ihanga ryari ryiraramiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">bari bazi ko bibereye mu mutekano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">ihanga ritagira amarembo canke imyugariro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">abantu baho bibera ukwabo.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />Ingamiya zabo zizoba isahu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">amasho yabo manini azoba iminyago y’intambara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Nzosanzariza mu birere vyose abimosha ibimwerere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">kandi nzobateza ivyago bivuye mu mpande zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />Hazori hazoba ikirimbiro ry’imbwebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">ahantu h’ubugaragwa ibihe vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Nta muntu n’umwe azoba akihaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">nta bantu bazongera kuhaba.”<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Elamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Iri ni ijambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye kuri Yeremiya uwavugishwa n’Imana ryerekeye Elamu, mu ntango y’ingoma ya Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda:<verse eid="JER 49:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">“Raba, nzovuna umuheto wa Elamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:35">ari wo nkomezi zabo.<verse eid="JER 49:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Nzoteza Elamu imiyaga ine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">ivuye mu mfuruka zine z’amajuru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">nzobasanzaza ku miyaga ine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">kandi nta hanga na rimwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">ritazojamwo abahunze bava i Elamu.<verse eid="JER 49:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Nzosanzaza Elamu imbere y’abansi babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">imbere y’abipfuza kubica;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">nzobateza ivyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">ndetse n’uburake bwanje bw’inkazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">Nzobakinagiza n’inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">kugeza ndabaherengeteje.<verse eid="JER 49:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Nzoshinga intebe yanje y’ubwami i Elamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:38">ndandure umwami waho n’abatware baho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:38">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 49:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />Ariko nzosubira kwubaka Elamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">mu misi izoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.”<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa kuri Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />Iri ni ijambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavugiye mu kanwa k’uwo yavugisha Yeremiya ryerekeye Babiloni n’igihugu c’Abanyababiloni:<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Menyesha kandi wamamaze mu mahanga yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">duza ibendera kandi uvyamamaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">ntihagire ico usiga, ariko uvuge uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">‘Babiloni hazofatwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">Beli hazomaramazwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">Mariduki huzure ubwoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Ibishushanyo vyaho bizomaramazwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">n’ibigirwamana vyaho bije mu gatengo.<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />Ihanga riturutse mu buraruko rizohatera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">risige igihugu ari amatongo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">Nta muntu n’umwe azoba akihaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">abantu n’ibikoko bizohahunga vyose.’<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />Muri iyo misi, kandi muri ico gihe, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">abantu b’i Bwisirayeli n’abantu b’i Buyuda bose hamwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">bazogenda barira baja kurondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo.<verse eid="JER 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Bazobaririkiza inzira ija i Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">maze bayihindukirire bayijane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">Bazoza bunamire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">bari mw’isezerano ritazoshira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">ritazokwigera ryibagirwa.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />Abantu banje babaye intama zizimiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">abungere babo barabazimije</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">batuma bangarira ku misozi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Bangariye ku misozi no ku mirambi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">bibagira uburuhukiro bwabo.<verse eid="JER 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Uwababonye wese yarabashihaguye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">abansi babo baravuze bati: ‘Nta caha twagirizwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">kuko bacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uburuhukiro bwabo bw’ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ivyizigiro vya ba sekuruza.’<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />Nimuhunge muve i Babiloni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">nimuve mu gihugu c’Abanyababiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">maze mumere nk’impene zirongora umukuku.<verse eid="JER 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Kuko nzovyura kandi ngateza Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">amahanga ahambaye yishize hamwe aturutse mu gihugu co mu buraruko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Bazobundira kuhatera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">kandi hazofatwa n’abaturutse mu buraruko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Imyampi yabo izoba imeze nk’abahizi b’abahinga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">badasubira inyuma imbokoboko.<verse eid="JER 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Nuko Babiloni hazonyagwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">abazobanyaga bose bazokwegeranya buzuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />Kubera ko munezerewe kandi muhimbawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">mwebwe mwanyaze ishamvu yanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">kubera ko mwikina amatavu nk’inyana mu bwatsi butotahaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">kandi muvuza akamo nk’amafarasi;<verse eid="JER 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />nyoko azoteterwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">uwakwibarutse azoterwa n’isoni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Azoba uwo hanyuma mu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">ubugaragwa, igihugu cumye, n’ubweranyange.<verse eid="JER 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />Kubera uburake bw’Uhoraho, nta wuzoshobora kuhaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">ariko hazoba ari agahinga gusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Abazoca i Babiloni bose bazofatwa n’ubwoba kandi bazokwitwengera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">kubera ibikomere vyaho.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />Nimukikuze Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">yemwe mwese mufoye imiheto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Nimuharase! Ntimuziganye imyampi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">kuko hacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Nimuhahe akamo ku mpande zose!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">Haratanze imihoho, iminara yaho iraguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">inzitiro zaho zihomvokeye hasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Kubera ko ari uguhora kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">nimuhihore;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">nimuhakorere nk’uko hakoreye abandi.<verse eid="JER 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Nimukure i Babiloni uwubiba imbuto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">n’uwukoresha umuhoro mu gihe c’iyimbura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Kubera inkota y’uwucinyiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">umuntu wese nasubire mu bwoko bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">umuntu wese nahungire mu gihugu ciwe.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />Isirayeli ni umukuku wasanzaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">uwo intambwe zahize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">Uwa mbere yawushihaguye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">ni umwami w’i Ashuri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">uwa nyuma yawuvunaguye amagufa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">ni Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni.”<verse eid="JER 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Nuko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:18">“Nzohana umwami w’i Babiloni n’igihugu ciwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:18">nk’uko nahanye umwami w’i Ashuri.<verse eid="JER 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Ariko nzogarukana Isirayeli mu buragiro bwiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">azorisha kuri Karumeli n’i Bashani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:19">azoshira inzara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">ari ku misozi ya Efurayimu n’i Gileyadi.<verse eid="JER 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Muri iyo misi, muri ico gihe,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">“bazorondera ivyo gutsindisha Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">ariko ntihazoboneka na kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">barondere n’ivyaha vya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">ariko nta na kimwe kizoboneka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">kuko nzoharira amasigarira nzoziguriza.<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />Nimutere igihugu ca Meratayimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">n’ababa i Pekodi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Nimubakurikire, mubice kandi mubaherengeteze,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">Nimukore ivyo nabageze vyose.<verse eid="JER 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Akaruru k’intambara kari mu gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:22">ijwi ryo gusambuka gukomeye!<verse eid="JER 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Mbega ukuntu isambutse igacika ubunywenye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">ya nyundo yahonda isi yose!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Ese ukuntu Babiloni habaye amatongo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">mu yandi mahanga!<verse eid="JER 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Naguteze umutego, yewe Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">maze ufatwa utarabimenya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">bagusanzeho baragufata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">kuko wagwanije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yuguruye ububiko bwiwe bw’ibigwanisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">asohora ibigwanisho vy’uburake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose afise ico ashaka gukora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">mu gihugu c’Abanyababiloni.<verse eid="JER 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Nimuze kumugwanya muvuye kure.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">Nimumene ibigega vyiwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">nimuharundanye nk’ibigunguzi vy’imiganda y’ingano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Nimuhasangangure</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">ntimuhasige n’umwe w’amasigarira.<verse eid="JER 50:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Nimwice amashuri yaho yose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">nibamanuke baje ku macuniro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Baragowe! Kuko umusi wabo ushitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">igihe cabo co guhanwa.<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />Nimwumvirize abahunga hamwe n’impunzi zivuye i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">bavugira i Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">ingene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yahoye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">ahora Ingoro yiwe.<verse eid="JER 50:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />“Tumako abanyamiheto baze kugwanya Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">abo bose bitwaje imiheto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Nimuhakikuze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">ntihagire uwubacika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Nimuhasubirize mu nkoko ivyo hakoze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">nimuhakorere nk’ivyo hakoze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Kuko hagararije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="JER 50:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Ni co gituma, abasore baho bazogwa mu mabarabara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">abasoda baho bose bazozibwa akanwa kuri uwo musi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />“Ehe, ndakugwanya, wa munyabwibone we,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">ni ko Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">“kuko umusi wawe ushitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">igihe cawe co guhanwa.<verse eid="JER 50:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Uwibona azotsitara agwe hasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">kandi nta wuzomuvyura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">Nzodomeka umuriro mu bisagara vyaho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">uzotongora ahantu hose hahakikije.”<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">“Abisirayeli baracinyijwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">n’Abayuda ni uko nyene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">Ababafashe mpiri bose barabagumije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">banse kubarekura.<verse eid="JER 50:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Ariko umucunguzi wabo arakomeye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo zina ryiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">Azobagwanira bikomeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">kugira ngo ahe akaruhuko igihugu cabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">ariko azobuza uburagamo ababa i Babiloni.<verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />Inkota ije kugwanya Abanyababiloni!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">kugwanya ababa i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">no kugwanya abaganwa baho n’abanyabwenge baho!<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />Inkota ije kugwanya abavugishwa baho b’ibinyoma!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Bazoba ibipfu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Inkota ije kugwanya abahizi baho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Bazofatwa n’ubwoba.<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Inkota ije kugwanya amafarasi n’imikogote yaho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">n’abanyamahanga bivanze na bo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Bazohinduka abanyantegenke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Inkota ije kugwanya ubutunzi bwaho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Buzonyagwa.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Uruzuba ruziye amazi yaho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">Azokama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Kuko ari igihugu c’ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">ibigirwamana bizogwara mu mutwe kubera ibiteye ubwoba.<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />Ni co gituma ibikoko vyo mu bugaragwa n’imfyisi bizokwiberaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">n’ibinyoni vyitwa otirishe bizohagira inzu yavyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">Ntihazosubira kuba abantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">canke ngo bahabe uhereye ku runganwe ugashika ku rundi.<verse eid="JER 50:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" />Nk’uko nasambuye Sodomu na Gomora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">hamwe n’ibisagara vyari bihakikije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ivuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:40">ni ko ata muntu n’umwe azosubira kuhaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">nta bantu bazosubira kukibamwo.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />Raba! Ingabo ziraje zivuye mu gihugu co mu buraruko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">ihanga rikomeye n’abami benshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">barahagurutse bavuye ku mpera z’isi.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Bitwaje imiheto n’amacumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">bateye ubwoba kandi ni ba ruburakigongwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Akamo kabo, bariko bariruka ku mafarasi yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">ni nk’ukubomborana kw’ikiyaga gisuriranya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Baje kurya kw’abagabo bariko barimenyereza intambara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">ngo bagutere, yewe mukobwa w’i Babiloni.<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Umwami w’i Babiloni yumvise inkuru zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">amaboko yiwe yaciye acika inkokora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Umubabaro uramufata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">umubabaro nk’urya w’umugore ariko aravyara.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />Nk’uko intare iduga iva mu bibundo vya Yorodani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">ije gutera mu buragiro butotahaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">ni ko nzokwirukana ab’i Babiloni ndabakure mu gihugu cabo mu kanya isase.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Ni nde yatoranijwe nzotuma kunkorera ivyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Ni nde ameze nkanje kandi ni nde yompangara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Kandi ni uwuhe mwungere yoza kumpagarara imbere?<verse eid="JER 50:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Nuko rero, nimwumve umugambi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yateguye wo kugwanya Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">n’imigabo yagize yo kugwanya igihugu c’Abanyababiloni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">Imyagazi yo mu mikuku izojanwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">uburagiro bwabo buzoherengetezwa nk’uko vyashinzwe kuri bo.<verse eid="JER 50:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Isi niyumva urwamo rw’ugufatwa kwa Babiloni izojugumira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:46">ijwi ry’amaborogo yaho rizosamirana mu mahanga.<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">“Raba, nzokabura impwemu y’uwuhonya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:1">ngo atere Babiloni n’abantu b’i Lebi Kamayi.<verse eid="JER 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Nzotuma abanyamahanga kuri Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">ngo bahagosore kandi batabagure igihugu caho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">bazohatera baturutse ku mpande zose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">ku musi w’ivyago vyaho.<verse eid="JER 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Ntimureke umurashi ngo afore umuheto wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">canke ngo mumwemerere kwambara ibigwanisho vyiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Ntimuzigurize abasore baho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">nimusangangure ingabo zaho.<verse eid="JER 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Bazogwa basogoswe inkota i Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:4">bazokomereka uruguma rwo kubica bari mu mabarabara yaho.<verse eid="JER 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />Kuko Isirayeli na Yuda batahebwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">n’Imana yabo, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">naho igihugu cabo cuzuye ivyaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">mu nyonga z’Uwera w’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JER 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />Nimuhunge muve i Babiloni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Nimwiruke mukize amagara yanyu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Ntimupfe muzize ivyaha vyaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Ni igihe co guhora kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">azohasubiriza mu nkoko ibihakwiye.<verse eid="JER 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />Babiloni hari hameze nk’igikombe c’inzahabu mu kiganza c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">haboreje isi yose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Amahanga yaborewe umuvinyu waho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">ni co gituma yataye umutwe.<verse eid="JER 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babiloni hazogwa giturumbuka kandi hazomenagurika.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">Nimuhaborogere!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Nimuharonderere umuti wo kuhatimbura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">kumbure hokira.<verse eid="JER 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />Twari kuvura Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">ariko ntihashobora kuvurwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">reka tuhave umwe wese yigire mu gihugu ciwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">kuko amateka yaho yashikiriye ibicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">kandi akaba yaduze agashikira amajuru.<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araduhoye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">nimuze tuvugire i Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yakoze.<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />Nimusongore imyampi yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">muhitane inkinzo zanyu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakabuye abami b’Abamedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">kuko umugambi wiwe ari uwo kurandura Babiloni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azohora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">azohorera Ingoro yiwe.<verse eid="JER 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Nimuduze ibendera ryo kugwanya inzitiro z’i Babiloni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">Ongereza abarinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">shiraho abateramyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">nimutegure imitego!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoshitsa umugambi wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">ivyo yategetse ku bantu b’i Babiloni.<verse eid="JER 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />Wewe uba i ruhande y’amazi menshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">kandi ufise ubutunzi bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">iherezo ryawe rirashitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">n’igihe cawe co kugesezwa.<verse eid="JER 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yirahiye ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">Nzokwuzuzamwo ingabo zimeze kurya kw’inzige,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">kandi zizokwiha akamo ko kukunesha.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />Yaremye isi mu bushobozi bwayo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">iremesha isi ubwenge bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">yagura amajuru mu gutahura kwayo.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Iyo ituragaye, amazi yo hejuru aca abomborana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">ituma ibicu biduga biva ku mpera z’isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Irungika umuravyo n’imvura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">igasohora umuyaga iwukuye mu bubiko bwayo.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />Umuntu wese ni ikijuju nta bwenge agira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">umucuzi w’inzahabu wese naterwe isoni n’ibigirwamana vyiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Kuko ibishushanyo vyiwe ari ibinyoma gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">nta mpwemu y’ubuzima iri muri vyo.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Nta co bimaze, ni ivyo gukengerwa gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:18">igihe c’urubanza rwavyo nicashika, bizohona.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Ariko wa wundi, we mugabane wa Yakobo, ntameze nka vyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">kuko ari Umuremyi w’ibintu vyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">harimwo n’abantu yagize inyegu yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo zina ryiwe.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />Wambereye inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">n’ikigwanisho c’intambara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">ni wewe nasanganguje amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">ni wewe nasambuje ubwami,<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />ni wewe nasanganguje ifarasi n’uwuyigenderako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:21">ni wewe nasanganguje umukogote n’uwuwutwara;<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />ni wewe natabaguje umugabo n’umugore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">ni wewe natabaguje umutama n’umusore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">ni wewe natabaguje umusore n’inkumi,<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />ni wewe natabaguje umwungere n’umukuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">ni wewe natabaguje umurimyi n’inka zirima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">ni wewe natabaguje abarongozi n’abatware.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />Imbere y’amaso yanyu nzosubiriza mu nkoko Babiloni n’ababa mu Bukaludaya bose ibibi bakoze i Siyoni, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 51:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />Mfise ico dupfa nawe, yewe wa musozi uhonya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">wewe uhonya isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">Nzogororera ukuboko kwanje kukugwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">nzogutembagaza ndagukuye hejuru y’ibitandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">ndaguhindure nk’umusozi waturiwe.<verse eid="JER 51:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />Nta buye na rimwe rizokurwa kuri wewe ngo ribe irigumya imfuruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">canke ibuye na rimwe ryo kwubaka itanguriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">kuko uzoba uri nk’ubugaragwa ibihe vyose, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />Nimuduze ibendera mu gihugu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Nimuvuze inzamba mu mahanga yose!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Nimutegure amahanga aje kuhagwanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">tumako ubu bwami buze kuhagwanya:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Ararati, Mini na Ashikenazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Nimushinge umukuru w’ingabo aze kuhatera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">nimurungike amafarasi ameze nk’igitero c’inzige.<verse eid="JER 51:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Nimutegurire amahanga intambara yo kuhagwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">abami b’Abamedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">abategetsi babo n’abatware babo bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">n’ibihugu vyose baganza.<verse eid="JER 51:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Igihugu kirajugumira kandi cuzuye ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">kuko imigambi yo kukigwanya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakigeneye itazohinduka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">kugira ngo Babiloni hasigare ari agahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">ata muntu n’umwe agishobora kuhaba.<verse eid="JER 51:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Abahizi b’i Babiloni baretse kugwana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">bagumye mu bibundo bikomeye vyabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Inkomezi zabo zaheze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">babaye nk’abagore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Amazu yaho yadometswe n’umuriro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">ibihindizo vyo ku marembo yaho vyavunaguwe.<verse eid="JER 51:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Abazanye inkuru barakurakuranwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">umwe akurikira uwundi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">ngo bamenyeshe umwami w’i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">ko igisagara caho cose cafashwe,<verse eid="JER 51:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />amajabukiro y’uruzi yafashwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">inkombe z’uruzi zaturiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">abasoda batekewe n’ubwoba.”<verse eid="JER 51:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">“Umukobwa w’i Babiloni ameze nk’imbuga yo kugosorerako ingano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">mu gihe co kuyisiribanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">igihe co kuhimbura kigira gishike.”<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />“Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yaradushihaguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">yadutaye mu kuzazanirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">yaduhinduye nk’umubindi ugaragara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Nk’uko inzoka imira miyonzwa, ni ko yatumize ataduhekenye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">yujuje inda yiwe ivyiza vyacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">maze adushiburira hanze.<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Icoduha ubwicanyi bwabaye kuri twebwe bugashika kuri Babiloni,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">ni ko ababa i Siyoni bavuga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">“Ese amaraso yacu yoba ku baba i Babiloni,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">ni ko Yerusalemu bavuga.<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Nuko rero, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">“Raba, nzobaburanira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">kandi nzobahora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">nzokamya ikiyaga cabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">n’amasoko yaho nzoyakamya.<verse eid="JER 51:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Babiloni hazoba imisaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">ahaba imbwebwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">akabarore n’aho gucokorwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">ahantu ata muntu akihaba.<verse eid="JER 51:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />Abantu baho baroha nk’imikangara y’intambwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:38">bivuga nk’ivyana vy’intambwe bikiri bito.<verse eid="JER 51:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Ariko aho bamaze kururumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">nzobategurira umusi mukuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">ndababoreze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">kugira ngo bashire urwamo hejuru batwenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">hanyuma bazosinzira ubutikoma ibihe vyose,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 51:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />Nzobamanukana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">nk’imyagazi y’intama ijanwa kwicwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">nk’impfizi z’intama n’impene.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />Ese ukuntu Sheshaki hazofatwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">ukwirata kw’isi yose kurafashwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Ese ukuntu Babiloni hazoba akabarore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">mu mahanga yose!<verse eid="JER 51:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Ikiyaga kizohagurukira Babiloni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:42">imipfunda yaco ibomborana izohatwikira.<verse eid="JER 51:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Ibisagara vyaho bizocika ubweranyange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">isi yumye y’ubugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">igihugu ata n’umwe akibamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">ata muntu n’umwe agicamwo.<verse eid="JER 51:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Nzohana Beli h’i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">nzotuma hadahwa ivyo hamize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Amahanga ntazosubira kuhirukira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">Kandi inzitiro z’i Babiloni zizosenyuka.<verse eid="JER 51:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />Nimusohoke muveyo, yemwe bantu banje!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Nimuhunge mukize amagara yanyu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Nimuhunge uburake bw’inkazi bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JER 51:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Ntimuzocike intege canke ngo mugire ubwoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">aho muzokwumvira ibihuha mu gihugu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">igihuha kimwe kiza uwu mwaka, ikindi mu mwaka uza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">ibihuha vy’ubwicanyi mu gihugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">n’ivy’uwuganza agwanya uwundi.<verse eid="JER 51:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />Kuko igihe kizogera vy’ukuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">aho nzohana ibigirwamana vy’i Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">igihugu caho cose kizoteterwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">kandi abishwe baho bazorambarara mu mabarabara.<verse eid="JER 51:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />Maze ijuru n’isi n’ibiri muri vyo vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">bizovuza akamo k’umunezero ku bwa Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">kuko mu buraruko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">ni ho hazova abahonya bo kuhatera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 51:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />I Babiloni hazofatwa mpiri kubera ubwicanyi bakoze mu Bisirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">n’ubwo bakoze mw’isi yose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">ni ko bizomera no kuri Babiloni.<verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Wewe wakize inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">va ngaha ntutebagane!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Wibuke <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uri mu gihugu ca kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">kandi wiyumvire kuri Yerusalemu.<verse eid="JER 51:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />Turateterewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">kuko twaratutswe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">isoni ziratwishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">kuko abanyamahanga binjiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">ahera h’Ingoro y’Uhoraho.<verse eid="JER 51:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />Ariko imisi iraje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">aho nzohana ibigirwamana vyaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">kandi mu gihugu cose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">abakomeretse bazoboroga.<verse eid="JER 51:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Naho Babiloni hoshika kw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">hagakomeza inzitiro zaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">nzorungika abo kuhasambura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />Ijwi ry’ugutaka rije riva i Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">ijwi ry’ugutikiza gukomeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">riva mu gihugu c’Abanyababiloni.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosambura i Babiloni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">azozivya akanwa kavuza urwamo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Imipfunda y’abansi izosuriranya nk’amazi menshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">ugusuriranya kwayo kuzokwumvikana.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Uwutikiza azoza ku bwa Babiloni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">abahizi baho bazofatwa mpiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">n’imiheto yabo izovunagurwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari Imana ihora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">azobasubiriza mu nkoko ibihwanye n’ivyo bakoze.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Nzoboreza abatware n’abanyabwenge baho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">abatware baho, abakuru n’abagwanyi baho na bo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">bazosinzira ubutikoma ibihe bidashira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">ni ko Umwami, izina ryiwe ni <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avuze.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">“Uruzitiro rw’intimba nini rw’i Babiloni ruzosamburwa rwose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">n’amarembo yaho maremare azoturirwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Abantu biruhiriza ubusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">ubutame bw’amahanga buzoba ibitoro vy’imbeya z’umuriro.”<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Ubu ni bwo butumwa Yeremiya yahaye umukuru w’abakozi Seraya mwene Neriya, mwene Mahaseya, igihe yaja i Babiloni ari kumwe na Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda mu mwaka ugira kane ari ku ngoma. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Yeremiya yari yanditse igitabu kirimwo ivyago bizoshika kuri Babiloni, ivyari vyaranditswe vyerekeye Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Abwira Seraya ati: “Niwashika i Babiloni, uze witwararike gusomerayo aya majambo yose n’ijwi rirenga. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Maze uze uvuge uti: ‘Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, waravuze ko uzosangangura aha hantu, ku buryo ata muntu canke igikoko kizoshobora kuhaba; hazoba agahinga ibihe vyose.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" />Maze niwaheza gusoma iki gitabu, uze ugihambirireko ibuye maze ugiterere mu ruzi Efurate. <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />Hanyuma uvuge uti: ‘Uko ni ko Babiloni hazonyika ubutakigaruka kubera ivyago nzohateza, kandi abantu baho bazohona.’ ”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 51:64" />
  <para style="b" vid="JER 51:64" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Amajambo ya Yeremiya agarukiye aha.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s1">I Yerusalemu hasamburwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Zedekiya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’umwe igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Hamutali mwene Yeremiya w’i Libuna. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko Yehoyakimu yakoze. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Ivyo vyose vyashikiye Yerusalemu n’Ubuyuda kubera uburake bw’Uhoraho bwari bwaziririnze, akirukana abantu biwe mu maso hiwe. Maze Zedekiya agarariza umwami w’i Babiloni.<verse eid="JER 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" />Nuko, mu mwaka ugira icenda Zedekiya ari ku ngoma, ku musi ugira cumi w’ukwezi kw’icumi, Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aja gutera Yerusalemu ajanye n’ingabo ziwe zose. Bacumbika inyuma y’igisagara, bacubakira ivyo kwuririrako ku mpande zose. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Igisagara kiguma cugarijwe gushika mu mwaka ugira cumi na rimwe Zedekiya ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="JER 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Ku musi ugira icenda w’ukwezi kwa kane inzara iba nyinshi mu gisagara gushika aho abantu babura ico batamira. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Nuko uruzitiro rw’igisagara bararusatura, maze ingabo zose zirahunga. Bava mu gisagara mw’ijoro baca mw’irembo riri hagati y’ibihome bibiri hafi y’umurima w’umwami, naho Abanyababiloni bari bakikuje igisagara. Bahunga berekeye ikiyaya ca Yorodani citwa Araba, <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Ariko ingabo z’Abanyababiloni zikurikira umwami Zedekiya zimufatira mu kiyaya c’i Yeriko. Abasoda biwe bose baramuta, barasanzara. <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />Nuko na we aca arafatwa, bamujana ku mwami w’i Babiloni yari i Ribula mu ntara y’i Hamati, aca amucira urubanza aho nyene. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Umwami w’i Babiloni yicira abahungu ba Zedekiya mu maso yiwe; yongera yica n’abatware bose b’i Buyuda akiri aho nyene i Ribula. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" />Aca anogora amaso Zedekiya, amubohesha iminyororo y’umwakaka, aca amujana i Babiloni, amushira mw’ibohero kugeza umusi yapfiriyeko.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />Ku musi ugira icumi w’ukwezi kwa gatanu, mu mwaka ugira icumi n’icenda Nebukadineza ari umwami w’i Babiloni, ni ho Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, akaba n’umwishikira w’umwami w’i Babiloni, yashika i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />Aturira Ingoro y’Uhoraho, ikirimba c’umwami, hamwe n’ayandi mazu yose yari i Yerusalemu. Inyubakwa zose zihambaye zo mu gisagara araziturira. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Abasoda bose b’i Babiloni bari barongowe n’uwo mukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, baraza basenyura inzitiro zose z’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Nebuzaradani, umukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba, ajana mu kinyago bamwe mu bakene, hamwe n’abari bagisigaye mu gisagara, abanyamyuga hamwe n’abari barishikanye ku mwami w’i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Ariko Nebuzaradani asiga bamwe mu bakene bo mu gihugu ngo bakorere imizabibu n’imirima.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />Abanyababiloni basenyura za nkingi z’umwakaka hamwe na ca gikarabiro c’umwakaka n’ivyo cari giteretseko vyari mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho, batwara n’umwakaka wabo wose i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Batwara n’udukono two kuyoreramwo umunyota, ivyo kuyoza umunyota, ibikombe, amabesani, amapanu, hamwe n’ibindi bikoresho vyose vy’umwakaka, vyakoreshwa mu Ngoro. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Uwo mukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba atwara ibikoresho vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu nziza vyose no mw’ifeza, harimwo amabesani, ivyo guturirirako ibimota neza, inkono, ibiterekwako amatara, amasahani n’ibikombe vyakoreshwa mu gutanga amashikanwa y’ibinyobwa.<verse eid="JER 52:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Umwakaka wavuye muri za nkingi zibiri, ca gikarabiro bita ikiyaga na ya mashuri icumi n’abiri acuzwe mu mwakaka yari musi yaco, na vya bitereko biterurwa, ivyo umwami Salomo yari yarakoze ngo bibe ivyo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, vyari biremereye cane ku buryo bitashobora gupimwa ku munzane. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Inkingi imwe yose yapima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi n’umunani z’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi na zibiri zo kuzunguruka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 8,1 z’uburebure n’imetero 5,4 z’inkikuro.</char></note>; imwimwe yose yari ikirohori, kandi yari ifise intimbatimba ingana n’isantimetero umunani. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Umwashi w’umwakaka wari hejuru y’inkingi imwe wareha n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note> z’uburebure ukaba usharijweko amakomamanga y’umwakaka awukikuje. Ku yindi nkingi, hari uwundi ufise amakomamanga yawo nk’uko nyene. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Amakomamanga mirongo icenda ku mpande, igitigiri cose c’amakomamanga cari hejuru ya rwa rusobekerane cari ijana.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Uwo mukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba agira imbohe Seraya umuherezi mukuru, Zefaniya umuherezi wa kabiri hamwe n’abarinzi b’irembo batatu. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Mu bari basigaye mu gisagara, atwara intwazangabo yatwara abasoda baja ku rugamba hamwe n’abahanuzi indwi b’umwami, atwara n’umunyamabanga yari ajejwe kwinjiza abantu mu gisoda, hamwe n’abandi bantu mirongo itandatu yasanze mu gisagara hagati. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Iyo ntwazangabo Nebuzaradani ica ifata ba bantu bose ibashira umwami w’i Babiloni i Ribula. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Aca abicira aho nyene i Ribula mu ntara y’i Hamati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:27">Uko ni ko Abayuda batwawe mu kinyago, bakurwa mu gihugu cabo.<verse eid="JER 52:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" />Iki ni co gitigiri c’abantu Nebukadineza yajanye ari inyagano:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:28" />
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 52:28">mu mwaka ugira indwi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:28">Abayuda ibihumbi bitatu na mirongo ibiri na batatu;<verse eid="JER 52:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi n’umunani Nebukadineza ari ku ngoma,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:29">abavuye i Yerusalemu bari amajana umunani na mirongo itatu na babiri;<verse eid="JER 52:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />mu mwaka wiwe wa mirongo ibiri na gatatu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:30">Abayuda amajana indwi na mirongo ine na batanu bajanywe ari inyagano na Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zarinda umwami.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:30" />
  <para style="lf" vid="JER 52:30">Bose hamwe bari ibihumbi bine n’amajana atandatu.<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoyakini arekurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu n’indwi Yehoyakini umwami w’i Buyuda ari mu kinyago, umwaka Evili-Merodaki yimikiwemwo ngo abe umwami w’i Babiloni, ku musi wa mirongo ibiri na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’icumi na kabiri, ni ho yarekura Yehoyakini ava mw’ibohero. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Amufata neza, amuha n’ikibanza c’icubahiro gisumba ivy’abandi bami bari kumwe na we i Babiloni. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Nuko Yehoyakini ntiyasubira kwambara impuzu z’imbohe, kandi yama asangira n’umwami ku meza yiwe imisi yose yari asigaje y’ukubaho kwiwe. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Umwami w’i Babiloni yama aha Yehoyakini ku musi ku musi ivyo kumutunga imisi yose yari akiriho, kugeza ku musi yapfiriyeko.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>